ments are on the rise in Belgium, Scotland and Spain. What are the legal, political and economic implications of secession in these regions and the European Union?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/roomfordebate/2012/10/31/dealing-with-secession-in-europe/', 'snippet': 'Independence movements are on the rise in Belgium, Scotland and Spain. What are the legal, political and economic implications of secession in these regions and the European Union?', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dealing With Secession in Europe', 'kicker': 'Room for Debate', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-01T00:43:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8434c046-40cf-54ba-bc3c-5e543a6858b4', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8434c046-40cf-54ba-bc3c-5e543a6858b4'}, {'abstract': 'The campaign of Richard Tisei is running a different kind of ad in Massachusetts, a break for voters from the usual campaigns.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/10/31/in-massachusetts-a-break-from-the-usual-campaign-ads/', 'snippet': 'The campaign of Richard Tisei is running a different kind of ad in Massachusetts, a break for voters from the usual campaigns.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — At first, the newest advertisement from the Republican fighting to wrest Massachusetts’s 6th Congressional District from its Democratic incumbent seems like any one of the ads that run almost endlessly here, either for this race or the tight Senate contest between Senator Scott P. Brown and Elizabeth Warren. Peppy music plays over a photograph of the candidate, Richard Tisei, who tells viewers, once again, that he approves this message.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'mai