 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c88ad70c-0cba-5fc8-b475-22917dfff9a5', 'word_count': 1176, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c88ad70c-0cba-5fc8-b475-22917dfff9a5'}, {'abstract': 'With some commutes into the city taking three hours, New Yorkers clung to news that some subway and rail service would be restored on Thursday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/01/nyregion/new-yorkers-cling-to-hope-of-a-better-commute.html', 'snippet': 'With some commutes into the city taking three hours, New Yorkers clung to news that some subway and rail service would be restored on Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With commutes that took hours, half-mile lines at suburban gas stations and city buses stuffed beyond capacity, the transportation systems in most of the region slowed to a crawl on Wednesday, amid promises that some subway and commuter rail services would be restored by the Thursday morning commute.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/01/nyregion/JPCOMMUTE/JPCOMMUTE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/01/nyregion/JPCOMMUTE/JPCOMMUTE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/01/nyregion/JPCOMMUTE/JPCOMMUTE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 653, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/01/nyregion/JPCOMMUTE/JPCOMMUTE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1306, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'ca