been a part of two national championship teams.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/01/sports/ncaafootball/at-alabama-ben-howell-never-walked-away-from-his-chance.html', 'snippet': 'Ben Howell, a walk-on at Alabama who is now second string on both the kickoff and punt return teams for his senior season, has been a part of two national championship teams.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TUSCALOOSA, Ala. — Twenty miles to the northwest, in Gordo, Ala., long days awaited Ben Howell. He would help feed chickens — 135,000 of them — and tag calves on his father’s 250-acre farm. In the afternoon he would play football, and at night, baseball.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/01/sports/y-TIDE/y-TIDE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/01/sports/y-TIDE/y-TIDE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/01/sports/y-TIDE/y-TIDE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/01/sports/y-TIDE/y-TIDE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/01/sports/y-TIDE/y-TIDE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Prizing the Tide, a Local Player Fulfills a Dream', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Prizing the Tide, A Local Player Fulfills a