the size of its budget spilled into the British parliament where rebel legislators handed Prime Minister David Cameron a Halloween night defeat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — It was a terrible night for David Cameron, the British prime minister, but a great night for headline writers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Fright Night’ for Cameron on European Budget', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cameron, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Commission', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-01T11:53:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Harvey Morris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Harvey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Morris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0c0ba379-d97b-5fed-bc0a-4b0da78aa570', 'word_count': 586, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0c0ba379-d97b-5fed-bc0a-4b0da78aa570'}, {'abstract': 'What most of the children who watched the winds blow and the trees fall will take away from Hurricane Sandy won’t be fears, but memories.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/01/for-adults-a-catastrophe-for-children-a-memory/', 'snippet': 'What most of the children who watched the winds blow and the trees fall will take away from Hurricane Sandy won’t be fears, but memories.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the water recedes and communities begin to clear away the