'CBS News', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ohio', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Virginia', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-01T13:23:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cooper and Allison Kopicki', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Allison', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kopicki', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3dacb08a-333a-52cd-aada-073126880280', 'word_count': 617, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3dacb08a-333a-52cd-aada-073126880280'}, {'abstract': 'From around the world, the Facebook communities of The International Herald Tribune and The New York Times have sent hundreds of suggestions to New Yorkers and others affected by Sandy. Here’s a sampling of their advice. If you live outside the United States and have been affected by a natural disaster, please join the conversation and add your thoughts here.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/01/global-advice-on-how-to-cope-recover-and-rebuild/', 'snippet': 'From around the world, the Facebook communities of The International Herald Tribune and The New York Times have sent hundreds of suggestions to New Yorkers and others affected by Sandy. Here’s a sampling of their advice. If you live outside the Un...', 'lead_paragraph': 'As damaging as Hurricane Sandy has been, many places around the world have endured far more devastating, and frequent, disasters. The earthquake in Haiti in 2010 caused hundreds of thousands of deaths. The tsunami that hit Japan in 2011 led to power and transportation problems far more catastrophic than those in the northeastern United States. Typhoons batter Asian countries much poorer than the United States with regular ferocity. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/01/arts/01rdv-response/01rdv-response-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/01/arts/01rdv-response/01rdv-response-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Global Advice on How to Cope, Recover and Rebuild', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-01T13:29:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marcus Mabry', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marcus', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mabry', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c62c93d-1281-5377-9d27-b598ef323270', 'word_count': 951, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c62c93d-1281-5377-9d27-b598ef323270'}, {'abstract': 'Kristin Chenoweth, Valerie Simpson, Mavis Staples and Tom Morello are among the musicians who will participate in the 2013 season, which will expand to use Lincoln Center’s Stanley H. Kaplan Penthouse.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/01/lincoln-center-sets-american-songbook-schedule-for-2013/', 'snippet': 'Kristin Chenoweth, Valerie Simpson, Mavis Staples and Tom Morello are among the musicians who will participate in the 2013 season, which will expand to use Lincoln Center’s Stanley H. Kaplan Penthouse.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kristin Chenoweth, Valerie Simpson, Mavis Staples and Tom Morello are among the musicians who will participate in the 2013 season of Lincoln Center’s annual American Songbook series, which will expand to use the performing arts center’s Stanley H. Kaplan Penthouse in addition to the Allen Room, the traditional home of the series.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/01/arts/chenoweth/chenoweth-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 559, 'width': 480, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/01/arts/chenoweth/chenoweth-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 559, 'width': 480, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/01/arts/chenoweth/chenoweth-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/01/arts/chenoweth/chenoweth-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/01/arts/chenoweth/chenoweth-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lincoln Center Sets American Songbook Schedule for 2013', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '2013 American Songbook Schedule Announced', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'American Songbook (Music Series)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chenoweth, Kristin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morello, Tom', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oldham, Will', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rivera, Chita', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Simpson, Valerie', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Staples, Mavis', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lincoln Center for the Performing Arts', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-01T13:36:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2db5c18a-1639-5405-a2e4-8b256840b116', 'word_count': 298, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2db5c18a-1639-5405-a2e4-8b256840b116'}, {'abstract': 'Three-dimensional maps of flooding from a five-year-old report dovetail closely with what transpired when a superstorm pounded New York City on Monday and Tuesday.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/01/on-our-radar-prescient-storm-maps/', 'snippet': 'Three-dimensional maps of flooding from a five-year-old report dovetail closely with what transpired when a superstorm pounded New York City on Monday and Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': ' A series of 3-D maps assembled five years ago from projections by the United Nations climate panel and federal science agencies show Lower Manhattan, the East Village and F.D.R. Drive underwater after a three-meter sea-level rise. And that’s what Sandy’s surge delivered. [Inside Climate News] ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On Our Radar: Prescient Maps', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_d