ork but not Houston? Should central New Jersey be next?', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the most recent meeting of the She Owns It business group, the owners gave updates on some longstanding issues, and raised a few new ones. Thinking Caps Tutoring, owned by Alexandra Mayzler, is rethinking its expansion plans. At the same time, Ms. Mayzler is moving ahead with the company’s new tagline and a Web site redesign. Beth Shaw, who owns YogaFit, also has plans to revamp her Web site. But they’ve recently been delayed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wrestling With Expansion Plans', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tutors and Tutoring', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Houston (Tex)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-01T17:00:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adriana Gardella', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adriana', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gardella', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/528a6d5c-d004-5e84-9c94-0f8147bfdcae', 'word_count': 880, 'uri': 'nyt://article/528a6d5c-d004-5e84-9c94-0f8147bfdcae'}, {'abstract': 'An e-book and an app provide easy access to Berlitz’s guide to cruising and cruise ships.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/01/two-easier-ways-to-tote-a-cruise-guide-onboard/', 'snippet': 'An e-book and an app provide easy access to Berlitz’s guide to cruising and cruise ships.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For 28 years, Berlitz’s Complete Guide to Cruising and Cruise Ships, with in-depth reviews of 284 ships by Douglas Ward, 