om/2012/11/01/an-option-for-all-that-halloween-candy/', 'snippet': 'You can turn excess Halloween candy into care packages for troops overseas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you work at home, like me, and have children, like me, you are perhaps struggling (or will be soon if you live in the area hit by Hurricane Sandy) to stay away from their giant bags laden with Halloween candy. As always, the Milky Ways are calling my name.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Option for All That Halloween Candy', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Giving Up\r\nThat Candy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Halloween', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teeth and Dentistry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Operation Gratitude', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-01T19:35:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c6052d80-9b1f-5e2e-a9dc-a8b8a2731bbd', 'word_count': 300, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c6052d80-9b1f-5e2e-a9dc-a8b8a2731bbd'}, {'abstract': 'TimesCast Politics: Obama and Romney return to the trail. | The money race in the final stages. | A partisan twist on the Senate race in Maine. | Buzzfeed’s Ben Smith on social media.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/politics/100000001879445/timescast-politics-november-1-2012.html', 'snippet': 'TimesCast Politics: Obama and Romney return to the trail. | The money race in the final stages. | A partisan twis