” is a documentary on the life of Ozwald Boateng, the London fashion designer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/02/movies/a-mans-story-documentary-on-the-designer-ozwald-boateng.html', 'snippet': '“A Man’s Story” is a documentary on the life of Ozwald Boateng, the London fashion designer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The past few years of fashion documentaries have rolled out portraits of the talented and fabulous that largely embrace their subjects’ cult of personality and occasionally even talk about their clothes. “A Man’s Story,” an unsatisfying look at the London designer Ozwald Boateng, was shot over 12 years and aspires to a degree of intimacy, yet this glancing treatment is not very enlightening.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/arts/02RDP_MANSTORY/02RDP_MANSTORY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 811, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/arts/02RDP_MANSTORY/02RDP_MANSTORY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1622, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/arts/02RDP_MANSTORY/02RDP_MANSTORY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/02/arts/02RDP_MANSTORY/02RDP_MANSTORY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/arts/02RDP_MANSTORY/02RDP_MANSTORY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Designer’