, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/838bbfc1-2a32-5a07-bd50-410ad1b89224', 'word_count': 1199, 'uri': 'nyt://article/838bbfc1-2a32-5a07-bd50-410ad1b89224'}, {'abstract': 'For Mitt Romney’s team, producing Hollywood-caliber events with a fraction of a film director’s time and budget has required a lot of hard work and a gift for anticipating trouble.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/02/us/politics/romneys-advance-team-tirelessly-pursues-perfection.html', 'snippet': 'For Mitt Romney’s team, producing Hollywood-caliber events with a fraction of a film director’s time and budget has required a lot of hard work and a gift for anticipating trouble.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LANCASTER, Ohio — The national anthem was taking too long.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/us/02advance1/02advance1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/02/us/02advance1/02advance1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/us/02advance1/02advance1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/us/02advance1/02advance1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1001, 'width': 1502, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Advance Team Works Every Angle in Pursuit of Visual Perfection', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Romney Advance Team Works Every Angle in Pursuit of Visual Perfection', 'na