ed by an unusually successful promotion on Living Social and close attention to costs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/02/business/starbucks-posts-gains-on-growth-in-china.html', 'snippet': 'The company was also buoyed by an unusually successful promotion on Living Social and close attention to costs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Buoyed by an unusually successful promotion on Living Social, strong growth in China and close attention to costs, Starbucks on Thursday posted healthy gains in fiscal fourth-quarter profit and revenue. It also raised its earnings estimates for the next fiscal year.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Starbucks Posts Gains on Growth in China', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Starbucks Posts Gains On Growth In China', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Starbucks Corporation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coffeehouses', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-02T00:12:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephanie Strom', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephanie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Strom', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/82f3ec14-c341-5063-97cc-1e28d463c74c', 'word_count': 354, 'uri': 'nyt://article/82f3ec14-c341-5063-97cc-1e28d463c74c'}, {'abstract': 'After a state politician retires, goes to jail or dies, it’s time to close shop, including the campaign fund.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/02/opinion/even-death-wont-part-a-politician-and-his-campaign-fund.html', 'snippet': 'After a state politician retires, goes to jail or dies, it’s time to close shop, including the campaign fund.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In New York State, a politician can retire, go to jail or even die without losing the right to maintain a working campaign fund. Take Assemblyman George Amedore, a Republican running for the State Senate, who recently received a $2,000 contribution from the Committee to Re-elect Senator Stafford. Senator Ronald Stafford, an upstate Republican, died in 2005, but the committee, now run by a former aide, has been doling out funds ever since.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Even Death Won’t Part Them Now', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Even Death Won’t Part Them Now', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Public Interest Research Group', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Krueger, Liz', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-02T00:15:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/ec04c6a9-4446-592e-be54-4dac0d049cd4', 'word_count': 389, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ec04c6a9-4446-592e-be54-4dac0d049cd4'}, {'abstract': 'Satellites were used to predict Hurricane Sandy’s path, but their future is at risk because of budget cuts and mismanagement.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/02/opinion/satellite-tracking-of-hurricanes-in-peril.html', 'snippet': 'Satellites were used to predict Hurricane Sandy’s path, but their future is at risk because of budget cuts and mismanagement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Weather forecasters were able to predict the track of Hurricane Sandy with increasing accuracy as it moved up the Atlantic Coast, turned west to make landfall on the coast of New Jersey and then veered north toward Canada. That capability, which allowed communities to prepare for the worst and evacuate where necessary, will be lost in just a few years thanks to bad mismanagement and shortsighted federal budget cuts over the past decade.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hurricane Tracking in Peril', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hurricane Tracking in Peril', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Satellites', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-02T00:16:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/438bd20f-2e03-5631-8952-94430c4e0f9c', 'word_count': 306, 'uri': 'nyt://article/438bd20f-2e03-5631-8952-94430c4e0f9c'}, {'abstract': 'In an expansion of a pilot program, the hotel chain offers New Balance shoes and clothing to accommodate airline travelers who want to pack light.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/02/business/media/westin-lends-new-balance-gear-at-its-hotels.html', 'snippet': 'In an expansion of a pilot program, the hotel chain offers New Balance shoes and clothing to accommodate airline travelers who want to pack light.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GENERATIONS of bowlers have rented disinfectant-spritzed shoes from bowling 