 'The major networks and local TV stations are planning to raise money to help the people who were affected by this week’s storm.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s a single message across the television spectrum since Hurricane Sandy: Please give.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'TV Medium Is Planning Storm Relief by Telethon', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'TV Medium Is Planning Storm Relief By Telethon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'News Corporation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Media', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NBC Universal', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Walt Disney Company', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corporation', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-02T00:24:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter and Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/757afabb-6919-5d12-9948-82730e1032b9', 'word_count': 480, 'uri': 'nyt://article/757afabb-6919-5d12-9948-82730e1032b9'}, {'abstract': 'The city attorney of San Francisco asked the maker of Monster energy drinks to substantiate its claim that the beverages were safe for adolescents and adults.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/02/business/safety-of-monster-energy-drinks-questioned.html', 'snippet': 'The city attorney of San Francisco asked the maker of Monster energy drinks to substantiate its claim that the beverages were safe for adolescents and adults.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the latest action aimed at the energy drink industry, the top lawyer for the city of San Francisco has asked one major producer to provide evidence that supports the advertising and marketing claims it made to adolescents for its highly caffeinated drinks.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'San Francisco Questions Maker of Energy Drinks About Their Safety', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'San Francisco Questions Maker of Energy Drinks About Their Safety', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Monster Beverage Corp', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Caffeine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Francisco (Calif)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beverages', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-02T00:32:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Barry Meier', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Barry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Meier', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/47663166-ba72-548c-b40f-335f0d9e7641', 'word_count': 452, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47663166-ba72-548c-b40f-335f0d9e7641'}, {'abstract': 'Damages from Hurricane Sandy could be double a previous forecast, with economists warning that the storm could shave a half percentage point off the nation’s economic growth.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/02/business/estimate-of-economic-losses-now-up-to-50-billion.html', 'snippet': 'Damages from Hurricane Sandy could be double a previous forecast, with economists warning that the storm could shave a half percentage point off the nation’s economic growth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Economic damages inflicted by Hurricane Sandy could reach $50 billion, according to new estimates that are more than double a previous forecast. Some economists warned on Thursday that the storm could shave a half percentage point off the nation’s economic growth in the current quarter.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/business/LOSS/LOSS-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/02/business/LOSS/LOSS-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/business/LOSS/LOSS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 813, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/business/LOSS/LOSS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1626, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/business/LOSS/LOSS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/02/business