 businesses — but it’s not easy to prove.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A couple of weeks ago, when The Agenda discussed Jon Stewart’s musings on creating a safety net for entrepreneurial risk-taking, we touched briefly on how health insurance reform might spur people to go out on a limb and open a new business. “What about the risk of, you’re afraid to leave your job and be an entrepreneur because that’s where your health insurance is?” Mr. Stewart asked his “Daily Show” guest, Austan Goolsbee, the former Obama administration economist.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Assessing the Impact of Health Care Reform on New Businesses In Massachusetts', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Entrepreneurship', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Start-ups', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Massachusetts', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-02T11:00:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robb Mandelbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mandelbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a73fb4b9-8988-5b89-8c81-c5527aea6a45', 'word_count': 1014, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a73fb4b9-8988-5b89-8c81-c5527aea6a45'}, {'abstract': 'Japanese leaders reacted angrily on Friday after the police on Okinawa said a United States Air Force serviceman was suspected of assaulting a 13-year-old boy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/03/world/asia/us-airman-is-suspected-of-punching-japanese-boy-police-say.html', 'snippet': 'Japanese leaders reacted angrily on Friday after the police on Okinawa said a United States Air Force serviceman was suspected of assaulting a 13-year-old boy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TOKYO — Japanese leaders reacted angrily on Friday after the police on Okinawa said an American Air Force serviceman was suspected of breaking into an apartment while drunk and punching a 13-year-old boy, just weeks after two American sailors were accused of raping a woman on the island.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Airman Is Suspected of Punching Japanese Boy, Police Say', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Airman on Okinawa Punched Boy, Japanese Say', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Japan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Okinawa and Other Ryukyu Islands (Japan)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Air Force', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-02T11:09:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martin Fackler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fackler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3d65fe61-d316-59bd-a104-089392c00b4f', 'word_count': 567, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3d65fe61-d316-59bd-a104-089392c00b4f'}, {'abstract': 'After a year of planning and a difficult six-day trek, the members of Aaron Putnam’s team finally see the landscape they’ve experienced only through via aerial photographs and brief online accounts.', 'web_url': 'https://scientistatwork.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/02/the-majesty-of-rinchen-zoe/', 'snippet': 'After a year of planning and a difficult six-day trek, the members of Aaron Putnam’s team finally see the landscape they’ve experienced only through via aerial photographs and brief online accounts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Aaron Putnam, a postdoctoral research scientist at the Lamont-Doherty Earth Observatory of Columbia University, is a leader of an expedition to Bhutan to examine links among climate, glaciers and water resources in the Himalaya.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/16/science/16scientist7-putnam3/16scientist7-putnam3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/16/science/16scientist7-putnam3/16scientist7-putnam3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/16/science/16scientist7-putnam3/16scientist7-putnam3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/10/16/science/16scientist7-putnam3/16scientist7-putnam3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/16/science/16scientist7-putnam3/16scientist7-putnam3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLar