': 'Comparing Recessions and Recoveries', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recession and Depression', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-02T17:51:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Catherine Rampell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Catherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rampell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3cab0f13-9511-51cb-b304-6660ef2aad8b', 'word_count': 324, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3cab0f13-9511-51cb-b304-6660ef2aad8b'}, {'abstract': 'Food-related events around New York.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/02/weekend-fare-116/', 'snippet': 'Food-related events around New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Diner’s Journal is gathering a list of Hurricane Sandy relief events and specials offered by restaurants, food trucks and other members of the food-service community. Restaurants are also offering special deals this weekend for runners and their supporters in honor of the New York City Marathon on Sunday:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Weekend Fare', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-02T17:52:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bao Ong', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bao', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ong', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0cb8ff9d-f1a6-5b92-b1ae-df8b8e351d8b', 'word_count': 205, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0cb8ff9d-f1a6-5b92-b1ae-df8b8e351d8b'}, {'abstract': 'A crop of hotels has popped up over the past year or so for those who want to stay the night in the land of local, seasonal and artisanal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/04/travel/beds-in-brooklyn-inside-6-hotels.html', 'snippet': 'A crop of hotels has popped up over the past year or so for those who want to stay the night in the land of local, seasonal and artisanal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ONE of two things usually happens when you put the words “Brooklyn” and “hotel” together: you either draw a total blank or conjure up images of bleak, two-star chains housed in blocks of concrete. Even for longtime residents, coming up with good recommendations for friends and family has been a problem.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/travel/04NEXT1_SPAN/04NEXT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/04/travel/04NEXT1_SPAN/04NEXT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/travel/04NEXT1_SPAN/04NEXT1_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/travel/04NEXT1_SPAN/04NEXT1_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/travel