l.html', 'snippet': 'Picking up the scent of fried dough around Louisville, the author hunts glazed, cake, jelly and even maple bacon doughnuts through central Kentucky.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A ROAD trip is always nice. But a quest is even better. Set a goal, and the miles become meaningful. And what goal could be more meaningful than the great American doughnut?', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/travel/04DOUGHNUT6/04DOUGHNUT6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/04/travel/04DOUGHNUT6/04DOUGHNUT6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/travel/04DOUGHNUT6/04DOUGHNUT6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/travel/04DOUGHNUT6/04DOUGHNUT6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/travel/04DOUGHNUT6/04DOUGHNUT6-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/04/travel/04DOUGHNUT6/04DOUGHNUT6-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/travel/04DOUGHNUT6/04DOUGHNUT6-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Twists and Turns Along a Kentucky Doughnut Trail', 'kicker': 'Pursuits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Twists and Turns Along A Kentucky Doughnut Trail', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kentucky', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doughnuts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bakeries and Baked Products', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-02T17:55:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Grimes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grimes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7933cc14-1079-58ae-9c0e-332efea6ea39', 'word_count': 1708, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7933cc14-1079-58ae-9c0e-332efea6ea39'}, {'abstract': 'Many communities were battered in Hurricane Sandy.  Did you get help from neighbors? Have you had a chance to help others?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/02/booming/helping-a-neighbor-in-the-storm.html', 'snippet': 'Many communities were battered in Hurricane Sandy.  Did you get help from neighbors? Have you had a chance to help others?', 'lead_paragraph': 'We’ve all been reading of the destruction caused by Hurricane Sandy. I live in Long Beach, N.Y. We’ve had flooding in most houses, fires, cars ruined by salt water. It could be another week before we have electricity, heat, water, sewage and cell service. And yet there’s another story. I can’t count all the favors neighbors have done for me and I’ve tried to do for others. Has someone done you a kindness during this storm, or previous ones? Have you given someone a hand? We’d love to hear.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/booming/02friday-booming-storm/02friday-booming-storm-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 336, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/02/booming/02friday-booming-storm/02friday-booming-storm-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 336}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/booming/02friday-booming-storm/02friday-booming-storm-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/booming/02friday-booming-storm/02friday-booming-storm-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/booming/02friday-booming-storm/02friday-booming-storm-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/02/booming/02friday-booming-storm/02friday-booming-storm-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/booming/02friday-booming-storm/02friday-booming-storm-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Have You Helped a Neighbor in a Storm?', 'kicker': 'The Friday Question', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baby Boomers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}],