and easy to make. Melissa Clark shows you how in a new video.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/02/crunchy-salty-kale-chips/', 'snippet': 'These baked snacks are delicious, good for you and easy to make. Melissa Clark shows you how in a new video.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kale has indisputably become the current “it” vegetable. In this week’s column, I argue it’s in part because of its versatility; it’s great both cooked and raw in salads.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Crunchy, Salty Kale Chips', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-02T19:47:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6805caf3-cb3e-51fe-bcfe-d6e9b1a86e36', 'word_count': 109, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6805caf3-cb3e-51fe-bcfe-d6e9b1a86e36'}, {'abstract': 'Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg gave hope to beleaguered Manhattan residents that their power would be restored by Sunday night, but Consolidated Edison was unable to follow through.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/02/hopes-fade-in-manhattans-darkened-neighborhoods/', 'snippet': 'Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg gave hope to beleaguered Manhattan residents that their power would be restored by Sunday night, but Consolidated Edison was unable to follow through.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was a ray of hope slicing through a darkened side of Manhattan: Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg’s statement in a Friday afternoon news conference that Consolidated Edison could have power restored in most of Manhattan by on Sunday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hopes Fade in Manhattan’s Darkened Neighborhoods', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Power Outages and Blackouts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Consolidated Edison Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chelsea (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-02T19:47:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Roston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9ff6cd63-bfda-5062-8d3c-bf809494cdce', 'word_count': 207, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9ff6cd63-bfda-5062-8d3c-bf809494cdce'}, {'abstract': 'Bucks readers offer their advice on steps to take to protect your personal assets.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/02/a-measure-of-protection-just-in-case/', 'snippet': 'Bucks readers offer their advice on steps to take to protect your personal assets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In his Wealth Matters column this week, Paul Sullivan talks about protecting your assets in case you’re sued. While he notes that you can never completely protect yourself, you can take steps to discourage people from pursuing you.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Measure of Protection, Just in Case', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'n