ation/edlife/puppy-love-can-cost-you.html', 'snippet': 'Anyone thinking of vet school should consider the financial strain as well as the job satisfaction. Average debt: $125,000.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FOR Allison Ward, treating animals is a passion and a calling. She can’t imagine doing anything else. But that passion came with a big price tag. Dr. Ward graduated from Kansas State University with a degree in veterinary medicine last year, and as an out-of-state student accrued $250,000 in debt, including undergraduate loans.', 'print_section': 'ED', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/education/edl-04vets-t_CA1/edl-04vets-t_CA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/education/edl-04vets-t_CA1/edl-04vets-t_CA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/education/edl-04vets-t_CA1/edl-04vets-t_CA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/04/education/edl-04vets-t_CA1/edl-04vets-t_CA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/education/edl-04vets-t_CA1/edl-04vets-t_CA1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 0, 'width': 0, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Puppy Love Can Cost You', 'kicker': 'So You Want to Be a ... Vet', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Puppy Love Can Cost You', 'name': None, 'seo