in-jersey-city.html', 'snippet': 'Sapthagiri specializes in southern Indian cuisine, and serves only vegetarian dishes, making it popular among Jews who keep kosher.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AT 8 on a recent Friday evening in Jersey City — pre-Hurricane Sandy — the stretch of Newark Avenue known as Little India was neon-bright. Shoppers bustled in and out of stores. A group of people, their shoes off, crowded around the entrance to a shrine. A man strolled up and down the street, cradling a newborn girl. It was the end of a workweek and the mood was ebullient.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/nyregion/04DINENJ2_SPAN/04DINENJ2_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/04/nyregion/04DINENJ2_SPAN/04DINENJ2_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/nyregion/04DINENJ2_SPAN/04DINENJ2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/nyregion/04DINENJ2_SPAN/04DINENJ2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/nyregion/04DINENJ2_SPAN/04DINENJ2_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/04/nyregion/04DINENJ2_SPAN/04DINENJ2_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cheerful, Lively, Spicy and 100% Vegetarian', 'kicker': 'New Jersey Dining | Jersey City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cheerful, Lively, Spicy And 100% Vegetarian', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sapthagiri (Jersey City, NJ, Restaurant)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jersey City (NJ)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-02T22:37:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Fran Schumer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Fran', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schumer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c0803a7-4f17-5371-9d22-e811dd2e7e26', 'word_count': 992, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c0803a7-4f17-5371-9d22-e811dd2e7e26'}, {'abstract': 'With all the destruction, personal loss and inconvenience of half the city of New York without power, there were lighthearted moments on Fifth Avenue during Monday’s storm.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/fashion/100000001882207/bill-cunningham-stormville.html', 'snippet': 'With all the destruction, personal loss and inconvenience of half the city of New York without power, there were lighthearted moments on Fifth Avenue during Monday’s storm.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With all the destruction, personal loss and inconvenience of half the city of New York without power, there were lighthearted moments on Fifth Avenue during Monday’s storm.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/fashion/video-1104billcunningham/video-1104billcunningham-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/02/fashion/video-1104billcunningham/video-1104billcunningham-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/fashion/video-1104billcunningham/video-1104billcunningham-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/02/fashion/video-1104billcunningham/video-1104billcunningham-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Cunningham | Stormville', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-02T22:39:26+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'Joanna Nikas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nikas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/3d3d04da-0263-53f0-ad3f-253102f3729c', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/3d3d04da-0263-53f0-ad3f-253102f3729c'}, {'abstract': 'To an outsider watching a jookin “battle,” a kind of virtuoso dancing that’s a relative of hip-hop, the evening comes as a revelation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/03/arts/dance/lil-buck-a-jook-star-from-memphis.html', 'snippet': 'To an outsider watching a jookin “battle,” a kind of virtuoso dancing that’s a relative of hip-hop, the evening comes as a revelation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MEMPHIS — This city, so central to the emergence of blues, soul and rock ’n’ roll, in recent decades has developed a new kind of virtuoso dancing: jookin. Sometime between the 1970s and 1990s (depending on whom you talk to) this dance idiom grew out of — or up with — the gangsta walk. It’s a relative of hip-hop and is widely performed to rap music. Its footwork, especially, is nothing less than phenomenal. Even around this city, however, plenty of dancegoers have never seen it live. And both here and elsewhere there are different versions of its name (which has been confused with jukin, a Chicago dance genre) and its history. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/03/arts/03JOOKIN/03JOOKIN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/03/arts/03JOOKIN/03JOOKIN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/03/arts/03JOOKIN/03JOOKIN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 901, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/03/arts/03JOOKIN/03JOOKIN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1402, 'width': 1233, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/03/arts/03JOOKIN/03JOOKIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/03/arts/03JOOKIN/03JOOKIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/03/arts/03JOOKIN/03JOOKIN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On Point, in Their Jeans and Sneakers', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Not