view', '_id': 'nyt://article/af6831b7-d103-5074-8110-dfe6dfaa32b1', 'word_count': 877, 'uri': 'nyt://article/af6831b7-d103-5074-8110-dfe6dfaa32b1'}, {'abstract': 'In trying times like these, the loss of any oracle of manners, kindness and courtesy, especially Letitia Baldrige, who was known as the “doyenne of decorum,” is immeasurable.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/04/fashion/death-of-letitia-baldrige-is-loss-for-society-as-decorum-fades.html', 'snippet': 'In trying times like these, the loss of any oracle of manners, kindness and courtesy, especially Letitia Baldrige, who was known as the “doyenne of decorum,” is immeasurable.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PROBABLY I should begin by telling you that before Hurricane Sandy hit, I was the guy at the market who, preparing for the worst, bought roses instead of vegetables. Maybe knowing this will help explain the sadness I felt when I heard that the modern manners expert Letitia Baldrige, who was known as the “doyenne of decorum,” had died Monday in Bethesda, Md., at age 86.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/fashion/04BALDRIDGE1/04BALDRIDGE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 672, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/fashion/04BALDRIDGE1/04BALDRIDGE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 672, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/fashion/04BALDRIDGE1/04BALDRIDGE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/04/fashion/04BALDRIDGE1/04BALDRIDGE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 