ract': 'Residents of the Jersey Shore say Hurricane Sandy will not wash away their determination to rebuild the battered coastline.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/nyregion/100000001882333/jersey-strong.html', 'snippet': 'Residents of the Jersey Shore say Hurricane Sandy will not wash away their determination to rebuild the battered coastline.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Residents of the Jersey Shore say Hurricane Sandy will not wash away their determination to rebuild the battered coastline.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/nyregion/video-jerseyshore/video-jerseyshore-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/04/nyregion/video-jerseyshore/video-jerseyshore-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/nyregion/video-jerseyshore/video-jerseyshore-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/04/nyregion/video-jerseyshore/video-jerseyshore-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New Jersey Strong', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-03T02:12:26+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'Shayla Harris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shayla', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Harris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/118607be-098c-5033-99d5-aba94cc61145', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/118607be-098c-5033-99d5-aba94cc61145'}, {'abstract': 'Along the Eastern Seaboard and beyond, elections officials are struggling to avoid storm-related voting disruptions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/03/us/politics/hurricane-sandy-threatens-to-disrupt-voting-on-election-day.html', 'snippet': 'Along the Eastern Seaboard and beyond, elections officials are struggling to avoid storm-related voting disruptions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some New Jersey voters may find their hurricane-damaged polling sites replaced by military trucks, with — in the words of the state’s lieutenant governor, Kim Guadagno — “a well-situated national guardsman and a big sign saying, ‘Vote Here.’\xa0” Half of the polling sites in Nassau County on Long Island still lacked power on Friday. And New York City was planning to build temporary polling sites in tents in some of its worst-hit neighborhoods.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/03/us/03vote2/03vote2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/03/us/03vote2/03vote2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/03/us/03vote2/03vote2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/03/us/03vote2/03vote2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/03/us/03vote2/0