Rouge, La., and Los Angeles. It has not worked out that way, but Louisiana State and Southern California will still provide stiff tests for the top two teams in the nation.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'College Football Matchups', 'kicker': 'The Quad', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Matchups', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-03T02:41:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Weintraub', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weintraub', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e064f8e1-2ffc-5617-9906-95cae0acc12c', 'word_count': 556, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e064f8e1-2ffc-5617-9906-95cae0acc12c'}, {'abstract': 'Linda E. McMahon, a Republican, has broken a record, long having surpassed Ross Perot in personal spending to seek a federal office.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/03/nyregion/linda-e-mcmahon-has-spent-nearly-100-million-in-senate-races.html', 'snippet': 'Linda E. McMahon, a Republican, has broken a record, long having surpassed Ross Perot in personal spending to seek a federal office.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Linda E. McMahon’s campaign for the United States Senate has been good for Bert Volpacchio, who received $494 for a meet-and-greet with about 40 local officials last May at his restaurant, the Hot Tamale, in Seymour, Conn. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/03/nyregion/MCMAHON1/MCMAHON1-art