21f83a46e1e'}, {'abstract': 'Power was restored to tens of thousands of residents in Lower Manhattan, although those in other boroughs, on Long Island and in New Jersey, will not know when their power will come back.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/03/nyregion/as-power-is-restored-for-some-others-face-grim-outlook.html', 'snippet': 'Power was restored to tens of thousands of residents in Lower Manhattan, although those in other boroughs, on Long Island and in New Jersey, will not know when their power will come back.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Four dark days after Hurricane Sandy blew through the New York region, residents and businesses in the lower end of Manhattan began to get power back on Friday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'As Power Is Restored for Some, Others Face Grim Outlook', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lights Are Coming Back in Lower Manhattan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Consolidated Edison Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Long Island (NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Power Outages and Blackouts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric Light and Power', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York Metropolitan Area', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Westchester County (NY)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Public Service Electric and Gas Co', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-03T03:43:14+00