called emergency food, typically freeze-dried and vacuum-packed with a 30-year shelf life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE end is near. And nothing takes the edge off Armageddon like freeze-dried beef stroganoff and freeze-dried Neapolitan ice cream. Or so it seems, given the growing demand for such survivalist fare, as Americans become increasingly anxious about natural, economic and geopolitical disasters. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/sunday-review/04BUNKER/04BUNKER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 987, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/sunday-review/04BUNKER/04BUNKER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1723, 'width': 1787, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/sunday-review/04BUNKER/04BUNKER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/04/sunday-review/04BUNKER/04BUNKER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/sunday-review/04BUNKER/04BUNKER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 151, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dining Through Disaster', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dining Through Disaster', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Utah', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oregon Freeze Dry Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name':