, 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/04/sunday-review/how-science-can-build-a-better-you.html', 'snippet': 'How far would you go to modify yourself using the latest medical technology?', 'lead_paragraph': 'IF a brain implant were safe and available and allowed you to operate your iPad or car using only thought, would you want one? What about an embedded device that gently bathed your brain in electrons and boosted memory and attention? Would you order one for your children?', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/sunday-review/04ENHANCEMENT/04ENHANCEMENT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 884, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/sunday-review/04ENHANCEMENT/04ENHANCEMENT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1931, 'width': 1667, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/sunday-review/04ENHANCEMENT/04ENHANCEMENT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/04/sunday-review/04ENHANCEMENT/04ENHANCEMENT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/04/sunday-review/04ENHANCEMENT/04ENHANCEMENT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How Science Can Build a Better You', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How Science Can Build a Better You', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name