on at North American theaters, according to Hollywood.com, which compiles box-office data. A decade ago Disney’s animation studio was struggling mightily in the computerized shadow of Pixar and DreamWorks Animation. But Disney’s 2006 purchase of Pixar set in motion a turnaround that started with “Tangled,” a global smash hit in 2010. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Wreck-It Ralph’ a Hit for Disney', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Wreck-It Ralph’ Scores a Hit for Disney', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANIMATED FILMS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Washington, Denzel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zemeckis, Robert', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'DreamWorks Animation SKG Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Paramount Pictures', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twentieth Century Fox', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Walt Disney Company', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Warner Brothers', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North America', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-04T17:41:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooks Barnes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb8f7bb9-413d-5da8-b93f-fde8baec6629', 'word_count': 202, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb8f7bb9-413d-5da8-b93f-fde8baec6629'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama and Mitt Romney hunted for support in battleground states even as their parties faced off in the first court skirmishes over presidential ballots and how they are counted.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/05/us/politics/candidates-make-final-dash-as-race-winds-down.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama and Mitt Romney hunted for support in battleground states even as their parties faced off in the first court skirmishes over presidential ballots and how they are counted.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOLLYWOOD, Fla. — President Obama and Mitt Romney hunted for last-minute support on Sunday in a frenetic sprint across battleground states, even as their parties faced off in the first of what could be a growing number of legal disputes over presidential ballots and how they are counted.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/05/us/politics/05campaign1/05campaign1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/05/us/politics/05campaign1/05campaign1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/05/us/politics/05campaign1/05campaign1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/05/us/politics/05campaign1/05campaign1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/05/us/politics/05campaign1/05campaign1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/05/us/politics/05camp