in played Mozart, Chopin and Smetana in a confident set at Alice Tully Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The unifying thread in the Chamber Music Society of Lincoln Center’s concert on Friday evening at Alice Tully Hall was the exceptionally warm, lucid playing of the pianist Inon Barnatan. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On String and Piano, Paying Homage to Three Masters', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'On String and Piano, Paying Homage to Three Masters', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chamber Music Society of Lincoln Center', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barnatan, Inon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weilerstein, Alisa', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sussmann, Arnaud', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-04T23:12:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zachary Woolfe', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zachary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Woolfe', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/c41adafe-3d1f-57a7-b631-2f3ab48e3977', 'word_count': 401, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c41adafe-3d1f-57a7-b631-2f3ab48e3977'}, {'abstract': 'With a minimal staff and rented equipment, the public station in New Jersey has broadcast up to three live newscasts, with many news breaks a day to keep up with the hurricane.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/05/business/media/storm-poses-first-big-test-for-njtv.html', 'snippet': 'With a minimal staff and rented equipment, the public station in New Jersey has broadcast up to three live newscasts, with many news breaks a day to keep up with the hurricane.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During his 6 p.m. newscast Thursday, the NJTV anchor Mike Schneider got a little cranky on the air, after twice trying, unsuccessfully, to interview Representative Frank LoBiondo, Republican of New Jersey, over a patchy cellphone line.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/05/business/05PBS/05PBS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 602, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/05/business/05PBS/05PBS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1072, 'width': 1823, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/05/business/05PBS/05PBS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/05/business/05PBS/05PBS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/05/business/05PBS/05PBS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Storm Poses First Major Test for NJTV News Coverage', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Storm Poses First Major Test for NJTV News Coverage', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Te