ps://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/05/sports/new-york-marathon-took-uneasy-route-to-cancellation.html', 'snippet': 'Even before Hurricane Sandy passed, New York Road Runners had grappled with the question of how to proceed with the race, given the resources it would require.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The marathon directors from Berlin, Boston, Chicago and London gathered at Tavern on the Green on Friday morning to celebrate Tokyo’s becoming the sixth Marathon Major. But the executives grew uneasy as they nibbled on bagels in a large heated tent, because the host, Mary Wittenberg, the chief executive of New York Road Runners, was late.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Marathon Stumbled Along a Route of Indecision on Its Way Toward Cancellation', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Marathon Stumbled Along a Route of Indecision on Its Way Toward Cancellation', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York City Marathon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wittenberg, Mary', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marathon Running', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Road Runners Club', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-05T01:21:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Belson and David W. Chen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Belson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Chen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f3c616f4-2226-5696-aab3-1d5e067a7100', 'word_count': 959, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f3c616f4-2226-5696-aab3-1d5e067a7100'}, {'abstract': 'The following tax-exempt fixed-income issues are scheduled for pricing this week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/05/business/treasury-auctions-set-for-this-week.html', 'snippet': 'The following tax-exempt fixed-income issues are scheduled for pricing this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Treasury’s schedule of financing this week includes Monday’s regular weekly auction of new three- and six-month bills and an auction of four-week bills on Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Treasury Auctions Set for This Week', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Treasury Auctions Set for This Week', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-05T01:25:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/21cb11f9-0cbd-5fa9-afa9-e29bcc8deef6', 'word_count': 335, 'uri': 'nyt://article/21cb11f9-0cbd-5fa9-afa9-e29bcc8deef6'}, {'abstract': 'In an Op-Docs video, the designer Todd Oldham reviews the design of election ballots from across the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/05/opinion/ballot-design-with-todd-oldham.html', 'snippet': 'In an Op-Docs video, the designer Todd Oldham reviews the design of election ballots from across the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Our long national nightmare of a presidential campaign comes to a close Tuesday with our quadrennial day of unity, when over 100 million of us — Democrats, Republicans, maybe even some of the chronically undecided from those cable news focus groups — will go to the polls. No more recrimination, no more vitriol. “We the people” will come together quietly but resolutely to express our will. Simple as that.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/opinion/video-opdoc-ballot/video-opdoc-ballot-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/02/opinion/video-opdoc-ballot/video-opdoc-ballot-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/02/opinion/video-opdoc-ballot/video-opdoc-ballot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/02/opinion/video-opdoc-ballot/video-opdoc-ballot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Ballot Design With Todd Oldham’', 'kicker': 'Op-Docs', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Ballot Design With Todd Oldham’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Design', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-05T01:28:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mo Rocca', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mo', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rocca', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/7488e3ad-ce36-5f9d-aacc-5d3a88bd3933', 'word_count': 270