ader and his political career.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/04/a-conversation-with-author-aarthi-ramachandran/', 'snippet': 'Writer who chronicled Rahul Gandhi’s foray into politics on the reclusive leader and his political career.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rahul Gandhi often seems to be everywhere and nowhere at the same time. On the television news channels, or in the Indian print media, Mr. Gandhi is ubiquitous, popping up at staged political events across the country, including recently when he donned a blue turban for an appearance in Chandigarh', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Conversation With: Author Aarthi Ramachandran', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gandhi, Rahul', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-05T03:42:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Yardley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yardley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c3b85717-0133-554b-a900-960af9d6b581', 'word_count': 1728, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c3b85717-0133-554b-a900-960af9d6b581'}, {'abstract': 'Savvy play by the veteran guards Jason Kidd, Pablo Prigioni and Raymond Felton has steered the Knicks in the right direction through two games.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/05/sports/basketball/knicks-again-combine-passing-with-firepower.html', 'snippet': 'Savvy play by the veteran guards Jason Kidd, Pablo Prigioni and Raymond Felton has steered the Knicks in the right direction through two games.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jason Kidd kept the ball moving on offense but also penetrated the lane for layups. With the crowd in celebration mode, Rasheed Wallace executed a deft sweeping hook shot out of a post move, but he also found Pablo Prigioni cutting to the basketball for a layup less than a minute later. Carmelo Anthony flashed his isolation scoring ability when necessary but also participated in swift ball movement and dived into the stands after a loose ball.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Knicks Again Combine Passing With Firepower', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Knicks Again Combine Passing With Firepower', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Prigioni, Pablo', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kidd, Jason', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Felton, Raymond', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Novak, Steve', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-05T03:47:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jake Appleman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jake', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Appleman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b7c376aa-072b-55d6-8e6b-8859b1d6642e', 'word_count': 596, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b7c376aa-072b-55d6-8e6b-8859b1d6642e'}, {'abstract': 'Checkbooks are opening as Democrats try to keep control of the Senate and Republicans try to wrest it away, or at least gain ground.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/05/us/politics/last-minute-money-pours-into-senate-races.html', 'snippet': 'Checkbooks are opening as Democrats try to keep control of the Senate and Republicans try to wrest it away, or at least gain ground.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PAINESVILLE, Ohio — A torrent of outside money has dropped into this state in the closing days of the campaign to try to unseat Senator Sherrod Brown, a Democrat, part of a late onslaught across the country that Republicans hope will salvage a respectable showing in Senate races they once had high hopes for.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/05/us/05senate/05senate-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/05/us/05senate/05senate-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/05/us/05senate/05senate-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/05/us/05senate/05senate-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Control of Senate at Stake, Last-Minute Money Pours Into Races', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Control of Senate at Stake, Last-Minute Money Pours Into Races', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Advertising', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mandel, Josh', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ohio', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major':