ess exposed than its Japanese peers to the fallout over a territorial dispute with China.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/06/business/global/toyota-profit-triples-in-third-quarter.html', 'snippet': 'The carmaker, which expects to make $9.7 billion for the full year through March, has been less exposed than its Japanese peers to the fallout over a territorial dispute with China.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TOKYO — In the biggest sign yet of a strong recovery for Toyota Motor, the automaker raised its full-year profit forecast on Monday, shrugging off a sales decline in China brought about by a territorial spat between the two countries.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/06/business/Toyota-1352155890106/Toyota-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 711, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/06/business/Toyota-1352155890106/Toyota-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1422, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/06/business/Toyota-1352155890106/Toyota-1352155890106-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/06/business/Toyota-1352155890106/Toyota-1352155890106-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/06/business/Toyota-1352155890106/Toyota-1352155890106-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Toyota Raises Forecast De