 know Luther Campbell more as a coach teaching them to be young men than as a rapper with 2 Live Crew who once challenged obscenity laws.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/06/sports/football/luther-campbell-has-a-new-gig-and-a-new-rap-for-his-players.html', 'snippet': 'The football players of a Miami high school know Luther Campbell more as a coach teaching them to be young men than as a rapper with 2 Live Crew who once challenged obscenity laws.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI BEACH — On the 12th hole at Normandy Shores Golf Club, beyond the private gate, amid lush green fairways and clusters of palm trees, Luther Campbell steered his cart past several ibises. He mentioned the yacht he once owned. He cackled.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/06/sports/06CAMPBELL-1/06CAMPBELL-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/06/sports/06CAMPBELL-1/06CAMPBELL-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/06/sports/06CAMPBELL-1/06CAMPBELL-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/06/sports/06CAMPBELL-1/06CAMPBELL-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1311, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/06/sports/06CAMPBELL-1/06CAMPBELL-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/06/sports/06CAMPB