es', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Low-Interest Government Loans to Help With Storm Home Damage', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disasters and Emergencies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Emergency Management Agency', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Small Business Administration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-05T18:59:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5e1011a0-ef63-537a-a257-c5b41af0a7d4', 'word_count': 317, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5e1011a0-ef63-537a-a257-c5b41af0a7d4'}, {'abstract': 'The Steelers’ comeback victory over the Giants started with an innocent-looking slant pass to the speedy wide receiver Mike Wallace.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/05/giants-steelers-how-a-slant-became-a-key-score/', 'snippet': 'The Steelers’ comeback victory over the Giants started with an innocent-looking slant pass to the speedy wide receiver Mike Wallace.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Coming into their Week 9 matchup with the \xa0Giants, the Pittsburgh Steelers were a game and a half out of first place in the A.F.C. North. With a Baltimore Ravens victory earlier in the day, the Steelers were in danger of falling back two games in the division with a loss to the defending Super Bowl champs. Meanwhile, the Giants owned a lead of two and a half games in the N.F.C. East.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Giants-Steelers: