.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b48eded5-4eff-5304-b7a0-af89dfc3f776', 'word_count': 111, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b48eded5-4eff-5304-b7a0-af89dfc3f776'}, {'abstract': 'Kevin Systrom, of Instagram, and David Karp, of Tumblr, gave some indication of the problems they’d like their services to solve.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/05/whats-next-for-tumblr-and-instagram/', 'snippet': 'Kevin Systrom, of Instagram, and David Karp, of Tumblr, gave some indication of the problems they’d like their services to solve.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Karp, the chief executive of Tumblr, and Kevin Systrom, the chief executive of Instagram, gave some hints Monday about where their services were headed or not headed during interviews on the stage of the GigaOm Roadmap conference in San Francisco.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/05/technology/05bits-instagram-tumblr/05bits-instagram-tumblr-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 202, 'width': 337, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/05/technology/05bits-instagram-tumblr/05bits-instagram-tumblr-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 202, 'width': 337, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/05/technology/05bits-instagram-tumblr/05bits-instagram-tumblr-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/05/technology/05bits-instagram-tumblr/05bits-instagram-tumblr-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75