stract': 'Mike Vogel’s play “March Madness,” set in an unhappy newsroom, derives humor from the kind of office politics seen in television sitcoms.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/06/theater/reviews/mike-vogels-march-madnesss-at-the-abingdon-theater.html', 'snippet': 'Mike Vogel’s play “March Madness,” set in an unhappy newsroom, derives humor from the kind of office politics seen in television sitcoms.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Scream at your boss and everyone around will stop and listen. That’s true at the theater as well as in the workplace, and even an indifferent audience will tune in once that kind of shouting starts. Such a scene is among the better moments in “March Madness,” a fairly amusing comedy that delivers most of its chuckles during angry showdowns.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/06/arts/06MARCH/06MARCH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 299, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/06/arts/06MARCH/06MARCH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 299}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/06/arts/06MARCH/06MARCH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 511, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/06/arts/06MARCH/06MARCH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1021, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/06/arts/06MARCH/06MARCH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/06/arts/06MARCH/06MARCH