rd quarter as the German automaker continued to defy the crisis gripping its European competition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/07/business/global/strong-asia-sales-help-bmw-in-third-quarter.html', 'snippet': 'Profit and sales rose again in the third quarter as the German automaker continued to defy the crisis gripping its European competition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRANKFURT — BMW said Tuesday that its profit and sales rose in the third quarter as it continued to defy the crisis gripping other European automakers, but warned that the market remained difficult and unpredictable.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/07/business/BMW/BMW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/07/business/BMW/BMW-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Strong Asia Sales Help BMW, but Europe Is Still a Challenge', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'BMW Profit Rises on Strong Sales in Asia, but European Crisis Is a Growing Threat', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bayerische Motorenwerke AG', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-06T09:24:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Global Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Ewing', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ewing', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'typ