abstract': 'Rhody Davis, a director of college counseling, advises college-bound juniors to “look beyond information such as rankings and opinionated hearsay that can distract more than help.”', 'web_url': 'https://thechoice.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/06/counselors-calendar-november-juniors/', 'snippet': 'Rhody Davis, a director of college counseling, advises college-bound juniors to “look beyond information such as rankings and opinionated hearsay that can distract more than help.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week, The Choice is publishing our monthly Counselor’s Calendar, which is designed to keep students on track during the college admissions process. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/28/us/choice-calendar-fall-2/choice-calendar-fall-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/28/us/choice-calendar-fall-2/choice-calendar-fall-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1370, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/28/us/choice-calendar-fall-2/choice-calendar-fall-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/28/us/choice-calendar-fall-2/choice-calendar-fall-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/28/us/choice-calendar-fall-2/choice-calendar-fall-2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'November College Checklist for Junior