': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/037ed343-2cd8-5d4b-962b-563382a812ff', 'word_count': 1019, 'uri': 'nyt://article/037ed343-2cd8-5d4b-962b-563382a812ff'}, {'abstract': 'A collection of links from the reporters and editors of the Dining section.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/06/what-were-reading-561/', 'snippet': 'A collection of links from the reporters and editors of the Dining section.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Esquire: Get out and vote — and maybe Will Ferrell will make you a pasta dinner. Or let you watch him eat toenails. — Patrick Farrell', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What We’re Reading', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-06T15:13:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/824c356c-4f8d-5b3e-a5b1-26d80fdf108f', 'word_count': 427, 'uri': 'nyt://article/824c356c-4f8d-5b3e-a5b1-26d80fdf108f'}, {'abstract': 'The Philadelphia Eagles have rushed to the front of the pack of N.F.L. chaos, and some sports columnists feel the team has  quit on Coach Andy Reid, who will spend the rest of the season regarded as already fired.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/07/sports/andy-reids-eagles-are-in-disarray.html', 'snippet': 'The Philadelphia Eagles have rushed to the front of the pack of N.F.L. chaos, and some sports columnists feel the team has  quit on Coach Andy Reid, who will spend the rest of the season regarded as already fired.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It would be fitting to say that you really have to hand it to the Eagles, but right now, if you handed the Eagles anything, they would probably drop it. They have rushed to the front of the pack of N.F.L. chaos, and this is no small feat. After all, they share a division with the “we just punted the season” Redskins and the “can we hire Sean Payton right now?” Cowboys. They also shared a field Monday night with the Saints, a team buried under Bountygate, with a free-agent suspended coach forming the center ring of a rumor circus and a defense so bad it allows 300 yards before it even emerges from the locker room — and yet, compared with the Eagles, the Saints looked like the ’67 Green Bay Packers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/07/sports/07leading-pic/07leading-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/07/sports/07leading-pic/07leading-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/07/sports/07leading-pic/07leading-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 846, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/07/sports/07leading-pic/07leading-pic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1692, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/07/sports/07leading-pic/07leading-pic-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/07/sports/07leading-pic/07leading-pic-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/07/sports/07leading-pic/07lea