chigan researchers said Monday that new cars and light trucks sold in the United States in October had the highest average fuel economy ever recorded on American vehicles — 24.1 mpg combined.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Fuel Economy Is at All-Time High, Researchers Say', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fuel Efficiency', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Michigan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-06T15:47:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Motavalli', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Motavalli', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/33e6a9f6-615b-5328-b1ac-820362ad2c78', 'word_count': 454, 'uri': 'nyt://article/33e6a9f6-615b-5328-b1ac-820362ad2c78'}, {'abstract': 'Travel clocks to spruce up the side table.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/06/its-go-time/', 'snippet': 'Travel clocks to spruce up the side table.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Travel clocks to spruce up the side table.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'It’s Go Time!', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'It’s Go Time!', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-06T16:00:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7b8fbb7e-45e4-5aa2-8ea9-873253cacd72', 'word_count': 77, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7b8fbb7e-45e4-5aa2-8ea9-873253cacd72'}, {'abstract': 'Veterinary school graduates must balance job satisfaction with economic realities.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/06/understanding-the-high-cost-of-veterinary-training/', 'snippet': 'Veterinary school graduates must balance job satisfaction with economic realities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a child, I dreamed of becoming a veterinarian. I collected pets of all sorts: gerbils, dogs, cats, rabbits (one of which was eaten by one of my cats) and finally, when I was a teenager, a horse. I devoured James Herriot’s series, “All Creatures Great and Small,” about a country veterinarian. My future career seemed clear.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Understanding the High Cost of Veterinary Training', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Student Loans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterinary Medicine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Herriot, James', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-06T16:02:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/66e499cc-5fb7-5de5-b406-6ae06b76798b', 'word_count': 273, 'uri': 'nyt://article/66e499cc-5fb7-5de5-b406-6ae06b76798b'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama was elected to a second term.