word_count': 311, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a8857550-2fb0-5811-9246-7c1e48f1442e'}, {'abstract': 'The lying game: Fact checking, as it turns out, is more of a cottage industry than a civic corrective.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/06/a-last-fact-check-it-didnt-work/', 'snippet': 'The lying game: Fact checking, as it turns out, is more of a cottage industry than a civic corrective.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As so many media outlets promised, this was indeed the most fact-checked election in history. At any given moment during the last 18 months, there were so many truth squadrons in the air that mid-air collisions seemed a genuine possibility.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Last Fact Check: It Didn’t Work', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McKinnon, Mark', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shafer, Jack', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wemple, Erik', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Associated Press', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'FactCheck.org', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fox News Channel', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Washington Post', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ohio', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-06T17:32:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Davi