 'word_count': 247, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d2e656aa-386d-5c1d-b1e9-ff0eab10c4b1'}, {'abstract': 'A damaged crane and lack of utilities had halted performances since Oct. 28.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/06/carnegie-hall-to-reopen-on-wednesday/', 'snippet': 'A damaged crane and lack of utilities had halted performances since Oct. 28.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Carnegie Hall said on Tuesday that utilities have been restored and that concerts, which had been halted since Oct. 28, would resume on Wednesday evening. The violinist Midori is scheduled to perform in the Isaac Stern Auditorium and the Belcea Quartet in Zankel Hall on Wednesday. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Carnegie Hall to Reopen on Wednesday', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Carnegie Hall to Reopen on Wednesday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Belcea Quartet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carnegie Hall', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-06T17:56:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel J. Wakin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Wakin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cd8671c3-c712-5526-abde-c0abf923e7b7', 'word_count': 102, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cd8671c3-c712-5526-abde-c0abf923e7b7'}, {'abstract': 'A view of the day in sports, including the ATP World Tour Finals and a couple of scares at soccer matches.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/11/06/sports/20121106photoreplay.html', 'snippet': 'A view of the day in sports, including the ATP 