th high FICO credit scores aren’t perfect but they pay their bills on time, an analysis from myFico says.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/06/secrets-of-high-credit-scorers/', 'snippet': 'People with high FICO credit scores aren’t perfect but they pay their bills on time, an analysis from myFico says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Have you ever wondered: Just what do I have to do to have a superhigh credit score?', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Secrets of High Credit Scorers', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Credit Score\r\nAchievers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit and Debt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit Scores', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fair Isaac Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-06T18:41:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3e689625-bf11-5b05-a357-86c1c0da1342', 'word_count': 437, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3e689625-bf11-5b05-a357-86c1c0da1342'}, {'abstract': 'The damage caused by Hurricane Sandy at the 9/11 Memorial & Museum may motivate museum officials to build in measures to safeguard the collection.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/06/911-museum-memorializing-one-catastrophe-can-learn-from-another/', 'snippet': 'The damage caused by Hurricane Sandy at the 9/11 Memorial & Museum may motivate museum officials to build in measures to safeguard the collection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Politics and nature have conspired to give the National September 11