://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/07/nyregion/five-years-ago-a-citizen-warned-of-staten-islands-vulnerability.html', 'snippet': 'After Hurricane Katrina, a woman whose family has lived on Staten Island for more than 40 years alerted public officials about the dangers of another weather disaster.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was the evening of the storm, before it had peaked, but the man from 73 Cedar Grove Avenue was on the phone. That was the house next to the Trainas’, across from a beach on Staten Island.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/07/nyregion/ABOUT1/ABOUT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/07/nyregion/ABOUT1/ABOUT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/07/nyregion/ABOUT1/ABOUT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/07/nyregion/ABOUT1/ABOUT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1402, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Home Is Gone, and the Structure Is Destroyed, Too', 'kicker': 'About New York', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Home Is Gone, And the Structure Is Destroyed, Too', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Staten Island (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Dorp (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-07T04:15:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk':