iberal Fantasy', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baldwin, Tammy Suzanne Green', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'King, Angus Jr', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reid, Harry', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-07T05:24:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Firestone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Firestone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/258f9d32-d296-5815-b24e-c039c0f44b6e', 'word_count': 404, 'uri': 'nyt://article/258f9d32-d296-5815-b24e-c039c0f44b6e'}, {'abstract': 'Few voters expect President Obama to seriously change Washington; most just want him to make it function.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/07/us/politics/obama-second-term-has-immediate-challenges.html', 'snippet': 'Few voters expect President Obama to seriously change Washington; most just want him to make it function.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For President Obama, now comes a second chance. An electorate that considers the country to be on the wrong track nonetheless agreed to renew his contract in hopes that the next four years will be better than the last.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/us/07assess/07assess-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xla