ters in the north by creating a no-fly zone for Syrian aircraft.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIRUT, Lebanon — Turkish officials said Wednesday that they were considering the deployment of Patriot missile batteries along the Turkey-Syria border, a move that could effectively provide protection for Syrian rebels by creating a no-fly zone over northern Syria.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Turkey May Deploy Patriot Missiles Near Syria', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Turkey Considering Patriot Missile Deployment Near Syria', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Free Syrian Army', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-07T09:52:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil MacFarquhar and Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MacFarquhar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/192bdc3b-763c-5d93-86fc-b6f510556f5e', 'word_count': 1054, 'uri': 'nyt://article/192bdc3b-763c-5d93-86fc-b6f510556f5e'}, {'abstract': 'Political and business leaders from India weigh in on Obama’s reelection.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/07/what-they-said-the-u-s-election/', 'snippet': 'Political and business leaders from India weigh in on Obama’s reelection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Barack Hussein Obama’s reelection in the United States was welcomed by the