ason-honors-a-f-c-pro-bowl-picks/', 'snippet': 'Peyton Manning and Andrew Luck, the old Colt and the new one, are among the selections at quarterback.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the elections over, football fans can shift their voting focus back to the N.F.L. Pro Bowl ballots opened a few weeks ago. With most of the teams having played exactly half their schedule, it’s time for a look at midseason honors. This A.F.C. Pro Bowl roster represents one man’s opinion (mine), based on what the film has shown this season. (Players are listed in order of merit.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Midseason Report: A.F.C. Pro Bowl Picks', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pro Bowl', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-07T12:38:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andy Benoit', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Benoit', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e6901e76-2a11-514e-a703-6104cbcb90a7', 'word_count': 1102, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e6901e76-2a11-514e-a703-6104cbcb90a7'}, {'abstract': 'Analysts are looking at the next stage of the market for smartphones and tablets.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/07/daily-report-the-smart-device-future/', 'snippet': 'Analysts are looking at the next stage of the market for smartphones and tablets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The smartphone is now a developed market. The tablet is newer, but is clearly catching on with consumers as more companies create products to compete with the iPad. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia'