, 76, said his book, titled “Tibetan Peach Pie,” would tell the stories from his colorful life, beginning in the Appalachian hills and across the continents of Asia and Africa.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/07/ecco-to-publish-memoir-by-tom-robbins/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Robbins, 76, said his book, titled “Tibetan Peach Pie,” would tell the stories from his colorful life, beginning in the Appalachian hills and across the continents of Asia and Africa.', 'lead_paragraph': '2:14 p.m. | Updated Ecco, an imprint of HarperCollins, said Wednesday that it would publish a memoir by Tom Robbins, the author of the 1976 bestseller “Even Cowgirls Get the Blues.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ecco to Publish Memoir by Tom Robbins', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ecco to Publish Memoir By Tom Robbins', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Book Trade and Publishing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Robbins, Tom', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'HarperCollins Publishers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'APPALACHIAN REGION', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-07T17:00:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Leslie Kaufman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Leslie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaufman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cbbabaca-9423-5b50-84cc-f226d5a10b5f', 'word_count': 176, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cbbabaca-9423-5b50-84cc-f226d5a10b5f'}, {'abstract': 'Twitter successfully managed a deluge of traffic, the polls held up, and Kar