as a candidate from the Green Party with 100 percent of the vote, and that is only a small part of what makes the whole story so bizarre.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/07/sports/basketball/07fredsmith/07fredsmith-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 712, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/07/sports/basketball/07fredsmith/07fredsmith-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1424, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/07/sports/basketball/07fredsmith/07fredsmith-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/07/sports/basketball/07fredsmith/07fredsmith-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/07/sports/basketball/07fredsmith/07fredsmith-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Former Globetrotter Wins Election by Globetrotter-Like Margin', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, State Legislature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Fred', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Harlem Globetrotters', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-07T19:02:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lynn Zinser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lynn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a718d5e1-a6ac-52f3-99b5-e9de51b919ae', 'word_count': 452, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a718d5e1-a6ac-52f3-99b5-e9de51b919ae'}, {'abstract': 'Confusion over helping out with wedding favors, and a guest’s irritation with behavior of the newlyweds.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/06/fashion/weddings/questions-and-answers-about-wedding-etiquette.html', 'snippet': 'Confusion over helping out with wedding favors, and a guest’s irritation with behavior of the newlyweds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Helping Leads to Awkwardness', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/02/11/fashion/weddings/peggypost/peggypost-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 288, 'width': 288, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/02/11/fashion/weddings/peggypost/peggypost-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/02/11/fashion/weddings/peggypost/peggypost-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/02/11/fashion/weddings/peggypost/peggypost-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'m