 'uri': 'nyt://article/f05c4b56-dd0a-5243-8bb9-b77c25430da3'}, {'abstract': 'The stars of the Heat had some advice for the Nets, who are exhibiting growing pains with an overhauled roster built around two All-Stars, Deron Williams and Joe Johnson.', 'web_url': 'https://offthedribble.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/07/in-heat-lessons-for-the-nets/', 'snippet': 'The stars of the Heat had some advice for the Nets, who are exhibiting growing pains with an overhauled roster built around two All-Stars, Deron Williams and Joe Johnson.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — The corridors outside the Miami Heat locker room are plastered with fresh images of the Larry O’Brien trophy and the beaming faces of a championship team. Few people remember anymore that, only two years ago, the star-studded Heat were in crisis.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In the Heat, Lessons for the Nets', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, LeBron', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wade, Dwyane', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Nets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miami Heat', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-07T23:27:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Howard Beck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Howard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Beck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cecbf78a-87c0-5a3c-a24b-58cee80e1e05', 'word_count': 565, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cecbf78a-87c0-5a3c-a24b-58cee80e1e05'}, {'abstract': 'Making an animated movie used to be labor intensive. Now you can create one easily using your smartphone.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/08/technology/personaltech/cartoon-tools-for-tapping-your-inner-disney.html', 'snippet': 'Making an animated movie used to be labor intensive. Now you can create one easily using your smartphone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s said that when making the animated masterpiece “Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs,” Disney’s animators shot over a third of a million frames of film by hand. Before computer graphics came along, animated cartoons like this involved shooting a frame of a painting or a model, then adjusting the scene minutely, then shooting another frame. And repeating. The technology, time and effort were considerable.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/business/SMART1/SMART1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 343, 'width': 540, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/business/SMART1/SMART1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 343, 'width': 540, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/business/SMART1/SMART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/08/business/SMART1/SMART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/business/SMART1/SMART1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cartoon Tools for Tapping Your Inner Disney', 'kicker': 'App Smart', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cartoon Tools for Tapping Your Inner Disney', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANIMATED FILMS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cameras', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-07T23:29:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kit Eaton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kit', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eaton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b4e4a3a5-bde1-5f7d-9f9c-057a71fa7ad0', 'word_count': 863, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4e4a3a5-bde1-5f7d-9f9c-057a71fa7ad0'}, {'abstract': 'The Other Israel Film Festival shows barriers of many kinds for Israelis and their neighbors, and Israelis among themselves.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/08/movies/other-israel-film-festivtal-explores-a-fractured-nation.html', 'snippet': 'The Other Israel Film Festival shows barriers of many kinds for Israelis and their neighbors, and Israelis among themselves.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Zohara is estranged from her ultra-Orthodox Jewish family and is living alone in the south of Israel as a modern single woman. On a drive for a rare visit to her family — her sister is getting married and, after painful negotiation, Zohara will attend — she is approached by a Bedouin Arab woman urgently seeking a ride. The Bedouin, Nariman, has her own family issues. She is escaping from a forced marriage to a despised cousin.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/arts/other-1/other-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/08/arts/other-1/other-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/arts/other-1/other-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/arts/other-1/other-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/arts/other-1/other-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/08/arts/other-1/other-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/arts/other-1/other-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Films Show an Israel Divided From Its Neighbors and Itself', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Films Show an Israel Divided From Its Neighbors and Itself', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-07T23:32:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ethan