'abstract': 'Top prize in the Electrolux Design Lab competition this year went to floating spheres that freshen the air.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/08/garden/an-air-filter-cleans-and-freshens-as-it-floats.html', 'snippet': 'Top prize in the Electrolux Design Lab competition this year went to floating spheres that freshen the air.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Aeroball, which is this year’s winner of the Electrolux Design Lab competition, is the kind of household item you expect to see in a sci-fi movie. The combination air filter-and-freshener is a collection of luminous hovering spheres, suspended by the competing forces of gravity and helium. When the Aeroball fills with dust and the helium dissipates, it floats to the ground, signaling the need for a filter change.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/garden/08TOOLS/8CURR2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 815, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/garden/08TOOLS/8CURR2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1631, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/garden/08TOOLS/8CURR2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/08/garden/08TOOLS/8CURR2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/garden/08TOOLS/8CURR2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '