 Museum of Tolerance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The entrance to the Museum of Tolerance in Midtown Manhattan is lined with quotes from major world figures about freedom, independence, diversity and liberty. Downstairs, visitors make their way through a series of video displays, photos and interactive exhibits that provoke questions of personal responsibility in a world full of violence and bigotry. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/sports/JP-TOLERANCE/JP-TOLERANCE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/sports/JP-TOLERANCE/JP-TOLERANCE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Slugger’s Penalty Includes a Walk Through History', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Slugger’s Penalty Includes a Walk Through History', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Detroit Tigers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hate Crimes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Plea Bargaining', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Holocaust and the Nazi Era', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Young, Delmon', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTI-SEMITISM', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Museum of Tolerance', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-08T01:14:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mary Pilon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pilon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f3e23f79-aa68-555d-a6c0-8182d5f1d7f3', 'word_count': 896, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f3e23f79-aa68-555d-a6c0-8182d5f1d7f3'}, {'abstract': 'Mellow Mushroom, which like many businesses follows consumers on Twitter, had decided as a promotional stunt to follow some of those consumers in person — with a film crew.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/08/business/media/companies-try-a-personal-touch-seen-by-thousands.html', 'snippet': 'Mellow Mushroom, which like many businesses follows consumers on Twitter, had decided as a promotional stunt to follow some of those consumers in person — with a film crew.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IT was while shopping recently at a farmer’s market in Raleigh, N.C., that Andrea Chiz Plyler realized she was being followed by an enormous mushroom. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/business/Adco1/Adco1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/business/Adco1/Adco1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1151, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/business/Adco1/Adco1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/08/business/Adco1/Adco1-thumbStandard.j