nd line, is the domain of football’s acrobats, its tightrope walkers and contortionists, where the fundamental art of catching a pass becomes a balance-beam routine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/08/sports/football/for-sideline-catches-in-football-artistry-prevails.html', 'snippet': 'The sideline, and the end line, is the domain of football’s acrobats, its tightrope walkers and contortionists, where the fundamental art of catching a pass becomes a balance-beam routine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A regulation football field measures 360 by 160 feet, and even with 22 players roving about, there is plenty of open space — more than an acre of it. On the fringes of that vastness, away from the collisions and the contact, a certain artistry prevails.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/sports/Y-CATCH/Y-CATCH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/08/sports/Y-CATCH/Y-CATCH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/sports/Y-CATCH/Y-CATCH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 641, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/sports/Y-CATCH/Y-CATCH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1282, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/sports/Y-CATCH/Y-CATCH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/08/sports/Y-CATCH/Y-CATCH-thumbS