agers spent the majority of Wednesday’s meetings debating possible rule modifications to instant replay and September call-ups.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/07/general-managers-looking-at-replays-and-call-ups/', 'snippet': 'While the most exciting item of the day was Jason Bay’s separation from the Mets, general managers spent the majority of Wednesday’s meetings debating possible rule modifications to instant replay and September call-ups.', 'lead_paragraph': 'INDIAN WELLS, Calif. — While hot stove rumors are what usually get headlines, the purpose of the general manager meetings is to discuss various rules changes and procedures.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'General Managers Looking at Replays and Call-Ups', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Major League Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-08T04:06:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jorge Arangure Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jorge', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Arangure', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2ce4b1d3-15d3-59b6-9a29-b142492836d3', 'word_count': 499, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2ce4b1d3-15d3-59b6-9a29-b142492836d3'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Favio, an Argentine actor, movie director and popular ballad singer, became politically active as his popularity increased.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/08/movies/leonardo-favio-argentine-film-director-dies-at-74.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Favio, an Argentine actor, movie director and popular ballad singer, became politically active as his popularity increased.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Leonardo Favio, a film director, actor and 