'nyt://article/7ef7f9d6-357d-5f7f-984a-17763e6ccd52'}, {'abstract': 'Every facet of cancer and its treatments transforms time. I am always counting on my fingers: remissions and recurrences, the months used up, the months left, the relatives and friends I cherish.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/08/living-with-cancer-its-about-time/', 'snippet': 'Every facet of cancer and its treatments transforms time. I am always counting on my fingers: remissions and recurrences, the months used up, the months left, the relatives and friends I cherish.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s time to renew my driver’s license! I never thought I would live to see the day. Back in 2008, when pressed to disclose my life expectancy, my oncologist estimated three to five years. Figuring that I was an average patient, I split the difference and believed I had four years left. Yet here I am, about to celebrate my fourth “cancerversary” with a trip to the dreary and backlogged bureau of motor vehicles, elated by the conviction that even if I expire within the next year or so, my license won’t. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_gubar/08well_gubar-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 676, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_gubar/08well_gubar-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1352, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_gubar/08well_gubar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_gubar/08well_gubar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_gubar/08well_gubar-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Living With Cancer: It’s About Time', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Cancer, a Different Rhythm to Life', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cancer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chemotherapy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-08T17:06:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susan Gubar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gubar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1e995e0f-26ce-5a67-b337-b6058bbbdd56', 'word_count': 914, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e995e0f-26ce-5a67-b337-b6058bbbdd56'}, {'abstract': 'The bank also disclosed in its quarterly filing that it had come to an agreement with the Securities and Exchange Commission to wrap up two investigations into mortgage-backed securities.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/11/08/jpmorgan-cleared-for-3-billion-stock-buyback/', 'snippet': 'The bank also disclosed in its quarterly filing that it had come to an agreement with the Securities and Exchange Commission to wrap up two investigations into mortgage-backed securities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JPMorgan Chase disclosed on Thursday that it had received the green light from regulators to buy back as much as $3 billion of its stock in the first quarter of next year, another sign that the nation’s largest bank is moving beyond a multibillion-dollar trading loss it suffered on a soured derivatives bet. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'JPMorgan Cleared for $3 Billion Stock Buyback', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgage-Backed Securities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dimon, James', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schneiderman, Eric T', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bear Stearns Cos', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'JPMorgan Chase & Company', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-08T17:09:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jessica Silver-Greenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jessica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Silver-Greenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8a719626-ed82-5166-9ae1-835d63c89a8b', 'word_count': 466, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8a719626-ed82-5166-9ae1-835d63c89a8b'}, {'abstract': 'Already suffering from cold weather fatigue? Here’s a rundown of deals that could help you warm up in the Caribbean for less.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/11/travel/an-island-guide-to-caribbean-deals.html', 'snippet': 'Already suffering from cold weather fatigue? Here’s a rundown of deals that could help you warm up in the Caribbean for less.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IT’S the time of year when those of us in cooler climates begin thinking about escaping to the Caribbean. We also begin thinking about how much that would cost. For anyone interested in a bargain basement deep dive, my colleague, Seth Kugel, found a four-day Caribbean vacation (airfare included) for under $600. (Read the story.) But that’s hardly the only path to the beach; there are other deals to be had, even in November. (Just don’t try to book a room for Christmas week.) Here, a quick island guide to help make the Caribbean more affordable.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11GETAWAY/11GETAWAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11GETAWAY/11GETAWAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11GETAWAY/11GETAWAY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1008, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11GETAWAY/11GETAWAY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1044, 'width': 1028, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11GETAWAY/11GETAWAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11GETAWAY/11GETAWAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11GETAWAY/11GETAWAY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': 