frica and Europe and how this is revealed in Renaissance art is the subject of an exhibition at the Walters Art Museum in Baltimore.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/09/arts/design/african-presence-in-renaissance-europe-at-walters-museum.html', 'snippet': 'The rich and complex exchange between Africa and Europe and how this is revealed in Renaissance art is the subject of an exhibition at the Walters Art Museum in Baltimore.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BALTIMORE — In a fall art season distinguished, so far, largely by a bland, no-brainer diet served up by Manhattan’s major museums, you have to hit the road for grittier fare. And the Walters Art Museum here is not too far to go to find it in a high-fiber, convention-rattling show with the unglamorous title of “Revealing the African Presence in Renaissance Europe.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/arts/09REVEAL_SPAN/09REVEAL_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 313, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/09/arts/09REVEAL_SPAN/09REVEAL_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 313}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/arts/09REVEAL_SPAN/09REVEAL_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 534, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/arts/09REVEAL_SPAN/09REVEAL_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 939, 'width': 1800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/arts/09REVEAL_SPAN/09REVEAL_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType':