from-visitors/', 'snippet': 'The dock that receives the large ferries filled with tourists arriving on Liberty Island from Battery Park in Manhattan and Liberty State Park in New Jersey was badly damaged by Hurricane Sandy and may need to be rebuilt.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hurricane Sandy did no real harm to the Statue of Liberty but caused “significant damage” to the infrastructure of Liberty Island and Ellis Island, which will leave them closed to tourists indefinitely, a spokesman for the National Park Service said on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/nyregion/08cityroom-statue/08cityroom-statue-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/nyregion/08cityroom-statue/08cityroom-statue-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/nyregion/08cityroom-statue/08cityroom-statue-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/09/nyregion/08cityroom-statue/08cityroom-statue-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/nyregion/08cityroom-statue/08cityroom-statue-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Storm Leaves Lady Liberty and Ellis Island Cut Off From Visitors', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Storm Lea