aigns, but it certainly is a weapon — a force multiplier, in military terms.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/blogs/obama-data/obama-data-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/blogs/obama-data/obama-data-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1383, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/blogs/obama-data/obama-data-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/08/blogs/obama-data/obama-data-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/blogs/obama-data/obama-data-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Obama Campaign’s Technology Is a Force Multiplier', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cloud Computing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-09T00:25:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steve Lohr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lohr', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/73703efb-2586-5d80-8f61-f6e058e3d675', 'word_count': 474, 'uri': 'nyt://article/73703efb-2586-5d80-8f61-f6e058e3d675'}, {'abstract': 'Now that we’ve destroyed America.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/08/meanwhile-europe/', 'snippet': 'Now that we’ve destroyed America.', 'lead_paragraph': 'So, American voters have spoken and sent the nation firmly on the path of destruction — God’s wrath for gay marriage, you know. So we can relax a bit on that front and turn our attention back to Europe, which remains, as Tim Duy says, very grim.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Meanwhile, Europe', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-09T00:27:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/53d861ab-582e-56d6-a745-4668e7155b39', 'word_count': 275, 'uri': 'nyt://article/53d861ab-582e-56d6-a745-4668e7155b39'}, {'abstract': 'The South African film “Otelo Burning” is a coming-of-age story set against the backdrop of politics and surfing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/09/movies/otelo-burning-set-in-south-africa-follows-surfers.html', 'snippet': 'The South African film “Otelo Burning” is a coming-of-age story set against the backdrop of politics and surfing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The lovely South African film “Otelo Burning” is a coming-of-age story with the grand sweep of history as its background, and its director, Sara Blecher, seems to know instinctively that the noisy excesses that sometimes creep into this ge