vide credibility to a company’s mission, and also freedom from a solely profit-driven business model.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/09/giving/a-new-yardstick-for-socially-conscious-companies.html', 'snippet': 'B Corp certification can provide credibility to a company’s mission, and also freedom from a solely profit-driven business model.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AS the holiday shopping season approaches, it’s easy to become overwhelmed by the superficiality of it all. But mission-driven companies like Sustainable Harvest, FEED Projects and BeadforLife offer an alternative: distinctive artisanal products that also finance antipoverty efforts. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Socially Conscious Companies Have a New Yardstick', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Socially Conscious Companies Have a New Yardstick', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BeadforLife', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Uganda', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-09T01:12:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Giving', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hilary Howard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hilary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Howard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/29a8c56c-d39b-5053-b49f-564906869f68', 'word_count': 1178, 'uri': 'nyt://article/29a8c56c-d39b-5053-b49f-564906869f68'}, {'abstract': 'Moments after being elected speaker of the House, Mark Ferrandino vowed to reintroduce a bill to allow civil unions for gay couples that Republicans had blocked in the spring.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/09/us/mark-ferrandino-is-elected-colorados-first-gay-speaker.html', 'snippet': 'Moments after being elected speaker of the House, Mark Ferrandino vowed to reintroduce a bill to allow civil unions for gay couples that Republicans had blocked in the spring.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DENVER — Democratic lawmakers in Colorado sustained a wrenching defeat in the final days of the legislative session last spring. A bill that would have allowed civil unions for same-sex couples was blocked from getting a full vote in the State House of Representatives by Republican leaders, who knew Democrats had the votes to pass it.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/us/COLORADO-2/COLORADO-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 340, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/09/us/COLORADO-2/COLORADO-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 340}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/us/COLORADO-2/COLORADO-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/us/COLORADO-2/COLORADO-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1993, 'width': 1993, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/us/COLORADO-2/COLORADO-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/09/us/COLORADO-2/COLORADO-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/us/COLORADO-2/COLORADO-2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Colorado Democrats Elect State’s First Gay Speaker', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Colorado Democrats Elect State’s First Gay Speaker', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Colorado', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferrandino, Mark S', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-09T01:12:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dan Frosch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Frosch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d5c20e58-8ab3-5a96-abe0-780e2449dc69', 'word_count': 564, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d5c20e58-8ab3-5a96-abe0-780e2449dc69'}, {'abstract': 'Roger Hertog helped pull the New-York Historical Society back from the brink of bankruptcy and rejuvenate it as a modern institution offering important and engaging exhibitions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/09/giving/roger-hertog-reviver-of-the-new-york-historical-society.html', 'snippet': 'Roger Hertog helped pull the New-York Historical Society back from the brink of bankruptcy and rejuvenate it as a modern institution offering important and engaging exhibitions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ABOUT six years ago, Roger Hertog opted out. He quit the business activities that had amassed him considerable wealth. He left almost all the many boards he served on, including the New York Public Library and the New York Philharmonic. The only thing he stuck with was the New-York Historical Society, in part because he is chairman of that board but also because he remains personally invested in the society’s mission: to relate the history of the country — through the prism of New York — from its founding through the present. ', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/giving/HERTOG/HERTOG-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/09/giving/HERTOG/HERTOG-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/giving/HERTOG/HERTOG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 742, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/giving/HERTOG/HERTOG-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1484, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/giving/HERTOG/HERTOG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/09/giving/HERTOG/HERTOG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/giving/HERTOG/HERTOG-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Patron’s Passion for History on Display', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Patron’s Passion for History on Display', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New-York Historical Society', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hertog, Roger', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-09T01:13:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Giving', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robin Pogrebin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pogrebin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/30d5fd42-ae46-5b69-967c-af11e69bdf85', 'word_count': 1132, 'uri': 'nyt://article/30d5fd42-ae46-5b69-967c-af11e69bdf85'}, {'abstract': 'Food banks and pantries are on the front lines during emergencies, but are increasingly providing long-term support, including access to fresh produce and education services.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/09/giving/food-banks-mission-expands-to-nutrition-and-education.html', 'snippet': 'Food banks and pantries are on the front lines during emergencies, but are increasingly providing long-term support, including access to fresh produce and education services.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FOR the recent East Coast hurricane, as in other emergencies, food banks were on the front lines with food, bottled water and cleaning supplies. They have long held sway in the public consciousness as providers of nonperishables. ', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/giving/BANKS/BANKS