ntatives last month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Long Island man planted a pipe bomb inside a Home Depot store as part of a $2 million extortion plot, threatening to detonate similar devices in three stores on a major shopping day if he was not paid off, federal prosecutors said Thursday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Employee Charged in Plot to Bomb Home Depots', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Home Depot Worker Is Charged in Plot to Bomb Stores', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Threats and Threatening Messages', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Long Island (NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sheehan, Daniel Patrick', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Home Depot Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Extortion and Blackmail', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black Friday and Cyber Monday (Shopping)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-09T01:45:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. David Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a1dcb68d-da2a-5ca6-8c7f-1485de9aa599', 'word_count': 610, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a1dcb68d-da2a-5ca6-8c7f-1485de9aa599'}, {'abstract': 'The move could be a sign that the marketplace is becoming resistant to the unfettered increase in the prices of cancer drugs over the last decade.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/09/business/sanofi-halves-price-of-drug-after-sloan-kettering-balks-at-paying-it.html', 'snippet': 'The move could be a sign that the marketplace is becoming resistant to the unfettered increase in the prices of cancer drugs over the last decade.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In an unusual move, a big drug company said on Thursday that it would effectively cut in half the price of a new cancer drug after a leading cancer center said it would not use the drug because it was too expensive. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sanofi Halves Price of Cancer Drug Zaltrap After Sloan-Kettering Rejection', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sanofi Halves Price of Cancer Drug Zaltrap After Sloan-Kettering Rejection', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Memorial Sloan-Kettering Cancer Center', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cancer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sanofi SA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colon and Colorectal Cancer', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Genentech Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-09T01:48:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dab076db-55dc-56fb-baf7-9b8bbb124e98', 'word_count': 735, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dab076db-55dc-56fb-baf7-9b8bbb124e98'}, {'abstract': 'The documentary “Burn: One Year on the Front Lines of the Battle to Save Detroit” uses one firehouse to illustrate the troubles of an entire department.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/09/movies/burn-directed-by-tom-putnam-and-brenna-sanchez.html', 'snippet': 'The documentary “Burn: One Year on the Front Lines of the Battle to Save Detroit” uses one firehouse to illustrate the troubles of an entire department.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Urban blight isn’t just a matter of widespread poverty, deteriorating housing, dysfunctional schools and street crime. At a certain point in a city’s decline its financial resources are so diminished that life-or-death services like policing and firefighting have to be cut back at the expense of public safety. “Burn: One Year on the Front Lines of the Battle to Save Detroit” is a compelling study of Engine Company 50, a firehouse on the east side of Detroit doing the best it can under dire circumstances. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/arts/09BURN_SPAN/09BURN_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/09/arts/09BURN_SPAN/09BURN_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/arts/09BURN_SPAN/BURN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 612, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/arts/09BURN_SPAN/BURN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 2009, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 