wned banks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/09/business/global/consumer-price-inflation-slowed-last-month-in-china.html', 'snippet': 'The results left further room for the Chinese government to continue heavy lending by the country’s state-owned banks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — Inflation slowed further in China last month, the Chinese government said on Friday morning, leaving further room for the Chinese government to continue heavy lending by the country’s state-owned banks to rekindle economic growth without stoking a broad increase in prices.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Consumer Price Inflation Slowed Last Month in China', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Consumer Price Inflation Slowed Last Month in China', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Producer Price Index', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Inflation (Economics)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-09T03:18:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Global Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Keith Bradsher', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Keith', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bradsher', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9a09789f-721d-54b0-bec7-2cc019b4ac56', 'word_count': 233, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9a09789f-721d-54b0-bec7-2cc019b4ac56'}, {'abstract': 'The 1902 Georgian-style East Side House Settlement, once an idyllic waterfront outpost of public charity, is now concrete-bound by six lanes of speeding traffic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/11/realestate/east-side-house-settlements-a-sight-to-see-when-traffic-stalls.html', 'snippet': 'The 1902 Georgian-style East Side House Settlement, once an idyllic waterfront outpost of public charity, is now concrete-bound by six lanes of speeding traffic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DON’T stop between 75th and 76th Streets to look up at one of the Franklin D. Roosevelt Drive’s most interesting works of architecture — you’ll get run over. That’s because the 1902 Georgian-style East Side House Settlement, once an idyllic waterfront outpost of public charity, is now concrete-bound by six lanes of speeding traffic, completely isolated from the public-benefit nexus it generated. ', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/realestate/11STREETS2_SPAN/11STREETS2_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/11/realestate/11STREETS2_SPAN/11STREETS2_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/realestate/11STREETS2_SPAN/streets-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/realestate/11STREETS2_SPAN/streets-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/realestate/11STREETS2_SPAN/11STREETS2_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/11/realestate/11STR