/article/7d50b3a2-f32c-5ba7-a5d5-82453c96924b'}, {'abstract': 'All over the New York region, people rediscovered the joys of electricity for a day or two only to be plunged back into frustration when heavy snows downed power lines on Wednesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/09/nyregion/in-second-storm-some-lose-power-for-the-second-time.html', 'snippet': 'All over the New York region, people rediscovered the joys of electricity for a day or two only to be plunged back into frustration when heavy snows downed power lines on Wednesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Todd Woodard, an actor, went to bed around midnight on Wednesday night happy that things were finally getting back to normal. After a flurry of canceled flights, he had reunited with his family in Jersey City. After days of bouncing around friends’ homes, his 2-year-old son and 4-year-old daughter were warm in their own beds. After a week without power, his cellphone was charging by his bedside.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/nyregion/POWER/POWER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/09/nyregion/POWER/POWER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/nyregion/POWER/POWER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/nyregion/POWER/POWER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012