s New York City’s commissioner of welfare in the 1960s, fiercely defended relief payments to the poor as both necessary and moral.', 'lead_paragraph': 'James R. Dumpson, who as New York City’s commissioner of welfare in the 1960s fiercely defended relief payments as both necessary and moral, died on Monday at a hospice in Manhattan. He was 103 and had served in various posts under five New York City mayors. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/nyregion/DUMPSON-obit/DUMPSON-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/nyregion/DUMPSON-obit/DUMPSON-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/nyregion/DUMPSON-obit/DUMPSON-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/09/nyregion/DUMPSON-obit/DUMPSON-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/09/nyregion/DUMPSON-obit/DUMPSON-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'James R. Dumpson, a Defender of the Poor, Dies at 103', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'James R. Dumpson, a Defender of the Poor, Dies at 103', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dumpson, James R', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subjec