r Kweku M. Adoboli, a former UBS trader in London, said that the allegations against his client represented a “character assassination” that failed to highlight the role of UBS’s management in condoning his trading activity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Kweku M. Adoboli, a former UBS trader in London, was cast by the defense in closing arguments on Friday as the scapegoat for a multibillion-dollar loss at the Swiss bank.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Adoboli, Ex-UBS Trader, Called Scapegoat for Bank’s Woes', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lawyer Says Ex-UBS Trader Is Scapegoat for Bank Woes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adoboli, Kweku M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'UBS AG', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-09T18:02:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2532675b-da59-592d-bb4a-c7d97aafef8c', 'word_count': 642, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2532675b-da59-592d-bb4a-c7d97aafef8c'}, {'abstract': 'Watching a new “Battlestar Galactica” series being shown on the Machinima YouTube channel.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/09/watchlist-a-battlestar-galactica-installment-on-youtube/', 'snippet': 'Watching a new “Battlestar Galactica” series being shown on the Machinima YouTube channel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Amid the daily outpouring of video-game-inspired dramas on the Machinima YouTube channel, a new series on Friday has name recognition that extends beyond the gaming world: “Battlestar Galactica: Blood and Chrome.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Watchlist:  A ‘Battlestar Galactica’ Installment on YouTube', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Battlestar Galactica (TV Program)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Web-Original Programming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lucas, George', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Machinima Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'YouTube.com', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-09T18:06:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Hale', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hale', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb4f5d0d-bcad-5b7c-9ca8-8c7ac294b562', 'word_count': 303, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb4f5d0d-bcad-5b7c-9ca8-8c7ac294b562'}, {'abstract': 'The motive behind the 2006 murder of Anna Politkovskaya, a reporter who was an unstinting critic of the Kremlin, was to instill fear in journalists, a top criminal investigator said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/10/world/europe/russian-investigator-speaks-about-anna-politkovskaya-killing.html', 'snippet': 'The motive behind the 2006 murder of Anna Politkovskaya, a reporter who was an unstinting critic of the Kremlin, was to instill fear in journalists, a top criminal investigator said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — The motive behind the 2006 murder of Anna Politkovskaya, a veteran reporter who was an unstinting critic of the Kremlin and its policies in Chechnya, was to instill fear in the country’s journalists, a top criminal investigator said in an interview published Friday. It was a bleak assessment of a case that remains unsolved six years after Ms. Politkovskaya was shot at point-blank range as she arrived home from grocery shopping.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/10/world/europe/10moscow/10moscow-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/10/world/europe/10moscow/10moscow-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/10/world/europe/10moscow/10moscow-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/10/world/europe/10moscow/10moscow-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/10/world/europe/10moscow/10moscow-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/10/world/europe/10moscow/10moscow-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/10/world/europe/10moscow/10moscow-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Russian Reporter’s Murder Was Meant as a Message, Investigator Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Russia: Message Behind a Killing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chechnya (Russia)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Politkovskaya, Anna', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-09T18:06:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anna Kordunsky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kordunsky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1f91c63d-ae51-5ffa-ba13-2604ba6085fe', 'word_count': 412, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1f91c63d-ae51-5ffa-ba13-2604ba6085fe'}, {'abstract': 'Judge Jones, a leading proponent of measures to prevent wrongful convictions, first came to public attention in 2005, when he issued an injunction against a transit strike, which was defied by workers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/10/nyregion/theodore-t-jones-jr-new-york-appeals-court-judge-dies-at-68.html', 'snippet': 'Judge Jones, a leading proponent of measures to prevent wrongful convictions, first came to public attention in 2005, when he issued an injunction against a transit strike, which was defied by workers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Theodore T. Jones Jr., a judge on New York State’s highest court, the Court of Appeals, who as a lower-court judge in 2005 clashed with New York City’s transit union during a three-day strike that shut down subways and buses at the height of the holiday season, died on Tuesday at his home in New City, N.Y., in Rockland County. He was 68.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '34', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/10/us/jones1/jones1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 779, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/10/us/jones1/jones1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1557, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/10/us/jones1/jones1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/10/us/jones1/jones1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/10/us/jones1/jones1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Theodore T. Jones Jr., Judge on New York’s Top Court, Dies at 68', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Theodore T. Jones Jr., 68, New York Appeals Court Judge', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Theodore T Jr', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-09T18:11:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dennis Hevesi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dennis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hevesi', 'qualifier':