times.com/2012/11/11/travel/caribbean-hotels-that-sell-more-than-sun.html', 'snippet': 'Properties from Aruba to St. Thomas are thinking beyond the beach, offering everything from open-air rooms to an adults-only infinity pool.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE good news for hotels in the Caribbean is that there’s little that they must do to draw visitors — the beach and the waters take care of that. The bad news is that every other hotel offers these amenities, so owners have to work doubly hard to stand out from the crowd. Several hotels have taken up the challenge. One is adding open-air rooms, another is helping stray pet adoption, another is marketing a cool factor that comes with starting off as a recording studio. Some are brand-new while others are spiffed-up older properties that remind visitors why the place was so special to begin with. Here are seven establishments that are peddling more than sunshine this season.\xa0', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11HOTEL_SPAN/11HOTEL_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11HOTEL_SPAN/11HOTEL_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11HOTEL_SPAN/HOTEL-5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11HOTEL_SPAN/HOTEL-5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11HOTEL_SPAN/11HOTEL_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11HOTEL_SPAN/11HOTEL_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11HOTEL_SPAN/11HOTEL_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '7 Hotels That Sell More Than Sun', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Beach Is Great, but Try the ...', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Caribbean Area', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hotels and Travel Lodgings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-09T19:19:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elaine Glusac', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elaine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Glusac', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0a033051-092a-53c1-8c95-f41e05db247c', 'word_count': 852, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0a033051-092a-53c1-8c95-f41e05db247c'}, {'abstract': 'From costumes to concerts, Barbados to the Bahamas, here’s a guide to Carnival celebrations across the Caribbean.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/11/travel/carnival-a-party-to-remember-an-island-at-a-time.html', 'snippet': 'From costumes to concerts, Barbados to the Bahamas, here’s a guide to Carnival celebrations across the Caribbean.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WE all have exultant moments: memories made to be bottled up, then uncorked and sniffed during dimmer times. In mine, I am in Trinidad. The sun is rising. I am drinking rum, dancing my way through the streets of Port of Spain during the staple of all Caribbean Carnivals, J’Ouvert: a dawn-till-lunchtime parade during which revelers smear themselves in many things — paint, oil, cocoa, mud. Vanity and identity are replaced by unadulterated joy in simply, magically being there during a sublimely over-the-top ritual.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11CARNIVAL2_SPAN/11CARNIVAL2_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 443, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11CARNIVAL2_SPAN/11CARNIVAL2_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 443}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11CARNIVAL2_SPAN/11CARNIVAL2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 973, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11CARNIVAL2_SPAN/11CARNIVAL2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1900, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11CARNIVAL2_SPAN/11CARNIVAL2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11CARNIVAL2_SPAN/11CARNIVAL2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/travel/11CARNIVAL2_SPAN/11CARNIVAL2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'su