ri': 'nyt://article/10beaf38-19ff-5681-8b06-0bb8b9326572'}, {'abstract': 'The Investment Dar Company of Kuwait, which owns 64 percent of Aston Martin, has retained advisers to help it sell its share, according to Bloomberg.net.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/09/report-james-bonds-carmaker-for-sale/', 'snippet': 'The Investment Dar Company of Kuwait, which owns 64 percent of Aston Martin, has retained advisers to help it sell its share, according to Bloomberg.net.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Investment Dar Company of Kuwait, which owns a 64 percent stake in Aston Martin, the British-based luxury sports car maker, has retained advisers to help it sell its share, according to a Bloomberg report on Friday. The news that James Bond’s favorite car maker was being shopped, in a bit of irony that even 007 might appreciate, came on the day the latest Bond movie, “Skyfall,” opened in the United States.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Report: James Bond’s Carmaker for Sale', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bond, James (Fictional Character)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Aston Martin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Toyota Motor Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-09T20:30:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jerry Garrett', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jerry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Garrett', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3fbb6ba3-2d5e-59e7-a3de-2d671fa3d76d', 'word_count': 321, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3fbb6ba3-2d5e-59e7-a3de-2d671fa3d76d'}, {'abstract': 'Alexandros E. Washburn, the urban design director for the Department of City Planning, is charged with making the cityscape, streets included, a more palatable place.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/11/realestate/alexandros-e-washburn-what-design-brings-to-the-table.html', 'snippet': 'Alexandros E. Washburn, the urban design director for the Department of City Planning, is charged with making the cityscape, streets included, a more palatable place.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MAKING an exception only for ice, snow or bridge closures, Alexandros E. Washburn, the urbane architect who directs the urban design division of the New York City Department of City Planning, commutes to work across the Brooklyn Bridge weekday mornings on a contraption he refers to as his Humvee.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/realestate/11DEBRIEF1_SPAN/debrief-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/11/realestate/11DEBRIEF1_SPAN/debrief-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/realestate/11DEBRIEF1_SPAN/debrief-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/realestate/11DEBRIEF1_SPAN/debrief-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/realestate/11DEBRIEF1_SPAN/debrief-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'th