s, father-daughter teams, the wheelchair and the elite athletes, the runners for charity, the international travelers. Many, like me, were looking to run their first-ever marathon. All were prepared to run not just any marathon, but the New York City Marathon, queen of races, with a crown of bridges and a necklace of streetlights. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On Staten Island, an Experience Deeper Than a Marathon', 'kicker': 'On the Run', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York City Marathon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Running', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Staten Island (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-09T21:15:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrea Retzky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrea', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Retzky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1e4078b1-4212-58d4-8f57-e1517648bac3', 'word_count': 499, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e4078b1-4212-58d4-8f57-e1517648bac3'}, {'abstract': 'Arvind Kejriwal has become an unlikely bomb thrower in Indian politics. His solution to corruption? The formation of a new political party, in time for national elections in 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/10/world/asia/arvind-kejriwal-stirs-the-pot-and-strikes-fear-in-india.html', 'snippet': 'Arvind Kejriwal has become an unlikely bomb thrower in Indian politics. His solution to corruption? The formation of a new political party, in time for national elections in 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The Ne