reet in Manhattan. Among the friends and family members who will take part in the service for Mr. O’Donnell, who died in August, are his brother Steve O’Donnell, an Emmy Award-winning comedy writer; David Hyde Pierce; Patricia Marx; the “Hairspray” director Jack O’Brien and producer Margo Lion; and the “Hairspray” composers Marc Shaiman and Scott Wittman, who will perform with Kerry Butler and other members of the show’s cast. The service, which is open to the public, will also include filmed tributes from John Waters and Jon Stewart.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mark O’Donnell Memorial', 'kicker': 'Arts, Briefly', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mark O’Donnell Memorial', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Funerals and Memorials', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Donnell, Mark", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-10T00:26:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'byline': {'original': 'Compiled by Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/9791327a-041b-551a-9ec6-ad10935ec867', 'word_count': 120, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9791327a-041b-551a-9ec6-ad10935ec867'}, {'abstract': 'An animated feature film adaptation of one of Hungary’s great plays, the lengthy “Tragedy of Man,” is making the festival rounds almost three decades after work on it began.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/11/movies/the-tragedy-of-man-by-marcell-jankovics-animator.html', 'snippet': 'An animated feature film adaptation of one of Hungary’s great plays, the lengthy “Tragedy of Man,” is making the festival rounds almost three decades after work on it began.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN 1996 the Hungarian Film Festival of Los Angeles screened 18 minutes of early footage from “The Tragedy of Man,” an animated work in progress by the director Marcell Jankovics. In the segment Lucifer and Adam visit a socialist community sometime in Earth’s grim future, a time when poetry and rose cultivation are banned, babies are issued numbers rather than given names, and the desiccated corpses of citizens are recycled to make household goods. Michelangelo — or at least his reincarnated form — is a frustrated factory worker; Plato spends his time herding oxen.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/arts/11TRAGEDY4_SPAN/11TRAGEDY4_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/11/arts/11TRAGEDY4_SPAN/11TRAGEDY4_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/arts/11TRAGEDY4_SPAN/11TRAGEDY4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 746, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/arts/11TRAGEDY4_SPAN/11TRAGEDY4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1332, 'width': 1828, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/arts/11TRAGEDY4_SPAN/11TRAGEDY4_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/11/arts/11TRAGEDY4_SPAN/11TRAGEDY4_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth':