l Subdivision — not counting Ohio State, which is ineligible for the Bowl Championship Series — four are on the road Saturday against unranked opponents. As Oklahoma State found out last year, title contenders overlook these late-season trips at their peril.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'College Football Matchups', 'kicker': 'The Quad', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Matchups', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kansas State University', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Louisville', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Notre Dame', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-10T00:40:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Weintraub', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weintraub', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/86ba59a9-5f2e-5672-80b6-2a7139dc5161', 'word_count': 521, 'uri': 'nyt://article/86ba59a9-5f2e-5672-80b6-2a7139dc5161'}, {'abstract': 'An exhibition at the Heckscher Museum of Art in Huntington shows how color reached a new level of cultural saturation in American paintings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/11/nyregion/a-review-of-absorbed-by-color-at-the-heckscher-museum-of-art.html', 'snippet': 'An exhibition at the Heckscher Museum of Art in Huntington shows how color reached a new level of cultural saturation in American paintings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Color has been studied, experimented with and theorized about for millenniums by writers and painters from ancient Persia to modern Los Angeles. But it reached a new level of cultural saturation in the 20th century, with the release by DuPont of an annual Automotive Color Popularity Report, the appearance of fluorescent paints like Day-Glo, and abstract painters’ becoming specialists in the effects of color. ', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/nyregion/11ARTSLI1_SPAN/11ARTSLI1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 425, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/11/nyregion/11ARTSLI1_SPAN/11ARTSLI1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 425}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/nyregion/11ARTSLI1_SPAN/11ARTSLI1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 725, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/nyregion/11ARTSLI1_SPAN/11ARTSLI1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1450, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/nyregion/11ARTSLI1_SPAN/11ARTSLI1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/11/nyregion/11ARTSLI1_SPAN/11ARTSLI1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/nyregion/11ARTSLI1_SPAN/11ARTSLI1_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Color: Theme and Variations', 'kicker': 'Arts | Long Island', 'conte