nds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Unicef and other organizations focused on children and education are marking today as Malala Day, with the goal of focusing attention on the recovery and the mission of Malala Yousafzai, the 15-year-old Pakistani girl who was shot by the Taliban last month for pressing for the right for girls to go to school.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Day for Malala and for Girls’ Access to Schools', 'kicker': 'Dot Earth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'PAKISTAN', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yousafzai, Malala', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-10T18:36:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew C. Revkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Revkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/120450b5-02f3-581f-bf28-cc85039effa2', 'word_count': 340, 'uri': 'nyt://article/120450b5-02f3-581f-bf28-cc85039effa2'}, {'abstract': 'A fear of hitchhiking has scared us off the virtues of car-pooling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/11/opinion/sunday/hitchhikings-time-has-come-again.html', 'snippet': 'A fear of hitchhiking has scared us off the virtues of car-pooling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ONE of the more dramatic measures to keep New Yorkers moving after Hurricane Sandy’s transit meltdown was mandatory car-pooling on bridges into Manhattan. Commuters griped about gridlock at checkpoints, and drivers were shocked by Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg’s suggestion that they pick up strangers. Potential passengers, too, were reluctant to get in cars with people they didn’t know. Some drivers were scrambling to find riders to meet the quota. Everyone was relieved when the car-pooling “nightmare” came to an end.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/sunday-review/11HITCHING/11HITCHING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 731, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/sunday-review/11HITCHING/11HITCHING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1463, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/sunday-review/11HITCHING/11HITCHING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/11/sunday-review/11HITCHING/11HITCHING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/sunday-review/11HITCHING/11HITCHING-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hitchhiking’s Time Has Come Again', 'kicker': 'Opinion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hitchhiking’s Time Has Come Again', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crime and Criminals', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Car-Pooling and Ride-Sharing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'valu