 you return an item paid for with cash. Several of you offered workarounds, like giving fake phone numbers. Others suggested fake names along with the fake numbers. (“Cash. Johnny Cash,” was one reader’s favorite.) A handful wrote to compliment Radio Shack’s service, and roughly twice that number wrote to denigrate it.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/business/11-HAGGLER/11-HAGGLER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 603, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/business/11-HAGGLER/11-HAGGLER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1207, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/business/11-HAGGLER/11-HAGGLER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/11/business/11-HAGGLER/11-HAGGLER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/business/11-HAGGLER/11-HAGGLER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Minutes Were Prepaid, but the Grief Was Free', 'kicker': 'The Haggler', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Minutes Were Prepaid, but the Grief Was Free', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Protection', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tracfone Wireless', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cellular Tel