 He was 79.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/sports/Hutchinson1/Hutchinson1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 461, 'width': 493, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/sports/Hutchinson1/Hutchinson1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 461, 'width': 493, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/sports/Hutchinson1/Hutchinson1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/13/sports/Hutchinson1/Hutchinson1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/sports/Hutchinson1/Hutchinson1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 0, 'width': 0, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Derek Hutchinson, Pioneer of Sea Kayaking as a Sport, Dies at 79', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Derek Hutchinson, 79,\r\nA Pioneer of Sea Kayaking', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kayaks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hutchinson, Derek', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-11T00:53:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Douglas Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Douglas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/b0799a09-6265-5b78-84c8-24fbc326afc6', 'word_count': 795, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b0799a09-6265-5b78-84c8-24fbc326afc6'}, {'abstract': 'The policy in which Texas state law officers bring vehicle chases to an end by using their weapons has mostly been carried out safely but has sometimes resulted in fatal errors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/11/us/texas-officers-truck-chase-is-under-inquiry.html', 'snippet': 'The policy in which Texas state law officers bring vehicle chases to an end by using their weapons has mostly been carried out safely but has sometimes resulted in fatal errors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — For years in Texas, state troopers have been safely bringing vehicle chases to an end by using their weapons. Suspects wanted for burglaries and other crimes who have led the police on chases through multiple counties have been apprehended after state troopers pulled up close enough to shoot the tires. In one case here, a state trooper waved his pistol at a kidnapping suspect as a warning to pull over, and then shot the pickup truck’s two left tires.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/us/ALT-JP-TROOPERS-1/ALT-JP-TROOPERS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/11/us/ALT-JP-TROOPERS-1/ALT-JP-TROOPERS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/11/us/ALT-JP-TROOPERS-1/ALT-JP-TROOPERS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'cre