 'uri': 'nyt://article/fef9e6c8-f694-5256-bf35-d11d5e429927'}, {'abstract': 'After beating the Magic by 39 points on the road on Friday, the Nets, out of sync and unable to hit their jump shots, still managed to beat them once more, at home on Sunday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/12/sports/basketball/nets-beat-orlando-magic-as-brook-lopez-scores-20.html', 'snippet': 'After beating the Magic by 39 points on the road on Friday, the Nets, out of sync and unable to hit their jump shots, still managed to beat them once more, at home on Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a sleepy Sunday afternoon at Barclays Center, the Nets lost their flow, misplaced their jump shots and still manufactured an 8-point victory. For that, they mostly had their defense, their rebounding and their depleted opponent to thank.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/12/sports/YNETS/YNETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/12/sports/YNETS/YNETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/12/sports/YNETS/YNETS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 753, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/12/sports/YNETS/YNETS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1507, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/12/sports/YNETS/YNETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/20