 occasion for extensive celebration in Russia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/12/world/europe/george-blake-british-double-agent-turns-90-in-moscow.html', 'snippet': 'The 90th birthday of a double agent from the height of the cold war who left Britain for Moscow has been made the occasion for extensive celebration in Russia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — The 90th birthday of a double agent from the height of the cold war has been made the occasion for extensive celebration in Russia, with a documentary film, a rare newspaper interview stressing his happy retirement in Russia and a personal birthday greeting on Sunday from President Vladimir V. Putin.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/12/world/1112RUSSIA/1112RUSSIA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 725, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/12/world/1112RUSSIA/1112RUSSIA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1444, 'width': 1023, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/12/world/1112RUSSIA/1112RUSSIA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/12/world/1112RUSSIA/1112RUSSIA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/12/world/1112RUSSIA/1112RUSSIA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Double Agent, Turning 90, Says, ‘I Am a Happy Person’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker':