o hours later by a crash between a bus and a truck. Combined, they caused hours of delays for morning commuters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two buses collided near the Lincoln Tunnel Monday morning, injuring about 20 people — at least two seriously — and snarling traffic for New Jersey commuters entering Manhattan.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bus Crash Near Lincoln Tunnel Injures About 20 and Snarls Commute', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Buses', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-12T15:48:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Flegenheimer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Flegenheimer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c7962f0c-ee03-51d3-8c13-39d7f1c5e160', 'word_count': 297, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c7962f0c-ee03-51d3-8c13-39d7f1c5e160'}, {'abstract': 'General Motors expands its discount program on new vehicles to include veterans who have been discharged from the armed services in the last year.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/12/wheelies-the-veterans-day-edition/', 'snippet': 'General Motors expands its discount program on new vehicles to include veterans who have been discharged from the armed services in the last year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In which we bring you motoring news from around the Web:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wheelies: The Veterans Day Edition', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': N