miere at the Stratford-Upon-Avon home of the Royal Shakespeare Company, where Mr. McCraney is an artistic associate, in November 2013, before being staged in Miami in January 2014 and later that month at the Public.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tarell Alvin McCraney to Adapt and Direct ‘Antony and Cleopatra’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'McCraney Tackles ‘Antony and Cleopatra’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCraney, Tarell Alvin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Public Theater', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Royal Shakespeare Co', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-12T17:21:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Piepenburg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Piepenburg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f8663534-29fe-5991-9873-53105bb9bffc', 'word_count': 233, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f8663534-29fe-5991-9873-53105bb9bffc'}, {'abstract': 'TimesCast: For F.B.I. agents, competing pressures in dealing with David H. Petraeus’s affair. | Animosity toward American military in Afghanistan. | Mining in Mozambique leaves the rural poor behind.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/100000001899065/private-affair-public-servant.html', 'snippet': 'TimesCast: For F.B.I. agents, competing pressures in dealing with David H. Petraeus’s affair. | Animosity toward American military in Afghanistan. | Mining in Mozambique leaves the rural poor behind.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TimesCast: For F.B.I. agents, competing pressures in dealing with 