f-match-bone-marrow-transplants-cure-sickle-cell-in-trial.html', 'snippet': 'Researchers conducting a trial have found that a bone marrow transplant from a donor who is only half-matched genetically can cure sickle cell.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In her mid-20s, Yetunde Felix-Ukwu wore a Fentanyl patch that delivered enough narcotic to knock most adults out cold. Yet it barely kept her pain, caused by sickle cell disease, tolerable. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/science/13TRAN/13TRAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 885, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/science/13TRAN/13TRAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1771, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sickle Cell Transplants Could See Wider Use', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sickle Cell Transplants Could See Wider Use', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sickle Cell Anemia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Transplants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Genetics and Heredity', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bone Marrow', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-12T21:41:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laurie Tarkan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laurie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tarkan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://arti