7a-588e-9604-4cffba8640e0'}, {'abstract': 'The annual Richard Tucker Gala, a popular celebratory concert with a star-filled program, introduced the Tucker Foundation’s top award winner for 2012, the lyric soprano Ailyn Pérez.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/13/arts/music/richard-tucker-gala-and-award-at-lincoln-center.html', 'snippet': 'The annual Richard Tucker Gala, a popular celebratory concert with a star-filled program, introduced the Tucker Foundation’s top award winner for 2012, the lyric soprano Ailyn Pérez.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You never expect a musically coherent program at the annual gala concert of the Richard Tucker Music Foundation, which was created in 1975 in honor of the great Brooklyn-born tenor to provide support to young American singers. This popular concert is a celebratory event where star singers contribute their services, rising vocal artists are showcased, and the latest winner of the Richard Tucker Award is introduced.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/arts/tucker/tucker-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 751, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/arts/tucker/tucker-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1501, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/arts/tucker/tucker-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/13/arts/tucker/tucker-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/arts/tucker/tucker-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Starry Arias and a Duet With Chemistry', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Starry Arias and a Duet With Chemistry', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tucker, Richard, Music Foundation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-12T22:56:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anthony Tommasini', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anthony', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tommasini', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/9eb484fa-b80d-500a-88b0-8566cfc1bb96', 'word_count': 647, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9eb484fa-b80d-500a-88b0-8566cfc1bb96'}, {'abstract': 'Christopher Jones, the chief executive of a medical device company, sat next to his wife-t0-be on a flight, and the two met in different cities around the globe for two years before getting married.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/13/business/a-flight-delay-that-ended-in-marriage.html', 'snippet': 'Christopher Jones, the chief executive of a medical device company, sat next to his wife-t0-be on a flight, and the two met in different cities around the globe for two years before getting married.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I HAVE two children and life is always busy. I love it, but any parent will tell you it can get crazy. When I’m on a plane, life slows down. I miss my family terribly, but sometimes I really like the quiet.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '