': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f55d0b1-faf6-5c32-8ddf-d541c7daa241', 'word_count': 1017, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f55d0b1-faf6-5c32-8ddf-d541c7daa241'}, {'abstract': 'Monday was the 14th day since Hurricane Sandy upended lives on the Eastern Seaboard, the longest two weeks of many people’s lives.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/13/nyregion/pockets-of-misery-persist-2-weeks-after-hurricane-sandy.html', 'snippet': 'Monday was the 14th day since Hurricane Sandy upended lives on the Eastern Seaboard, the longest two weeks of many people’s lives.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Coney Island, a 67-year-old man sleeps with plastic bottles from the bodega, filled with hot water, tucked in his armpits. Toilets unflushed by modern means for a fortnight have created a stench in the Rockaways that is so bad that one man keeps incense burning in his apartment day and night.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/nyregion/MISERY/MISERY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/13/nyregion/MISERY/MISERY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/nyregion/MISERY/MISERY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/nyregion/MISERY/MISERY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1328, 'width': 2032, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/nyregion/MISERY/MISERY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 