nd Connecticut.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/13/nyregion/lottery-numbers-for-new-york-new-jersey-and-connecticut.html', 'snippet': 'Winning numbers for Nov. 12, 2012, for New York, New Jersey and Connecticut.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nov. 12, 2012', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lottery Numbers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lottery Numbers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lotteries', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Connecticut', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-13T03:22:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'List', '_id': 'nyt://article/a5caf1d5-8ad7-5e0f-8afd-b12aa1a14b6d', 'word_count': 208, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a5caf1d5-8ad7-5e0f-8afd-b12aa1a14b6d'}, {'abstract': 'Exit polls reveal that what makes red America red and blue American blue is political division in the upper half of the income distribution, not the bottom.', 'web_url': 'https://campaignstops.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/12/red-versus-blue-in-a-new-light/', 'snippet': 'Exit polls reveal that what makes red America red and blue American blue is political division in the upper half of the income distribution, not the bottom.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The basic question driving the 2012 campaign was always clear: could Mitt Romney gain enough of the vote among older, upper-income white Americans to overcome President Obama’s overwhelming advantage among young, low-income and minority voters? ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Red Versus Blue in a New Light', 'kicker': 'Campaign Stops', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2008', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-13T03:24:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Gelman and Avi Feller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gelman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Avi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Feller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2713530c-8b37-51de-8e19-a4104a5ae0c1', 'word_count': 696, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2713530c-8b37-51de-8e19-a4104a5ae0c1'}, {'abstract': 'Because of Diwali, the Hindu festival of lights, alternate-side street-cleaning regulations will be suspended in New York City on Tuesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/13/nyregion/special-parking-rules-in-new-york-city.html', 'snippet': 'Because of Diwali, the Hindu festival of lights, alternate-side street-cleaning regulations will be suspended in New York City on Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Because of Diwali, the Hindu festival of lights, alternate-side street-cleaning regulations will be suspended in New York City on Tuesday. Other regulations will remain in effect.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Special Parking Rules in New York City', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headli