for-josh-gatt-a-title-in-norway-and-maybe-a-cap-in-russia/', 'snippet': 'Josh Gatt, 21, has been one of the most highly rated young players in American soccer in recent years, and this week he could get his first cap for the United States national team.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the United States national team heads to Russia for its final game of 2012 (10 a.m. Eastern, ESPN2), one of the players who will be hoping to make is long-awaited debut for the team is the Michigan native Joshua Gatt. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Josh Gatt, a Title in Norway and (Maybe) a Cap in Russia', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gatt, Josh', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "United States Men's National Soccer Team", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-13T04:02:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Sciaretta', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sciaretta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/32de2fe0-bd7f-58d7-a503-c82e65fe1347', 'word_count': 1035, 'uri': 'nyt://article/32de2fe0-bd7f-58d7-a503-c82e65fe1347'}, {'abstract': 'Adolfo Carrión Jr., a former Bronx borough president who currently has no party affiliation, is seeking Republican and Independence Party backing, an adviser said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/13/nyregion/adolfo-carrion-jr-quits-democrats-mayoral-bid-likely.html', 'snippet': 'Adolfo Carrión Jr., a former Bronx borough president who currently has no party affiliation, is seeking Republican and Independence Party backing, an adviser said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Adolfo Carrión Jr., a former Bronx borough president and Obama administration official, is all but certain to jump into the 2013 mayor’s race, not as a Democrat, but rather as an independent seeking the Republican nomination, according to his spokesman and others.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/nyregion/CARRION/CARRION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 791, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/nyregion/CARRION/CARRION-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1422, 'width': 1099, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/nyregion/CARRION/CARRION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/13/nyregion/CARRION/CARRION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/nyregion/CARRION/CARRION-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Likely Mayoral Hopeful Leaves Democratic Party', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Likely Mayoral Hopeful Leaves Democratic Party', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carrion, Adolfo Jr', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic