he grounds of a television studio and the international airport early on Tuesday, killing at least one person, Afghan police and other officials said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — Insurgents fired four rockets into the capital early on Tuesday, hitting a taxi, the grounds of a television studio and the international airport, the Afghan police and other officials said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Insurgent Rockets Hit 3 Kabul Targets', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Afghanistan: Deadly Rocket Attack in Capital', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kabul (Afghanistan)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRPORTS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-13T07:03:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3f9f12da-d324-5030-b029-0a0bb129e9ab', 'word_count': 216, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3f9f12da-d324-5030-b029-0a0bb129e9ab'}, {'abstract': 'Recent high-profile extradition cases — including that of a terrorism suspect set to be released today on bail — highlight inconsistencies in British policy.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/13/britains-dilemma-to-extradite-or-not-to-extradite/', 'snippet': 'Recent high-profile extradition cases — including that of a terrorism suspect set to be released today on bail — highlight inconsistencies in British policy.', 'lead_paragraph': '2:24 p.m. | Updated A British judge’s refusal on Monday to extradite a radical Muslim cl