 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aea0465c-bb21-5e6c-a3fd-a005f9e1cffb', 'word_count': 151, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aea0465c-bb21-5e6c-a3fd-a005f9e1cffb'}, {'abstract': 'New graduates are struggling to find work, especially in suffering Western economies. Meanwhile, employers may have a hard time finding top applicants. Both job seekers and recruiters are increasingly expected to cross national borders to find what they want. Are you a recent graduate looking for work? Or a company seeking that perfect candidate? What are some of the challenges you face?', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/13/its-not-speed-dating-its-job-hunting/', 'snippet': 'New graduates are struggling to find work, especially in suffering Western economies. Meanwhile, employers may have a hard time finding top applicants. Both job seekers and recruiters are increasingly expected to cross national borders to find wha...', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG —Two groups of potential partners—each with their own set of criteria and standards—work their way down the line. They size one another up as quickly as possible. Some have high hopes of finding that special spark. Some, bouncing back from rejection, just want to fulfill minimum requirements. Yet others have had to take an honest look in the mirror and lower expectations.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/world/asia/13iht-sreducjapan13/13iht-sreducjapan13-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/13/world/asia/13iht-sreducjapan13/13iht-sreducjapan13-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/world/asia/13iht-sreducjapan1