 Fogerty, the singer-songwriter and former front man of Creedence Clearwater Revival, whose hit songs include “Proud Mary,” “Fortunate Son” and the oft-misheard “Bad Moon Rising,” has become the latest rock star of a certain vintage to join the memoir parade. He will write a book about his life for Little, Brown and Company, the publisher announced. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/arts/fogerty/fogerty-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 292, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/arts/fogerty/fogerty-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 292, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/arts/fogerty/fogerty-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/13/arts/fogerty/fogerty-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/arts/fogerty/fogerty-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 112, 'width': 112, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Wrote a Book for Everyone: A Memoir From John Fogerty', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'John Fogerty Memoir', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fogerty, John', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Creedence Clearwater Revival', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LITTLE BROWN & CO', 'rank': 3, 'maj