pet': 'Pittsburgh eked out an overtime win over hapless Kansas City on a night when the Steelers’  play was as bad as the weather.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You really do have to feel for Pittsburgh these days, as the cold, gray days of winter approach and the bleak outlook is coming not just from the weather forecast. Its best sports team, the Penguins, are mired in the ridiculous N.H.L. lockout while its still-new arena sits there all shiny for no reason. The University of Pittsburgh football team has been a mess, and it is too early to tell whether the basketball team will torment its fans with another great regular season followed by a flop in the N.C.A.A. tournament. And now that the election is over, all of Pennsylvania no longer sits at the center of the political universe being swooned over by politicians. O.K., so maybe that part is a really good thing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tough Times in Pittsburgh', 'kicker': 'Leading Off', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pittsburgh Steelers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pittsburgh Penguins', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roethlisberger, Ben', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jackson, Phil', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nash, Steve', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McNabb, Donovan', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "D'Antoni, Mike", 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Lakers', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-13T16:29:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lynn Zinser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lynn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d9d1043a-5c14-5b65-bb91-763ef1672d07', 'word_count': 701, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d9d1043a-5c14-5b65-bb91-763ef1672d07'}, {'abstract': 'The subject of the One-Page Magazine’s Big Profile answers questions on being a seasoned actor and how fun it is to throw fake tantrums.', 'web_url': 'https://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/13/parker-posey-gets-to-work-and-gets-to-throw-a-fit-on-the-floor/', 'snippet': 'The subject of the One-Page Magazine’s Big Profile answers questions on being a seasoned actor and how fun it is to throw fake tantrums.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like election cycles and iPhone upgrades, a Parker Posey comeback always seems to be just around the corner. Not that this quintessential New York actor ever really went away, but suddenly Posey, who was featured on The One-Page Magazine this past weekend, seems to be everywhere all over again.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/12/magazine/12-parker-posie/12-parker-posie-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/12/magazine/12-parker-posie/12-parker-posie-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1365, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/12/magazine/12-parker-posie/12-parker-posie-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/12/magazine/12-parker-posie/12-parker-posie-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheigh