ure vegetarian (or vegan) turkeys.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/16/health/baked-acorn-squash-with-wild-rice-recipes-for-health.html', 'snippet': 'Serve one squash to each person at your Thanksgiving meal: They’ll be like miniature vegetarian (or vegan) turkeys.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The filling here is a Greco-Italian fusion, with a little American (wild rice) thrown in. I’m usually not a fusion sort of cook, but I wanted something creamy like risotto to fill these squash. Look for small acorn squash so that each person can have one. They’ll be like miniature vegetarian (or vegan) turkeys.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/science/16recipehealth/16recipehealth-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/13/science/16recipehealth/16recipehealth-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/science/16recipehealth/16recipehealth-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 649, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/science/16recipehealth/16recipehealth-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1297, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/science/16recipehealth/16recipehealth-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/13/science/16recipehealth/16recipehealth-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/science/16recipehealth/16recipehealth-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Baked Acorn Squash Stuffed With Wild Rice and Kale Risotto', 'kicker': 'Recipes for Health', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-13T16:53:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martha Rose Shulman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martha', 'middlename': 'Rose', 'lastname': 'Shulman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'recipe', '_id': 'nyt://article/5c464414-24b5-56f4-998f-854daa88e076', 'word_count': 863, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c464414-24b5-56f4-998f-854daa88e076'}, {'abstract': 'An Army wife writes about her military marriage and the practical steps that helped her family deal with post-deployment reintegration.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/13/finding-home-again-after-deployment/', 'snippet': 'An Army wife writes about her military marriage and the practical steps that helped her family deal with post-deployment reintegration.', 'lead_paragraph': ' I’ve been an Army wife for nearly a decade, but when I add up the days I’ve lived with my soldier, the days between the deployments and other military trips, the total is only about four years. Most of those days must be patched together into a crazy quilt of weeks and months, with off-day celebrations for the missed holidays and birthdays.', 'source': 'The New York Times'