0001901180/intersection-uptowns-sharp-style.html', 'snippet': 'Rebecca Bergen, born and raised on the Upper East Side, appreciates the typical fashion of the neighborhood, like Hermes Birkin bags and quilted jackets, but has her own sense of style.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rebecca Bergen, born and raised on the Upper East Side, appreciates the typical fashion of the neighborhood, like Hermes Birkin bags and quilted jackets, but has her own sense of style.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/fashion/video-1112uppereastside/video-1112uppereastside-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/13/fashion/video-1112uppereastside/video-1112uppereastside-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/13/fashion/video-1112uppereastside/video-1112uppereastside-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/13/fashion/video-1112uppereastside/video-1112uppereastside-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Intersection: Uptown’s Sharp Style', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-13T18:32:57+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'Joanna Nikas and Simone S. Oliver', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nikas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Simone', 'middlename': '