chief executive at the McCann Worldgroup since early 2010. Mr. Brien’s departure followed speculation that Interpublic executives were dissatisfied.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/13/leader-of-largest-unit-of-interpublic-group-is-replaced-as-rumors-had-predicted/', 'snippet': 'Interpublic has picked Harris Diamond to take the place of Nick Brien, chairman and chief executive at the McCann Worldgroup since early 2010. Mr. Brien’s departure followed speculation that Interpublic executives were dissatisfied.', 'lead_paragraph': '11:34 a.m. | Updated The widespread speculation that the Interpublic Group of Companies was planning to replace the leader of its largest division, the McCann Worldgroup, has turned out to be true, as rumors on Madison Avenue so often do.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Leader of Largest Unit of Interpublic Group Is Replaced, as Rumors Had Predicted', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brien, Nick', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Diamond, Harris', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Interpublic Group of Companies Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'McCann Erickson Worldgroup', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-13T23:16:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stuart Elliott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stuart', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Elliott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e550253-c5e4-52c3-bf09-4e2d6ac61ad7', 'word_count': 582, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8e550253-c5e4-52c3-bf09-4e2d6ac61ad7'}, {'abstract': 'Vaunte.com, a new by-invitation shopping site that will act as virtual host to a rarefied clique: editors, designers and well-born New Yorkers, who will flaunt and sell their plumage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/15/fashion/web-site-offers-privilege-of-paying-more.html', 'snippet': 'Vaunte.com, a new by-invitation shopping site that will act as virtual host to a rarefied clique: editors, designers and well-born New Yorkers, who will flaunt and sell their plumage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FASHION thrives on exclusivity, no less so on the Web. Insider cachet has long been the engine that drives members-only sites like Gilt Groupe and other purveyors of luxury fashion. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/fashion/15zVINTAGE/15zVINTAGE-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/fashion/15zVINTAGE/15zVINTAGE-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1344, 'width': 1008, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/fashion/15zVINTAGE/15zVINTAGE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/15/fashion/15zVINTAGE/15zVINTAGE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/fashion/15zVINTAGE/15zVINTAGE-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Privilege of Paying More', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Privilege Of Paying More', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Vaunte.com', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Commerce', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-13T23:16:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ruth La Ferla', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ruth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'La Ferla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/83c3dd14-20de-5ce7-8a67-4b828485c3de', 'word_count': 698, 'uri': 'nyt://article/83c3dd14-20de-5ce7-8a67-4b828485c3de'}, {'abstract': 'In Aurélien Bory’s “Sans Objet,” Olivier Boyer and Olivier Alenda perform with a robot built for automotive manufacturing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/14/arts/dance/compagnie-111-at-the-brooklyn-academy-of-music.html', 'snippet': 'In Aurélien Bory’s “Sans Objet,” Olivier Boyer and Olivier Alenda perform with a robot built for automotive manufacturing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You never know what you’re going to get with the French director Aurélien Bory’s nouveau cirque productions. Mr. Bory masterminds illusory works that encompass a multitude of specialties, including dance, theater, circus and technology. It can get gimmicky, but when his fertile imagination is intact, he doesn’t play around. Or rather it’s when he does play around that he strikes the right magical note. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/arts/compagnie/compagnie-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, '