4af', 'word_count': 440, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c90b3527-e142-54c1-8224-54170facc4af'}, {'abstract': 'Angel Olsen performed a mesmerizing set of her stark, clean and direct songs at the Glasslands Gallery on Monday, and everyone paid attention.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/14/arts/music/angel-olsen-at-the-glasslands-gallery.html', 'snippet': 'Angel Olsen performed a mesmerizing set of her stark, clean and direct songs at the Glasslands Gallery on Monday, and everyone paid attention.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Angel Olsen sang 10 songs at the Glasslands Gallery on Monday night, strumming an electric guitar with her thumb, occasionally picking a simple pattern. She beamed forth with a voice that switched between lax — quiet, neutral, relaxed — and over the top — semi-operatic, jumping notes in a warbling rip, in a few 50-year-old ways pointing toward English folk music and Patsy Cline. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/arts/angel/angel-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/14/arts/angel/angel-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/arts/angel/angel-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/arts/angel/angel-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/arts/angel/angel-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subT