 to hide information that it was stolen from a temple in 1972, according to papers filed in United States District Court in Manhattan.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/arts/14STATUE/14STATUE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 506, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/arts/14STATUE/14STATUE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1012, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/arts/14STATUE/14STATUE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/14/arts/14STATUE/14STATUE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/arts/14STATUE/14STATUE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sotheby’s Accused of Deceit in Sale of Khmer Statue', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sotheby’s Accused Of Deceit in Sale Of Khmer Statue', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHAEOLOGY', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reparations and Restitution', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Looting', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cambodia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'o