6acb-5286-838f-20786eef4abe', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/dcdea1a7-6acb-5286-838f-20786eef4abe'}, {'abstract': 'Watching new episodes of “Doomsday Preppers” in light of the Hurricane Sandy aftermath.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/13/channel-surfing-doomsday-preppers-after-the-hurricane/', 'snippet': 'Watching new episodes of “Doomsday Preppers” in light of the Hurricane Sandy aftermath.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Next time a storm or some other calamity leaves you with a refrigerator full of spoiled food and an empty stomach, you should probably not make your way to Plato, Mo., in search of sustenance. There’s a 15-year-old named Jason there who has made himself a baseball bat studded with nails – a “maceball bat,” he calls it – and he sounds more than eager to use it on you if you make a grab for his canned tuna.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Channel Surfing: ‘Doomsday Preppers,’ After the Hurricane', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Doomsday Preppers (TV Program)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-14T04:00:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil Genzlinger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Genzlinger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/925ee986-a6a3-5218-b96d-11cd6e716eeb', 'word_count': 471, 'uri': 'nyt://article/925ee986-a6a3-5218-b96d-11cd6e716eeb'}, {'abstract': 'The winning lottery numbers for New York, New Jersey and Connecticut.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/14/nyregion/lottery-numbers-for-new-york-new-jersey-and-connect