'word_count': 177, 'uri': 'nyt://article/affbd042-f698-5a0c-9bfe-9bc5bd91f7ad'}, {'abstract': 'Federal prosecutors in Manhattan have asked a judge to sentence former City Councilman Larry B. Seabrook to at least seven and a quarter years in prison for his conviction on political corruption charges in July.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/14/prosecutors-seek-prison-term-for-seabrook-of-more-than-7-years/', 'snippet': 'Federal prosecutors in Manhattan have asked a judge to sentence former City Councilman Larry B. Seabrook to at least seven and a quarter years in prison for his conviction on political corruption charges in July.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Federal prosecutors in Manhattan have asked a judge to sentence former City Councilman Larry B. Seabrook to at least seven and a quarter years in prison for his conviction on political corruption charges in July.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/nyregion/14seabrook-cityroom/14seabrook-cityroom-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 788, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/nyregion/14seabrook-cityroom/14seabrook-cityroom-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1444, 'width': 1111, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/nyregion/14seabrook-cityroom/14seabrook-cityroom-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/14/nyregion/14seabrook-cityroom/14seabrook-cityroom-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/20