el the Oslo peace accords and, possibly, to oust President Mahmoud Abbas and dismantle his Palestinian Authority, according to official documents made available to reporters on Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Israel Heightens Warnings Over Palestinians’ U.N. Bid', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Israel Heightens Warnings Over Palestinians’ U.N. Bid', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ABBAS, MAHMOUD', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'West Bank', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gaza Strip', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Palestinian Authority', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-14T17:39:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Isabel Kershner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Isabel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kershner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3a1b4b2d-3bdb-50a3-ab7d-784ed07835e4', 'word_count': 910, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a1b4b2d-3bdb-50a3-ab7d-784ed07835e4'}, {'abstract': 'On One Direction’s new album, “Take Me Home,” the group is rushing through its gestation period on the way to the magic that may await on the other side.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/15/arts/music/one-direction-rides-boy-band-wave-with-take-me-home.html', 'snippet': 'On One Direction’s new album, “Take Me Home,” the group is rushing through its gestation period on the way to the magic that may await on the other side.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A boy band is no thing to be in 2012, not when you know how it invariably ends: overblown third and fourth and fifth albums, intraband strife, the unfulfilled desire to be taken seriously, stratification of members from dreamiest to Styrofoam — iest. The template isn’t really a skeleton upon which new skin and muscle can be hung so much as a predetermined career arc that offers answers long before questions get asked.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/arts/15onedirection-span/15onedirection-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 352, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/15/arts/15onedirection-span/15onedirection-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 352}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/arts/15onedirection-span/15onedirection-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/arts/15onedirection-span/15onedirection-span-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1203, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/arts/15onedirection-span/15onedirection-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/15/arts/15onedirection-span/15onedirection-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/a