mes after school. But people are starting to think that in many cases, body weight might somehow be linked to diet and exercise.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2010/06/01/technology/Pogue-190-for-Email/Pogue-190-for-Email-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2010/06/01/technology/Pogue-190-for-Email/Pogue-190-for-Email-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': '2 Wristbands Keep Tabs on Fitness', 'kicker': 'State of the Art', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '2 Wristbands Keep Tabs On Fitness', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NIKE Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Exercise', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jawbone', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-14T20:56:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Pogue', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pogue', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/78cda7bf-fc02-5614-986f-ffc35c8b6361', 'word_count': 1329, 'uri': 'nyt://article/78cda7bf-fc02-5614-986f-ffc35c8b6361'}, {'abstract': 'The death of an Indian woman who was denied an abortion in Ireland last month during a long miscarriage prompted more than a thousand protesters to rally outside the Irish Parliament in Dublin on Wednesday night.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/14/vigils-in-ireland-for-indian-woman-who-died-after-being-denied-abortion/', 'snippet': 'The death of an Indian woman who was denied an abortion in Ireland last month during a long miscarriage prompted more than a thousand protesters to rally outside the Irish Parliament in Dublin on Wednesday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than a thousand protesters rallied outside the Irish Parliament in Dublin on Wednesday night, calling on legislators to review Ireland’s strict anti-abortion laws, Irish radio reports. The protesters expressed outrage over the death of Savita Halappanavar, 31, an Indian dentist who died of an infection last month after doctors in the west of Ireland refused to abort her fetus during a miscarriage that lasted three days.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Vigils in Ireland for Indian Woman Who Died After Being Denied Abortion', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yeats, William Butler', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ireland', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-14T21:00:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/28b428e9-6776-50ae-ad75-b9b0b832a00a', 'word_count': 471, 'uri': 'nyt://article/28b428e9-6776-50ae-ad75-b9b0b832a00a'}, {'abstract': 'Google now offers a number of apps that display the capabilities of Android-based tablets.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/15/technology/personaltech/apps-that-dart-and-delight-on-tablets-piloted-by-android.html', 'snippet': 'Google now offers a number of apps that display the capabilities of Android-based tablets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tablets are changing computing, there’s no doubt. I realized this when I saw my 2-year-old son pick up an iPad and master its basic controls, including discovering a child’s app, in about half an hour. The iPad led the way into this brave new world more or less alone at first. It has taken until now for the sheer pressure of innovation inside Apple’s rivals to lead to some great Android-based tablets finally making a mark.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/business/SMART3/SMART3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 620, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/business/SMART3/SMART3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 774, 'width': 1278, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/business/SMART3/SMART3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/15/business/SMART3/SMART3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/business/SMART3/SMART3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Showing Off a Tablet’s Graphical Powers, Android Style', 'kicker': 'App Smart', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Showing Off a Tablet’s Graphical 