6f7dee4-137e-595a-9933-e3722a10d453', 'word_count': 143, 'uri': 'nyt://article/96f7dee4-137e-595a-9933-e3722a10d453'}, {'abstract': 'From the founders of Troscan Design + Furnishings comes Room 406, a gallery that offers a mix of contemporary and vintage furnishings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/15/garden/in-chicago-a-design-gallery-that-feels-like-home.html', 'snippet': 'From the founders of Troscan Design + Furnishings comes Room 406, a gallery that offers a mix of contemporary and vintage furnishings.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Do you live here?” That’s what visitors to Room 406, right, a new design gallery in Chicago, sometimes ask the owners, Deirdre Jordan and Bob Robinson. They see three dachshunds lazing among a mix of contemporary and vintage furnishings and assume they’re in someone’s home.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/garden/15OPEN1/15OPEN1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 752, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/garden/15OPEN1/15OPEN1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1908, 'width': 1402, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Sales Place Like Home', 'kicker': 'Currents | Open', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Sales Place Like Home', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Troscan Design + Furnishings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-15T00:35:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Las