d an out-of-court settlement\xa0of £185,000, equivalent to about $295,000.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/16/world/europe/ex-politician-in-bbc-scandal-calls-accusations-rubbish.html', 'snippet': 'Alistair McAlpine, who was wrongly implicated in child sexual abuse by the BBC, reached an out-of-court settlement\xa0of £185,000, equivalent to about $295,000.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — A former British politician who was wrongly implicated in child sexual abuse by the British Broadcasting Corporation has reached an out-of-court settlement\xa0of £185,000, equivalent to about $295,000, to settle his libel claim against the beleaguered broadcaster, the BBC said in a statement on Thursday night.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ex-Politician Reaches Settlement With BBC Over Libel Claim', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Britain: BBC Settles a Libel Claim', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'British Broadcasting Corp', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Libel and Slander', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Savile, Jimmy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McAlpine, Alistair', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-15T09:37:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By John F. Burns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': 'F.', 'lastname': 'Burns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/512fffc7-9977-518a-9ae4-d74a41e449d8', 'word_count': 1018, 'uri': 'nyt://article/512fffc7-9977-518a-9ae4-d74a41e449d8'}, {'abstract': 'In what ways does this Swedish school try to blur traditional gender roles?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/15/blurring-gender-lines-for-preschoolers/', 'snippet': 'In what ways does this Swedish school try to blur traditional gender roles?', 'lead_paragraph': ' In “Swedish School’s Big Lesson Begins With Dropping Personal Pronouns,” John Tagliabue writes about a Swedish school that de-emphasizes gender lines. Read it to answer the questions below.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/world/STOCKHOLM-1-LN/STOCKHOLM-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/14/world/STOCKHOLM-1-LN/STOCKHOLM-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/world/STOCKHOLM-1-LN/STOCKHOLM-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 691, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/world/STOCKHOLM-1-LN/STOCKHOLM-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1381, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/world/STOCKHOLM-1-LN/STOCKHOLM-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/14/world/STOCKHOLM-1-LN/STOCKHOLM-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/14/world/STOCKHOLM-1-LN/ST