missions process.', 'web_url': 'https://thechoice.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/15/envelope-please-will-walker-3/', 'snippet': 'Will Walker, a student at University School in Hunting Valley, Ohio, is trying not to get discouraged by his pending fate in the early admissions process.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A couple of weeks ago, my economics class started talking about utility, the economic term for the amount of use, benefit or happiness a consumer derives from buying a particular object. As of now, most economists measure utility in American dollars, but back in the day they used utils — abstract units of utility — to measure the amount of happiness you’d get out of a given purchase.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-will/envpls13-will-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 670, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-will/envpls13-will-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 670, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-will/envpls13-will-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-will/envpls13-will-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-will/envpls13-will-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In the Early Admissions Waiting Room, Fighting Off Jitters', 'kicker':