cle/92e999ab-f690-51e5-a860-14977a078213'}, {'abstract': 'The loss, more than triple the deficit last year, includes a decline in revenue from mailing operations and accounting expenses related to the agency’s future retiree health benefits fund.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/16/us/politics/postal-service-reports-a-nearly-16-billion-loss.html', 'snippet': 'The loss, more than triple the deficit last year, includes a decline in revenue from mailing operations and accounting expenses related to the agency’s future retiree health benefits fund.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Postal Service on Thursday reported a record $15.9 billion net loss for the fiscal year that ended Sept. 30, bringing the financially troubled agency another step closer to insolvency.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Postal Service Reports Loss of $15 Billion', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Postal Service Reports Loss Of $15 Billion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Postal Service and Post Offices', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Postal Service (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-15T17:59:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ron Nixon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ron', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nixon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa748ff5-177d-5f2d-a50c-bd819775be45', 'word_count': 544, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa748ff5-177d-5f2d-a50c-bd819775be45'}, {'abstract': 'The star of “Anna Karenina” is cool and collected in a mint green Erdem dress.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/15/look-of-the-moment-keira-knightley-2/', 'snippet': 'The star of “Anna Karenina” is cool and collected in a mint green Erdem dress.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Look: Calm and Collected. A cool mint dress decorated with lace needs little else — leave the neckline naked! — to have an enchanting effect. With hands in pockets the statement is so beautifully relaxed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Look of The Moment | Keira Knightley', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Knightley, Keira', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-15T18:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/031181e0-50b6-5b33-9505-c7e30934bcea', 'word_count': 58, 'uri': 'nyt://article/031181e0-50b6-5b33-9505-c7e30934bcea'}, {'abstract': 'A business owner learns what separates Houston from New York — and how her company has to adjust.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/15/struggling-to-learn-what-works-in-a-new-market/', 'snippet': 'A business owner learns what separates Houston from New York — and how her company has to adjust.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a recent post, Alexandra Mayzler, the She Owns It business group member who owns Thinking Caps Tutoring, said her company’s Houston outpost, which opened in January, was off to a slow start. As one reader commented, “what works well in one city, may not elsewhere.” The good news: the last couple of months have helped Ms. Mayzler understand crucial differences between her New York and Houston markets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Struggling to Learn What Works in a New Market', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tutors and Tutoring', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Austin (Tex)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Houston (Tex)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-15T18:00:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adriana Gardella', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adriana', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gardella', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/620c9084-5754-502c-aea9-28eb02791a8b', 'word_count': 827, 'uri': 'nyt://article/620c9084-5754-502c-aea9-28eb02791a8b'}, {'abstract': 'Mount Airy Casino Resort steps up on luxury.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/15/mount-airy-is-adding-pool-lounge-and-bar/', 'snippet': 'Mount Airy Casino Resort steps up on luxury.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mount Airy Casino Resort, whose first iteration was a resort that was advertised in the 1980s with an amazingly catchy jingle (“All you need to bring is your love for everything …”), is adding another enhancement to the property: a $5 million pool and bar/lounge.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mount Airy Is Adding Pool, Lounge and Bar', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mount Airy Is Adding Pool, Lounge and Bar', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Casinos', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mount Airy Casino Resort', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-15T18:00:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Monica Drake', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Monica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Drake', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0c9b6d38-c8fd-5640-9795-fb3d90682aad', 'word_count': 165, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0c9b6d38-c8fd-5640-9795-fb3d90682aad'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Nolan, the filmmaker behind blockbuster hits like “Inception” and “The Dark Knight Rises,” will discuss his career and revisit clips from his movies at a Nov. 28 event.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/15/film-society-of-lincoln-center-offers-an-evening-with-christopher-nolan/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Nolan, the filmmaker behind blockbuster hits like “Inception” and “The Dark Knight Rises,” will discuss his career and revisit clips from his movies at a Nov. 28 event.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What exactly might an evening with Christopher Nolan, the filmmaker and blockbuster auteur behind movies like “Inception” and “The Dark Knight Rises,” consist of? A quick ride through the nighttime sky in a bat-shaped vehicle? A few hours spent lying on the floor, inhabiting his dreams of Escher-like hotels and mountain fortresses? A vigorous discussion of who inspired Tom Hardy’s voice for Bane?', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/arts/nolan/nolan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_