ths to her high-fashion peers at the IHT Luxury Conference: The Promise of Africa, The Power of the Mediterranean.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/15/we-will-not-save-the-world-by-fashion/', 'snippet': 'The iconoclastic English fashion designer and environmental activist Vivienne Westwood delivers some hard truths to her high-fashion peers at the IHT Luxury Conference: The Promise of Africa, The Power of the Mediterranean.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — When it came time for the iconoclastic English fashion designer and environmental campaigner Dame Vivienne Westwood to take the podium at the International Herald Tribune’s Luxury Conference, which this year focuses on the luxury market and Africa, she chose to speak about “things worrying me,” with climate change at the top of her list. “I am traumatized by this problem,” she said. And all of humanity should be too. “We’re just not looking at the future,” she rued.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/blogs/15rdv-westwood-women-africa/15rdv-westwood-women-africa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/15/blogs/15rdv-westwood-women-africa/15rdv-westwood-women-africa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘We Will Not Save the World by Fashion’', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Westwood, Vivienne', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-15T20:15:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_n