lapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/15/with-contract-talks-stalled-more-cancellations-are-expected/', 'snippet': 'The N.H.L. and its players’ association failed to communicate for a third straight day Thursday as the league lockout hit the two-month mark, with no new talks scheduled and more game cancellations imminent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The N.H.L. and the players union failed to communicate for a fourth consecutive day Thursday as the league lockout hit another grim milestone, the two-month mark, with no talks scheduled and more game cancellations imminent.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With Contract Talks Stalled, More Cancellations Are Expected', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lockout’s Grim Outlook', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Hockey League', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-15T22:41:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ed3a1a2b-4574-5474-a78e-860faa15896e', 'word_count': 320, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ed3a1a2b-4574-5474-a78e-860faa15896e'}, {'abstract': 'A newborn half-human, half-vampire child is the nominal centerpiece for the final movie in the “Twilight” franchise.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/16/movies/the-twilight-saga-breaking-dawn-part-2-ends-the-series.html', 'snippet': 'A newborn half-human, half-vampire child is the nominal centerpiece for the final movie in the “Twilight” franchise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Heads pop like Champagne corks in “The Twilight Saga: Breaking Dawn — Part 2,” the final chapter in the megamillion-dollar series about love, war and franchise immortality. And why not? Even with the lavish blood bath that slathers this movie red and pops those tops, these are joyous times for Bella (Kristen Stewart), who has risen revived, restyled and stone-cold dead after dropping a new addition to the Cullen family, those veritable vegan vampires who snack on woodland creatures instead of humans. After Bella nearly died during pregnancy in the last movie, her undead husband, Edward (Robert Pattinson), saved her by piercing her neck, thus at long last making a vampire out of her. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/16/movies/16twilight-span/16twilight-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/16/movies/16twilight-span/16twilight-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/16/movies/16twilight-span/16twilight-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/16/movies/16twilight-span/16twilight-span-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/16/movies/16twilight-span/16twilight-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/16/movies/16twilight-span/16twilight-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {