ment that Mr. Wainwright bought when he was living “the bohemian life.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'A FINNISH rug on the floor of the studio Rufus Wainwright owns near Gramercy Park depicts two whales circling each other. Mr. Wainwright and his husband, Jörn Weisbrodt, the artistic director of the Luminato Festival in Toronto, bought the rug at Tiina, a home furnishings store in Amagansett, right around the time they got married in August. And part of what they loved so much about it, Mr. Wainwright said, was that it’s “kind of how we feel in this apartment: two whales in an aquarium.”', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/realestate/18WHAT1_SPAN/18WHAT1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/18/realestate/18WHAT1_SPAN/18WHAT1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/realestate/18WHAT1_SPAN/18WHAT1_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/realestate/18WHAT1_SPAN/18WHAT1_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/realestate/18WHAT1_SPAN/18WHAT1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/18/realestate/18WHAT1_SPAN/18WHAT1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge