 and San Francisco’s Buster Posey was the first catcher to win the National League batting title in 70 years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/16/sports/baseball/miguel-cabrera-and-buster-posey-win-baseballs-mvp-awards.html', 'snippet': 'Detroit’s Miguel Cabrera was the first player to win the triple crown in 45 years, and San Francisco’s Buster Posey was the first catcher to win the National League batting title in 70 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The final pitch of the World Series was a fastball to Miguel Cabrera that settled into Buster Posey’s glove for a called third strike. It was a fitting way to end a baseball season in which both were voted their league’s most valuable player by emphatic margins.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/16/sports/baseball/16mvp/16mvp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/16/sports/baseball/16mvp/16mvp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/16/sports/baseball/16mvp/16mvp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 757, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/16/sports/baseball/16mvp/16mvp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1514, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/16/sports/baseball/16mvp/16mvp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/16/sports/baseball/16mvp/16mvp-thumbStandard.