45'}, {'abstract': 'Parker Posey plays the new, hard-charging boss of a supermarket chain in this workplace comedy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/16/movies/price-check-a-comedy-by-michael-walker.html', 'snippet': 'Parker Posey plays the new, hard-charging boss of a supermarket chain in this workplace comedy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The indie film goddess Parker Posey cuts a ferociously funny swath through Michael Walker’s “Price Check,” a corporate comedy that tells you more than you ever wanted to know about the hypercompetitive world of retail marketing. In several scenes where pricing strategies are analyzed and debated, your eyes may begin to glaze over. But be patient; the verbal mumbo-jumbo lends the story a necessary gloss of realism. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/16/arts/16PRICE_SPAN/16PRICE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/16/arts/16PRICE_SPAN/16PRICE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/16/arts/16PRICE_SPAN/PRICE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/16/arts/16PRICE_SPAN/PRICE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/16/arts/16PRICE_SPAN/16PRICE_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/16/ar