 it is producing nuclear fuel that could quickly be converted to use in a nuclear weapon, international inspectors reported on Friday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/17/world/middleeast/irans-fordow-nuclear-complex-reaches-capacity.html', 'snippet': 'Iran has finished installing equipment at an underground site where it is producing nuclear fuel that could quickly be converted to use in a nuclear weapon, international inspectors reported on Friday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Iran has finished installing all the critical equipment at a deep underground site where it is producing nuclear fuel that could quickly be converted to use in a nuclear weapon, international inspectors reported on Friday. But they said Iran has yet to ramp up production, leaving several months for President Obama and his allies to work on a diplomatic solution that could avoid a military confrontation.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/world/middleeast/17iran-making-progress/17iran-making-progress-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 358, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/world/middleeast/17iran-making-progress/17iran-making-progress-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 358, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Iran’s Fordo Nuclear Complex Reaches Capacity', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Iran Complex Is Said to Reach Capacity', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Energy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'