e-are-proud-to-present-a-presentation-at-soho-rep.html', 'snippet': '“We Are Proud to Present a Presentation,” at SoHo Rep, puts the audience square in the middle of deliberations over how to put on this play.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ever wonder what it would be like to be in the rehearsal room when actors are digging ferociously into their psyches to discover a moment of revelation, or arguing heatedly over a character’s motivation? Your curiosity can be amply satisfied at Soho Rep, where an inventive new play by Jackie Sibblies Drury wedges the audience between the actors and their art. The incendiary results — consistently funny but ultimately discomfiting — probably won’t have you pestering your actor friends to repeat the experience.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/SUB-17PROUD-jp/SUB-17PROUD-jp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 382, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/SUB-17PROUD-jp/SUB-17PROUD-jp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 382}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/SUB-17PROUD-jp/SUB-17PROUD-jp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/SUB-17PROUD-jp/SUB-17PROUD-jp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1420, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/SUB-17PROUD-jp/SUB-17PROUD-jp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/