ccupations tracked by the government in terms of job growth to 2020. Here is a range of those job projections, which were made in 2010, just as the apps era was beginning in earnest.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Job Prospects for App Writers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Software', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-17T00:08:47+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Business Day', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/8c07bcd1-5ac3-5bbb-bb5a-a5670a05e267', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/8c07bcd1-5ac3-5bbb-bb5a-a5670a05e267'}, {'abstract': 'As the gothic romance vampire series “Twilight” ends with the release of the final film, fans on Thursday night in New York were not as fervent as those in other parts of the country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/17/movies/twilight-saga-breaking-dawn-part-2-fans-bid-farewell.html', 'snippet': 'As the gothic romance vampire series “Twilight” ends with the release of the final film, fans on Thursday night in New York were not as fervent as those in other parts of the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'All across the country, members of Team Edward and Team Jacob — not to mention Team Bella and Team Renesmee — were squaring off, as the final installment of the “Twilight” film series had its premiere on Thursday evening. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/17TWILIGHT-jp/17TWILIGHT-jp-article