ive Arts features works by four choreographers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/17/arts/music/the-barnard-project-at-new-york-live-arts.html', 'snippet': 'The Barnard Project at New York Live Arts features works by four choreographers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This year, as usual, the Barnard Project assembled a group of choreographers to create dances for students at both Barnard College and Columbia University. But there was a shift from previous seasons, and it was a happy one: the choreographers were all promising names. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/17BARNARD/17BARNARD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/17BARNARD/17BARNARD-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/17BARNARD/17BARNARD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/17BARNARD/17BARNARD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/17BARNARD/17BARNARD-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Students Take Over the Stage to Help Others Make Their Mark', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Students Take Over the Stage To Help Others Make Their Mark', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, '