 ice cream. She smiles broadly when I suggest that her skill, making great-tasting vegan and raw food, might be more difficult than “real” cooking — after all, making everything from scratch takes on a whole new meaning when you make your own sour cream. “You just put stuff in the blender,” she says. Right.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/nyregion/18DINECT1/18DINECT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/nyregion/18DINECT1/18DINECT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/nyregion/18DINECT1/18DINECT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/18/nyregion/18DINECT1/18DINECT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/nyregion/18DINECT1/18DINECT1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Artistry at Work in a Vegan Menu', 'kicker': 'Connecticut Dining | Chester', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Artistry at Work In a Vegan Menu', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carr, Rachel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chester (Conn)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Six Main Restaurant (Chester, Conn)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-17T01:22:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephanie Lyness', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephanie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lyness', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/0290b6f1-b5e3-5d67-bf85-e5d7b5cf4d57', 'word_count': 985, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0290b6f1-b5e3-5d67-bf85-e5d7b5cf4d57'}, {'abstract': 'Richard Maxwell’s acclaimed play had lost its final weekend due to flooding at the theater in the Kitchen.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/16/neutral-hero-to-get-final-performances-as-kitchen-regroups-post-hurricane/', 'snippet': 'Richard Maxwell’s acclaimed play had lost its final weekend due to flooding at the theater in the Kitchen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Richard Maxwell’s play “Neutral Hero” will finally get its last weekend of performances in the first floor theater of the Kitchen, which is being renovated after extensive flooding damage from Hurricane Sandy.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Neutral Hero’ to Get Final Performances as Kitchen Regroups Post-Hurricane', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'u2018Neutral Herou2019 to Have Final Performances', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maxwell, Richard (1967- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-17T01:23:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Felicia R. Lee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Felicia', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Lee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aac013b4-235f-5209-8b9f-6a3e38a6269e', 'word_count': 152, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aac013b4-235f-5209-8b9f-6a3e38a6269e'}, {'abstract': 'Johnny Damon was 2 for 4 with a run scored, but his Thailand team was eliminated from the Classic qualifying by New Zealand, 12-2, in eight innings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/17/sports/baseball/johnny-damon-and-thailand-eliminated-from-world-baseball-classic.html', 'snippet': 'Johnny Damon was 2 for 4 with a run scored, but his Thailand team was eliminated from the Classic qualifying by New Zealand, 12-2, in eight innings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Johnny Damon was 2 for 4 with a run scored, but his Thailand team was eliminated from World Baseball Classic qualifying by New Zealand, 12-2, in eight innings. In the other game, host Taiwan improved to 2-0 with a 16-0, seven-inning pounding of the Philippines. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Damon and Thailand Eliminated from World Baseball Classic', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Baseball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Damon and Thailand Out', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Baseball Classic', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Damon, Johnny', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Zealand', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Thailand', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-17T01:31:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/80e50dc2-21a3-5d00-a5cc-653a2f4e27f3', 'word_count': 45, 'uri': 'nyt://article/80e50dc2-21a3-5d00-a5cc-653a2f4e27f3'}, {'abstract': '“The English Prize,” an exhibition at the Yale Center for British Art, is a collection of mementos that English travelers on their Grand Tour lost when the boat was seized by French warships.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/18/nyregion/a-review-of-the-english-prize-at-the-yale-center-for-british-art.html', 'snippet': '“The English Prize,” an exhibition at the Yale Center for British Art, is a collection of mementos that English travelers on their Grand Tour lost when the boat was seized by French warships.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Naval adventure, detective yarn, travel diary, shopping survey. You don’t normally expect to encounter these narratives at an art show. But despite the presence of paintings, prints, sculptures and such, “The English Prize,” at the Yale Center for British Art, isn’t mainly about looking at art. As suggested by its double subtitle, “The Capture of the Westmorland, An Episode of the Grand Tour,” this show has many other things on its mind.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/nyregion/18ARTSCT3/18ARTSCT3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 739, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/nyregion/18ARTSCT3/18ARTSCT3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1479, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/nyregion/18ARTSCT3/18ARTSCT3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/18/nyregion/18ARTSCT3/18ARTSCT3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/nyregion/18ARTSCT3/18ARTSCT3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Bounty of Souvenirs From a Captured Ship', 'kicker': 'Arts | Connecticut', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Bounty of Souvenirs From a Captured Ship', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Haven (Conn)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Yale Center for British Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-17T01:36:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sylviane Gold', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sylviane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gold', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/1a0ef721-0580-5982-adf7-75b48b509c84', 'word_count': 751, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1a0ef721-0580-5982-adf7-75b48b509c84'}, {'abstract': 'Port Chester is the second location for Coals, an endearing, somewhat disheveled coal-fired pizza joint, where the excellent pizzas and foaming craft beer exceed all expectations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/18/nyregion/a-review-of-coals-in-port-chester.html', 'snippet': 'Port Chester is the second location for Coals, an endearing, somewhat disheveled coal-fired pizza joint, where the excellent pizzas and foaming craft beer exceed all expectations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The citizens of Port Chester had had enough of wind and weather and were just looking to have a little fun on a Friday night. Though it was November, children in princess and skeleton costumes roamed the sidewalks, enjoying a belated Halloween. And more than a few adults made a beeline for Coals, a scrappy new pizzeria that had thrown open its doors — and its beer taps — after several days in the dark.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/nyregion/18DINEWE1/18DINEWE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/nyregion/18DINEWE1/18DINEWE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/nyregion/18DINEWE1/18DINEWE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/18/nyregion/18DINEWE1/18DINEWE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/nyregion/18DINEWE1/18DINEWE1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hand-Stretched Pizzas, and Craft Beer on Tap', 'kicker': 'Westchester Dining | Port Chester', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hand-Stretched Pizzas, And Craft Beer on Tap', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Port Chester (NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Coals (Port Chester, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject