Jim Mora and the star running back Johnathan Franklin have led 17th-ranked U.C.L.A. to its best record since 2005. Now the Bruins face archrival U.S.C.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/17/sports/ncaafootball/jim-l-mora-and-johnathan-franklin-lead-ucla-into-usc-game.html', 'snippet': 'Coach Jim Mora and the star running back Johnathan Franklin have led 17th-ranked U.C.L.A. to its best record since 2005. Now the Bruins face archrival U.S.C.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — For summer training, the coach took his new team inland, where the average temperature hovered at 109 degrees. He pointed one afternoon toward the San Bernardino Mountains. A football season, the coach, Jim L. Mora, told the U.C.L.A. Bruins, is like climbing one of those.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/sports/ncaafootball/17-ucla-web/17-ucla-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/17/sports/ncaafootball/17-ucla-web/17-ucla-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/sports/ncaafootball/17-ucla-web/17-ucla-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/sports/ncaafootball/17-ucla-web/17-ucla-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/sports/ncaafootball/17-ucla-web/17-ucla-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'c