h the former heavyweight champion during his glory days.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Loved reading your reactions to the Ali column. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ali, Round Two', 'kicker': 'Dick Cavett', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ALI, MUHAMMAD', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nye, Carrie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Montauk (NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-17T02:00:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dick Cavett', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cavett', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0fa89d9b-b501-59f3-8362-f6fe8e70a0e9', 'word_count': 1442, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0fa89d9b-b501-59f3-8362-f6fe8e70a0e9'}, {'abstract': 'Peter Gallagher performs at Feinstein’s at Loews Regency in his show “How’d All You People Get in My Room?”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/17/arts/music/peter-gallagher-at-feinsteins-at-loews-regency.html', 'snippet': 'Peter Gallagher performs at Feinstein’s at Loews Regency in his show “How’d All You People Get in My Room?”', 'lead_paragraph': 'You have got to love a star who jovially admits to the kind of vulnerability that Peter Gallagher describes in his one-man show, “How’d All You People Get in My Room?” at Feinstein’s at Loews Regency. In his audition for the 1977 Broadway revival of “Hair,” he recalled on Tuesday evening, he began singing the Paul Anka hit “Put Your Head on My Shoulder.” During the brutal auditioning process, he explained, performers are often halted eight bars into a number and dismissed. “When nobody stopped me, my knees buckled, and my eyes filled with tears.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/music/17gallagher-img/17gallagher-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 863, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/music/17gallagher-img/17gallagher-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1726, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/music/17gallagher-img/17gallagher-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/music/17gallagher-img/17gallagher-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/music/17gallagher-img/17gallagher-img-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Leading Man, Letting Down His Guard', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Leading Man, Letting Down His Guard', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gallagher, Peter', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Feinstein's at the Regency", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-17T02:02:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen',