s that were placed on the 13th floor of Police Headquarters had an aura of something official, but upon closer inspection, the messages on them told a different story.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/17/nyregion/occupy-wall-street-figures-in-barrier-mystery-at-police-headquarters.html', 'snippet': 'A pair of barriers that were placed on the 13th floor of Police Headquarters had an aura of something official, but upon closer inspection, the messages on them told a different story.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The pair of barriers, which looked like heavy concrete obstacles, seemed out of place in the 13th-floor hallway of Police Headquarters in Lower Manhattan. Spotted on Wednesday, the barriers had the aura of something official, white with blue writing in a font favored by the New York Police Department. But upon closer inspection, the messages told a different story.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/nyregion/POLICE/POLICE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/17/nyregion/POLICE/POLICE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/nyregion/POLICE/POLICE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/nyregion/POLICE/POLICE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/nyregion/POLICE/POLICE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'su