.A.A. final Sunday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/17/sports/championship-game-pits-nos-1-vs-2-in-field-hockey.html', 'snippet': 'No. 1 North Carolina and No. 2 Princeton will meet in the N.C.A.A. final Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No. 1 North Carolina and No. 2 Princeton will meet in the N.C.A.A. final Sunday. North Carolina cruised past Syracuse, 6-1, while Princeton needed overtime to beat Maryland, 3-2. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Championship Game Pits Nos. 1 vs. 2 in Field Hockey', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Field Hockey', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Final Pits Nos. 1 vs. 2', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Field', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of North Carolina', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Princeton University', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-17T05:02:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ea702e3-4851-569c-8bb2-d4424ae413da', 'word_count': 29, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ea702e3-4851-569c-8bb2-d4424ae413da'}, {'abstract': 'It is a virtual bye week in the Southeastern Conference, but the west has some marquee showdowns.', 'web_url': 'https://thequad.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/17/college-football-matchups-6/', 'snippet': 'It is a virtual bye week in the Southeastern Conference, but the west has some marquee showdowns.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is a virtual bye week in the Southeastern Conference, with Wofford, Georgia Southern, Sam Houston State, Western Carolina and Jacksonville State among the opposition that will be rolled over by the top SEC teams. Marquee showdowns are in short supply Saturday, except out West.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/sports/matchups-silo/matchups-silo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 597, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/sports/matchups-silo/matchups-silo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1194, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/sports/matchups-silo/matchups-silo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/17/sports/matchups-silo/matchups-silo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/sports/matchups-silo/matchups-silo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'College Football Matchups', 'kicker': 'The Quad', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Stanford University', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of California, Los Angeles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Oregon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Southern California', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-17T05:16:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Weintraub', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weintraub', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2a83c09f-c9cd-57d5-b2f2-2a08407f5616', 'word_count': 553, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2a83c09f-c9cd-57d5-b2f2-2a08407f5616'}, {'abstract': 'News, arts and sports in today’s International Herald Tribune.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/17/iht-quick-read-nov-17/', 'snippet': 'News, arts and sports in today’s International Herald Tribune.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEWS Emboldened by displays of Egyptian solidarity and undeterred by Israel’s advanced aerial firepower, Palestinian militants under siege in Gaza broadened their rocket targets on Friday, aiming at the holy city of Jerusalem for the first time, sending a second volley screeching toward Tel Aviv and pushing the Israelis closer to a ground invasion. Isabel Kershner and Rick Gladstone report.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'IHT Quick Read: Nov. 17', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-17T05:16:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By The International Herald Tribune', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The International Herald Tribune'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/438963a1-67f2-5785-a9e1-d50ddde6757c', 'word_count': 241, 'uri': 'nyt://article/438963a1-67f2-5785-a9e1-d50ddde6757c'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Lansky, who owned a men’s wear store in the music district of Memphis, sold outfits to Elvis Presley, Carl Perkins, Isaac Hayes, the Jacksons, the Beach Boys, Johnny Cash and others.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/17/arts/music/bernard-lansky-clothier-to-music-royalty-dies-at-85.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Lansky, who owned a men’s wear store in the music district of Memphis, sold outfits to Elvis Presley, Carl Perkins, Isaac Hayes, the Jacksons, the Beach Boys, Johnny Cash and others.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bernard Lansky, a Memphis haberdasher who dressed the royalty of rhythm and blues, including the King, Elvis Presley, died on Thursday at his home in Memphis. He was 85.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/LANSKY2-obit/LANSKY2-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/LANSKY2-obit/LANSKY2-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/LANSKY2-obit/LANSKY2-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 767, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/LANSKY2-obit/LANSKY2-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2000, 'width': 1499, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/LANSKY2-obit/LANSKY2-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/LANSKY2-obit/LANSKY2-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bernard Lansky, Clothier Catering to Music Royalty, Dies at 85', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bernard Lansky, 85, Clothier Catering to Music Royalty', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Presley, Elvis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Memphis (Tenn)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lansky, Bernard', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-17T05:16:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Weber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/542f513a-452b-5425-bdd2-69c813b1be89', 'word_count': 684, 'uri': 'nyt://article/542f513a-452b-5425-bdd2-69c813b1be89'}, {'abstract': 'Mrs. Wald’s dinners became a social institution for the film community, as low-key and cozy as the guest lists were glamorous.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/17/arts/connie-wald-hollywood-hostess-dies-at-96.html', 'snippet': 'Mrs. Wald’s dinners became a social institution for the film community, as low-key and cozy as the guest lists were glamorous.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Connie Wald, a Beverly Hills hostess whose dinner parties began during Hollywood’s Golden Age and became an enduring social institution — part home-cooked casual, part parade of stars — died at her home on Nov. 10. She was 96.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/arts/subWALD2-obit/subWALD2-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'le