ality and more on price.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The euro zone fell back into recession, it was officially announced on Thursday, prompting renewed concerns about the economic health of the Continent. But amid the flurry of questions over sovereign debt, banking oversight and fiscal responsibility, another kind of austerity is taking hold in European households — the nutritional kind. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/blogs/17rdv-fat-europe/17rdv-fat-europe-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/17/blogs/17rdv-fat-europe/17rdv-fat-europe-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Is the Economic Crisis Making Europe Fat?', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Obesity', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-17T11:41:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Johnson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Johnson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/23c71077-a4a5-5f41-82b7-b51ab63c2b9d', 'word_count': 821, 'uri': 'nyt://article/23c71077-a4a5-5f41-82b7-b51ab63c2b9d'}, {'abstract': 'The releases are expected to help bolster efforts by Afghanistan’s High Peace Council to start talks with the insurgents.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/18/world/asia/taliban-leaders-among-prisoners-freed-in-pakistan.html', 'snippet': 'The releases are expected to help bolster efforts by Afghanistan’s High Peace Council to start talks with the insurgents.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — Many of at least a dozen Afghan Taliban prisoners being released by Pakistan are significant figures, according to officials on all sides, and Afghan peace representatives were exultant on Saturday as they announced that more releases might follow.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/world/sub-afghan/sub-afghan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 847, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/world/sub-afghan/sub-afghan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1693, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/world/sub-afghan/sub-afghan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/18/world/sub-afghan/sub-afghan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/world/sub-afghan/sub-afghan-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'More Taliban Prisoners May Be Released', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'More Taliban Prisoners May Be Released', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', '