.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/17/easy-cornbread-stuffing/', 'snippet': 'In a video, Melissa Clark demonstrates how to make cornbread-brown butter stuffing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For many people, Thanksgiving is one big excuse to eat lots of stuffing. My favorite recipe for it also happens to be the easiest one I know —\xa0cornbread-brown butter stuffing. I demonstrate how to make it in this video, and here’s the recipe:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Easy Cornbread Stuffing', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-17T18:21:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b015457-6f72-562d-8b12-1216ace80996', 'word_count': 215, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b015457-6f72-562d-8b12-1216ace80996'}, {'abstract': 'Mushrooming scandals are unusual in Russia, given past reluctance to prosecute high-level officials, but as more pop up, some are wondering what has changed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/18/world/europe/russia-looks-askance-at-corruption-drive.html', 'snippet': 'Mushrooming scandals are unusual in Russia, given past reluctance to prosecute high-level officials, but as more pop up, some are wondering what has changed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — Ripples of scandal are spreading in Russia’s Far East, where, auditors say, $472 million in construction financing was misallocated ahead of a government summit meeting. About $200 million in missing funds have led to firings in Russia’s space industry. And corruption in the Defense Ministry has figured prominently in Russia’s news cycles since Nov. 6, leaving the fate of its former minister uncertain. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/world/bull-russia/bull-russia-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 822, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/world/bull-russia/bull-russia-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1644, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/world/bull-russia/bull-russia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/18/world/bull-russia/bull-russia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/world/bull-russia/bull-russia-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Russians Look Askance at Anticorruption Drive Even as New Scandals Arise', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Russians Look Askance at Anticorruption Drive Even as New Scandals Arise', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-17T18:22:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'ori