 of aging veterans can withstand the rigors of travel without the luxury of extra days off. They will also square off against Jeremy Lin, the player who got away.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Knicks’ Road Test Will Conclude With a Lin Reunion', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Road Test to Conclude With a Lin Reunion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Felton, Raymond', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kidd, Jason', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lin, Jeremy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Prigioni, Pablo', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-17T21:07:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/23fc334a-205f-5915-9163-121df4efd1af', 'word_count': 607, 'uri': 'nyt://article/23fc334a-205f-5915-9163-121df4efd1af'}, {'abstract': 'The game remained in the balance until a 63-yard touchdown run by Treavor Scales with 1 minute 8 seconds remaining sealed the victory for Harvard.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/18/sports/ncaafootball/yale-keeps-it-close-but-harvard-pulls-away-behind-chapple.html', 'snippet': 'The game remained in the balance until a 63-yard touchdown run by Treavor Scales with 1 minute 8 seconds remaining sealed the victory for Harvard.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — The red sun was sinking