e.html', 'snippet': 'The nature of solitary confinement, from the maddening effects of isolation from those who have been there to creative ways to spend the time, was the subject of a program at N.Y.U.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you were sentenced to solitary confinement, would you pray to God, hire a better lawyer or perhaps contemplate suicide?', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/arts/jpsolitary1/jpsolitary1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/arts/jpsolitary1/jpsolitary1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/arts/jpsolitary1/jpsolitary1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/19/arts/jpsolitary1/jpsolitary1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/arts/jpsolitary1/jpsolitary1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Solitary, With Insects as Cellmates', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Solitary, With Insects As Cellmates', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weschler, Lawrence', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Daisey, Mike', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Institute for the Humanities', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kushner, Tony', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-18T22:51:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Schuessler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schuessler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ab4b1f94-b3a7-5c9d-9411-43e30ae312a5', 'word_count': 971, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab4b1f94-b3a7-5c9d-9411-43e30ae312a5'}, {'abstract': 'Typically a retail event, Black Friday has drawn marketers from other domains into the fray.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/19/business/media/black-friday-promotions-outside-the-retail-realm.html', 'snippet': 'Typically a retail event, Black Friday has drawn marketers from other domains into the fray.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Each year, the day after Thanksgiving, known as Black Friday, looms larger on the retail calendar as a starting point for the Christmas shopping season. This year, marketers outside the realm of retailing hope to get into the act.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/business/19adco/19adco-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/business/19adco/19adco-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 636, 'width': 1036, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Piggybacking on Black Friday', 'kicker': 'Advertising', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Piggyback