 — left so many people in the dark and cold for so long. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Power Mess on Long Island', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Power Mess on Long Island', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Long Island Power Authority', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Power Outages and Blackouts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric Light and Power', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schneiderman, Eric T', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-19T02:22:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/114a7f6c-a5f4-5871-806d-ad16b9a2c153', 'word_count': 471, 'uri': 'nyt://article/114a7f6c-a5f4-5871-806d-ad16b9a2c153'}, {'abstract': 'Should President Obama stop using military commissions to prosecute combatants captured in the war on terror, and transfer the Guantánamo cases to the federal courts?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/roomfordebate/2012/11/18/should-obama-close-guantanamo-and-end-military-tribunals/', 'snippet': 'Should President Obama stop using military commissions to prosecute combatants captured in the war on terror, and transfer the Guantánamo cases to the federal courts?', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Time to End Military Tribunals?', 'kicker': 'Room for Debate', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 's