he original determination of terrorism in the Benghazi attack had been changed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/19/us/politics/feinstein-to-investigate-benghazi-talking-points.html', 'snippet': 'Senator Dianne Feinstein, the chairwoman of the Intelligence Committee, said that she would investigate why the original determination of terrorism in the Benghazi attack had been changed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The chairwoman of the Senate Intelligence Committee said Sunday that she planned to investigate why the C.I.A.’s quick determination of terrorism in the Sept. 11 attack in Benghazi, Libya, was not reflected in the “talking points” used days later on television by Susan E. Rice, the ambassador to the United Nations.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/us/FEINSTEIN/FEINSTEIN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/us/FEINSTEIN/FEINSTEIN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1878, 'width': 1252, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/us/FEINSTEIN/FEINSTEIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/19/us/FEINSTEIN/FEINSTEIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/us/FEINSTEIN/FEINSTEIN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Senate Committee to Investigate Bengha