 with Tyson Chandler as their secret threat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/19/sports/basketball/with-tyson-chandler-knicks-win-argument-over-style-against-pacers.html', 'snippet': 'In argument over playing styles between the Knicks and the Pacers, the Knicks proved to have the winning formula with Tyson Chandler as their secret threat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tyson Chandler can go an entire game without taking a single dribble, but he is second only to Carmelo Anthony when it comes to creating good shots for the Knicks. In their four-out offense, Chandler is the all-important, all-screening “dive man,” the explosive finisher who rumbles down the lane off a pick-and-roll and forces the defense to leave the Knicks’ shooters to prevent an easy dunk.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/sports/basketball/19dribble/19dribble-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/sports/basketball/19dribble/19dribble-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1666, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/sports/basketball/19dribble/19dribble-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/19/sports/basketball/19dribble/19dribble-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/sports/basketball/19dribble/19dribble-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headl