ting Nov. 23, Mr. Dayal will have to hope his customers have their own bags, as the Delhi government will begin enforcing a ban on the manufacture, import, sale, storage and use of plastic bags, sheets, films or tubs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Delhi, a Blanket Ban on Plastic Bags Starts This Week', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping Bags', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Delhi (India)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-19T07:35:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Raksha Kumar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Raksha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kumar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b61e908e-0e10-596f-b902-e2343f9fcea7', 'word_count': 754, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b61e908e-0e10-596f-b902-e2343f9fcea7'}, {'abstract': 'The top leader of Hamas dared Israel on Monday to launch a ground invasion of Gaza and dismissed efforts to broker a cease-fire as Israel conducted a new wave of deadly airstrikes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/20/world/middleeast/israel-gaza-conflict.html', 'snippet': 'The top leader of Hamas dared Israel on Monday to launch a ground invasion of Gaza and dismissed efforts to broker a cease-fire as Israel conducted a new wave of deadly airstrikes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GAZA CITY — The top leader of Hamas dared Israel on Monday to launch a ground invasion of Gaza and dismissed diplomatic efforts to broker a cease-fire in the six-day-old conflict, as the Israeli military conducted a new wave of deadly airstrikes on the besieged Palestinian enclave, including a second hit on a 15-story building that houses media outlets. A volley of rockets fired from Gaza into southern Israel included one that hit a vacant school.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hamas Leader Dares Israel to Invade Amid Gaza Airstrikes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hamas Leader Dares Israel to Invade as More Deadly Airstrikes Hit Gaza', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hamas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gaza Strip', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-19T07:39:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Fares Akram, Jodi Rudoren and Alan Cowell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Fares', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Akram', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Jodi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rudoren', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cowell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6f9f5b95-65fe-5fc0-9451-b7a703cb876c', 'word_count': 1406, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6f9f5b95-65fe-5fc0-9451-b7a703cb876c'}, {'abstract': 'Wellington, the New Zealand capital, is heavily promoting the Nov. 28 premiere of “The Hobbit: An Unexpected Journey,” the latest Tolkien film from the director Peter Jackson.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/19/new-zealand-goes-over-the-top-over-middle-earth/', 'snippet': 'Wellington, the New Zealand capital, is heavily promoting the Nov. 28 premiere of “The Hobbit: An Unexpected Journey,” the latest Tolkien film from the director Peter Jackson.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — John Edwards, a lawyer from Wellington, had just returned from a Sunday run last month when he noticed that Courtney Place, the New Zealand capital’s main thoroughfare, had been resealed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/blogs/19rdv-wellington-nz-hobbit-hype/19rdv-wellington-nz-hobbit-hype-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 751, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/blogs/19rdv-wellington-nz-hobbit-hype/19rdv-wellington-nz-hobbit-hype-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1466, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New Zealand Goes Over the Top Over Middle Earth', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jackson, Peter', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Warner Brothers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Zealand', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Wellington (New Zealand)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Hobbit: An Unexpected Journey (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-19T07:41:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charles Anderson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charles', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Anderson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/316206fa-58a8-5e0f-bbf1-09d0a557d8cc', 'word_count': 596, 'uri': 'nyt://article/316206fa-58a8-5e0f-bbf1-09d0a557d8cc'}, {'abstract': 'Metropolitan Diary: A shopper grew increasingly concerned when, trying to leave Macy’s, she saw floor after empty floor as she took the escalator.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/19/locked-in-at-macys/', 'snippet': 'Metropolitan Diary: A shopper grew increasingly concerned when, trying to leave Macy’s, she saw floor after empty floor as she took the escalator.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dear Diary:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Locked In at Macy’s', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lingerie and Underwear', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Macy's Inc", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-19T08:00:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vivian Awner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vivian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Awner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4d4c104b-dfd6-5295-aeee-660cbb92ffad', 'word_count': 228, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4d4c104b-dfd6-5295-aeee-660cbb92ffad'}, {'abstract': 'The leader fighting for statehood for Telangana, on being politically ignored by the Congress Party, lack of unity among regional parties, Naxalism, and more.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/19/a-conversation-with-k-taraka-rama-rao-telangana-leader/', 'snippet': 'The leader fighting for statehood for Telangana, on being politically ignored by the Congress Party, lack of unity among regional parties, Naxalism, and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As regional parties grow in prominence in Indian national politics, one of the main parties in Andhra Pradesh, Telangana Rashtra Samithi, or T.R.S., is hoping to gain momentum in its campaign to carve out an independent Telangana state – a large landlocked territory in Andhra Pradesh that the party’s backers say is sidelined by coastal elites.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Conversation With: K. Taraka Rama Rao, Telangana leader', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rao, K Chandrasekhar', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Andhra Pradesh (India)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hyderabad (India)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-19T08:12:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vivekananda Nemana', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vivekananda', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nemana', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2574e3b3-9aea-5599-a088-76a9ef24332f', 'word_count': 1250, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2574e3b3-9aea-5599-a088-76a9ef24332f'}, {'abstract': 'While bishops and clerics are regarded as likely to endorse a compromise allowing traditionalist parishes to reject the authority of female bishops, the vote among lay members is less assured.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/20/world/europe/church-of-england-female-bishops-vote.html', 'snippet': 'While bishops and clerics are regarded as likely to endorse a compromise allowing traditionalist parishes to reject the authority of female bishops, the vote among lay members is less assured.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Two decades after it supported the introduction of women as priests, the Church of England began three days of deliberations on Monday that will include a critical vote on the ordination of women as bishops — a notion that still splits its members into rival camps.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Church of England Prepares for Vote on Female Bishops', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Britain: Church of England Discusses\r\nThe Ordination of Women as Bishops', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Rowan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Priests', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Welby, Justin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Church of England', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-19T08:44:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Cowell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cowell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8269c09d-30c4-5c43-aec4-d64278252616', 'word_count': 381, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8269c09d-30c4-5c43-aec4-d64278252616'}, {'abstract': 'Can you calculate the number of texts sent per year in the United States if given the number of subscribers and average number of texts sent each month?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/19/test-yourself-math-nov-19-2012/', 'snippet': 'Can you calculate the number of texts sent per year in the United States if given the number of subscribers and average number of texts sent each month?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Test your math skills with this question created by Scott Matthews at Math for America from the Bits blog post “Text Messaging Declines in U.S. for First Time, Report Says.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Test Yourself | Math, Nov. 19, 2012', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-19T09:30:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ac25b35-39d8-5cce-86f0-26aa9a4a0737', 'word_count': 58, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ac25b35-39d8-5cce-86f0-26aa9a4a0737'}, {'abstract': 'What has caused escalating violence in Israel and Gaza in recent days?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/19/air-strikes-in-gaza-and-israel/', 'snippet': 'What has caused escalating violence in Israel and Gaza in recent days?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Note: This feature draws on several articles, all of which are linked in the questions. Students might also benefit from reading the Israel News page. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/18/world/middleeast/19gaza-ss-slide-1DIE-LN/19gaza-ss-slide-1DIE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/18/world/middleeast/19gaza-ss-slide-1DIE-LN/19gaza-ss-slide-1DIE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'imag