ase, poverty and war is to rely on private aid groups for access. But when those groups hire photographers directly, that can create a different kind of conflict, raising ethical quandaries.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/19/when-interest-creates-a-conflict/', 'snippet': 'Sometimes the only way to cover the human toll of disease, poverty and war is to rely on private aid groups for access. But when those groups hire photographers directly, that can create a different kind of conflict, raising ethical quandaries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like most photographers in conflict zones, Stanley Greene has spent a lot of time with nongovernmental organizations, befriending aid workers who dealt with war, famine and refugees. They not only shared the same concerns as he, but also made it possible for him to gain access to the crisis zones.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When Interest Creates a Conflict', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Conflicts of Interest', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Famine', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grants (Corporate and Foundation)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nonprofit Organizations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Greene, Stanley', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Meiselas, Susan', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carlyle Group LP', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Doctors Without Borders', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Getty Images', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Global Fund to Fight 