n.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Have an N.F.L. Question? Judy Battista Has Answers', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Battista, Judy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Orleans Saints', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-19T16:44:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cb1f13dc-9889-5bf6-a8b4-ceee1f65ab42', 'word_count': 51, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cb1f13dc-9889-5bf6-a8b4-ceee1f65ab42'}, {'abstract': 'The plays in New York theaters are full of meaning, and delivering a holiday message, hostile or tender, is as easy as buying a ticket.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/23/theater/a-guide-to-theater-shows-that-say-it-all.html', 'snippet': 'The plays in New York theaters are full of meaning, and delivering a holiday message, hostile or tender, is as easy as buying a ticket.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You’ve been waiting all year to say it. But now 2012 is rolling to an end, and you still haven’t found the words. This is when it’s time to take advantage of both the holiday gift-giving season and God’s great gift to the inarticulate: New York theater productions, written and performed by some of the most eloquent talents on this earth, who give voice to what you cannot — but need to — utter. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/201