ture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'byline': {'original': "'Scandalous'", 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/e70ccba0-a7e0-5946-b808-c9f89d26e96f', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/e70ccba0-a7e0-5946-b808-c9f89d26e96f'}, {'abstract': 'The police have turned their focus to one of four people seen in security videos in the vicinity of the killing last week of a shopkeeper in Flatbush, Brooklyn.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/19/video-persons-of-interest-in-death-of-brooklyn-shopkeeper/', 'snippet': 'The police have turned their focus to one of four people seen in security videos in the vicinity of the killing last week of a shopkeeper in Flatbush, Brooklyn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Update, 4:07 p.m. | The police are now focusing mainly on the first person in the video, “John Doe Duffel Bag.” The man and woman seen running are now believed to be a perfume vendor and a woman he thought had stolen merchandise from him. The other woman, “Jane Doe Long Coat,” might be a witness to the shooting, the police said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/nyregion/19brooklyn-cityroom/19brooklyn-cityroom-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 414, 'width': 519, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/nyregion/19brooklyn-cityroom/19brooklyn-cityroom-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 414, 'width': 519, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/nyregion/19brooklyn-cityroom/19brooklyn-cityroom-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/19/nyregion/19brooklyn-