bf6d-f6ac632597d3'}, {'abstract': 'A weekly capsule of travel news curated by our writers and editors.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/19/walkabout-1119-bracing-for-thanksgiving-traffic-and-tracing-lincolns-footsteps/', 'snippet': 'A weekly capsule of travel news curated by our writers and editors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Surprise! Expect bad traffic during the holiday weekend. Actually, the AAA is forecasting an increase in road travel for the fourth year in a row, after a precipitous 25 percent drop in 2008. (Wall Street Journal)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Walkabout — 11/19: Bracing for Thanksgiving Traffic and Tracing Lincoln’s Footsteps', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-19T19:30:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/36b7702d-ce01-5404-83ea-9ddfc7e09a5d', 'word_count': 151, 'uri': 'nyt://article/36b7702d-ce01-5404-83ea-9ddfc7e09a5d'}, {'abstract': 'The most famous pink car is the pink Cadillac — more a phrase or concept than any specific real vehicle.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/19/a-rare-but-enduring-concept-pink-cars/', 'snippet': 'The most famous pink car is the pink Cadillac — more a phrase or concept than any specific real vehicle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I recently had a test drive in a pink Chevrolet Spark. The Korean-built Spark is Chevy’s smallest car, and the designers say that its color was inspired by the color of personal electronics, like mobile phones, favored by young people in Asia. But the color sold so well outside the United States that the company decided to try it here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Rare but Enduring Concept: Pink Cars', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Color', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Franklin, Aretha', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Presley, Elvis', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cadillac Division of General Motors Corp', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chevrolet Division of General Motors Corp', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'General Motors', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Honda Motor Co Ltd', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mercedes-Benz', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Volkswagen AG', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-19T19:33:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phil Patton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Patton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6cdeeade-38bc-5f18-bf6d-f28743682859', 'word_count': 779, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6cdeeade-38bc-5f18-bf6d-f28743682859'}, {'abstract': 'Musicians and singers of every genre have released holiday collections containing both classics and new material.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/23/arts/music/new-music-releases-of-the-season-from-jazz-to-gospel.html', 'snippet': 'Musicians and singers of every genre have released holiday collections containing both classics and new material.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Are your holidays a time for joy? For reflec