 receiving yards, and it was his final catch of the game that was his most impressive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has been a while since Houston Texans receiver Andre Johnson dominated a game the way he did in Week 11 against the Jaguars. Actually, with 273 yards on 14 receptions, he bested his career high in yards by 66. It was his final catch of the game — a 48-yard touchdown that came on a screen — that was Johnson’s most impressive.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Breaking Down Andre Johnson’s Winning Catch', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Andre', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Houston Texans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-19T20:46:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Bales', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bales', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/92bed660-e8e6-55aa-9a84-64fe65dc6e03', 'word_count': 585, 'uri': 'nyt://article/92bed660-e8e6-55aa-9a84-64fe65dc6e03'}, {'abstract': 'A view of the day in sports, including a marathon in India and water polo in Dubai.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/11/19/sports/20121119photoreplay.html', 'snippet': 'A view of the day in sports, including a marathon in India and water polo in Dubai.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A view of the day in sports, including a marathon in India and water polo in Dubai.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/