g David Geffen” chronicles the career and life of the billionaire entertainment mogul.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/20/arts/television/inventing-david-geffen-on-pbs.html', 'snippet': '“Inventing David Geffen” chronicles the career and life of the billionaire entertainment mogul.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It wouldn’t be fair to call the “American Masters” documentary “Inventing David Geffen” a whitewash. Mr. Geffen’s infamous 1983 lawsuit against Neil Young is detailed, for instance, and called “unconscionable” by Mr. Young’s manager (who also happens to be an old friend and former business partner of Mr. Geffen’s). The media reporter Ken Auletta says: “There’s a reason to be afraid of David Geffen. I mean, he uses his power.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/20/arts/GEFFEN/GEFFEN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/20/arts/GEFFEN/GEFFEN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1349, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/20/arts/GEFFEN/GEFFEN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/20/arts/GEFFEN/GEFFEN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/20/arts/GEFFEN/GEFFEN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Rise and Rise of Power Personified', 'kicker': 'Televisi