: 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2012/11/20/us/aurora-suppression-legal-documents.html', 'snippet': 'The defense team of Christian Paetsch, who is accused of robbing a bank in Aurora, Colo., requested that the court not allow evidence found in a police search.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The defense team of Christian Paetsch, who is accused of robbing a bank in Aurora, Colo., requested that the court not allow evidence found in a police search.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Motion to Suppress Evidence and Responses', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bank Robberies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Search and Seizure', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Aurora (Colo)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-19T22:59:14+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'U.S.', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/b5c94b8b-77e2-5538-b508-634cc11bc2a8', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/b5c94b8b-77e2-5538-b508-634cc11bc2a8'}, {'abstract': 'A performance piece priced to move: MoMA’s Meta-Monumental Garage Sale.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/22/garden/moma-garage-sale-as-performance-art.html', 'snippet': 'A performance piece priced to move: MoMA’s Meta-Monumental Garage Sale.', 'lead_paragraph': 'REALLY, the prices were too high. At least in this humble shopper’s opinion. And while haggling was encouraged, even the most experienced hondlers accrued, on average, at most a $2 savings.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/garden/22SCENE1_SPAN/22SCENE1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/22/garden/22SCENE1_SPAN/22SCENE1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/garden/22SCENE1_SPAN/22SCENE1_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/garden/22SCENE1_SPAN/22SCENE1_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/garden/22SCENE1_SPAN/22SCENE1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/22/garden/22SCENE1_SPAN/22SCENE1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/garden/22SCENE1_SPAN/22SCENE1_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Appreciating the Art of a Deal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Appreciating The Art Of a Deal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Museum of Modern Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rosler, Martha', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-19T22:59:59+