o join its team on the West Coast. Mr. Dixon sold two previous companies, SiteAdvisor to McAfee and Hunch to eBay.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/19/andreessen-horowitz-hires-chris-dixon-away-from-ebay/', 'snippet': 'The venture capital firm Andreessen Horowitz is hiring Chris Dixon, a well-known New York investor and entrepreneur, to join its team on the West Coast. Mr. Dixon sold two previous companies, SiteAdvisor to McAfee and Hunch to eBay.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Andreessen Horowitz, the venture capital firm, is adding a serial entrepreneur to its roster. On Monday the company announced that it had hired Chris Dixon as a full-time general partner.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/technology/19bits-dixon/19bits-dixon-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/technology/19bits-dixon/19bits-dixon-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/technology/19bits-dixon/19bits-dixon-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/19/technology/19bits-dixon/19bits-dixon-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/19/technology/19bits-dixon/19bits-dixon-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Andreessen Horowitz Hires Chris Dixon Away From EBay', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'con