rk Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/285dfdfe-fb22-5b22-bec8-68a77d323edf', 'word_count': 12, 'uri': 'nyt://article/285dfdfe-fb22-5b22-bec8-68a77d323edf'}, {'abstract': 'Mozart’s last opera, “La Clemenza di Tito,” is considered an also-ran, yet its revival at the Metropolitan Opera demonstrated that Mozart could not fail to be Mozart.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/20/arts/music/mozarts-clemenza-di-tito-at-the-metropolitan-opera.html', 'snippet': 'Mozart’s last opera, “La Clemenza di Tito,” is considered an also-ran, yet its revival at the Metropolitan Opera demonstrated that Mozart could not fail to be Mozart.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has long been the fashion, even among the hardiest scholars and most discerning operaphiles, to view Mozart’s “Clemenza di Tito,” revived at the Metropolitan Opera on Friday evening in a clean, stately 1984 Jean-Pierre Ponnelle production, as an anomalous also-ran. That’s more or less accurate. Completed in 1791, just months before Mozart’s death, “Clemenza” was written to serve an emperor’s coronation and to earn an unusually handsome commission.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/20/arts/20TITO/20TITO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 880, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/20/arts/20TITO/20TITO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1760, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/20/arts/20TITO/20TITO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/20/arts/20TITO/20TITO-thumbSta