bi had been found guilty of accepting nearly $200,000 in secret payments from Zehy Jereis, who was sentenced to four years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When it was over, and the judge had left the courtroom, when it was clear that they would each be spending several years in prison on federal corruption charges, Sandy Annabi, a former Yonkers councilwoman, bitterly addressed her co-defendant, Zehy Jereis.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/20/nyregion/RIDGEHILL1/RIDGEHILL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/20/nyregion/RIDGEHILL1/RIDGEHILL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/20/nyregion/RIDGEHILL1/RIDGEHILL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 788, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/20/nyregion/RIDGEHILL1/RIDGEHILL1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1576, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/20/nyregion/RIDGEHILL1/RIDGEHILL1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ex-Yonkers Councilwoman Gets 6 Years for Corruption', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ex-Yonkers Councilwoman Gets 6 Years', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yonkers (NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jereis, Zehy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name':