thing suits that were worn by royalty, movie stars and Sports Illustrated swimsuit models.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Leah Gottlieb, who started with a single sewing machine in a refugee camp in the new nation-state of Israel and rose to become one of the world’s most renowned designers of women’s bathing suits, died on Saturday at her home in Tel Aviv. She was 94. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/20/business/GOTTLIEB1-obit/GOTTLIEB1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 789, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/20/business/GOTTLIEB1-obit/GOTTLIEB1-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1577, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/20/business/GOTTLIEB1-obit/GOTTLIEB1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/20/business/GOTTLIEB1-obit/GOTTLIEB1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/20/business/GOTTLIEB1-obit/GOTTLIEB1-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Leah Gottlieb, a Designer of Swimsuits, Dies at 94', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Leah Gottlieb, a Designer of Swimsuits, Dies at 94', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Gottex Models Ltd', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gottlieb, Lea