row in fits and starts as\xa0enthusiasts\xa0discover and rediscover\xa0the performances of favored composers by favored artists, sometimes long after they’ve been recorded.\xa0The classical music critics of The New York Times might be of\xa0help. They have compiled\xa0this list of gift ideas culled from CDs, DVDs, boxed sets\xa0and\xa0books\xa0newly out or newly appreciated. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/arts/music/23classicalgifts-1/23classicalgifts-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/arts/music/23classicalgifts-1/23classicalgifts-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Musical Performances Given, Now to Give Again', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Musical Performances Given, Now to Give Again', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-20T13:21:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anthony Tommasini', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anthony', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tommasini', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3118e37e-6ab7-5081-8c9f-009bb01b4eeb', 'word_count': 2220, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3118e37e-6ab7-5081-8c9f-009bb01b4eeb'}, {'abstract': 'Fashion designers and stylists, musicians, dogs and extinct birds are all celebrated in a new crop of gift-worthy coffee table books.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/23/books/a-roundup-of-holiday-coffee-table-books.html', 'snippet': 'Fashion designers and stylists, musicians, dogs and extinct birds are all celebrated in a new crop of gift-worthy coffee table books.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the abiding drawbacks of electronic books is that they’re not much fun to give as gifts. There’s nothing to wrap. You can’t inscribe one to a friend. E-books are weightless, colorless, odorless and, especially at the holidays, a bit evanescent. They fall, as it were, to bits.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/books/23coffee-1/23coffee-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/books/23coffee-1/23coffee-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/books/23coffee-1/23coffee-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/23/books/23coffee-1/23coffee-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/books/23coffee-1/23coffee-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Heavyweights for the Holidays', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None