rd', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/20/world/video-bronner-mideast/video-bronner-mideast-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'West Bank Rallies for Gaza', 'kicker': 'WORLD', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hamas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gaza Strip', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'West Bank', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-20T17:04:52+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/b5d1aef6-3549-5d26-8e82-6977789e4713', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/b5d1aef6-3549-5d26-8e82-6977789e4713'}, {'abstract': 'The Federal Reserve chairman said that while the details of a Congressional agreement to avert a so-called fiscal cliff were important, so were speed and a general impression of a functional and cooperative legislative branch.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/21/business/economy/bernanke-urges-action-on-fiscal-accord.html', 'snippet': 'The Federal Reserve chairman said that while the details of a Congressional agreement to avert a so-called fiscal cliff were important, so were speed and a general impression of a functional and cooperative legislative branch.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Federal Reserve chairman, Ben S. Bernanke, again strongly urged Congress on Tuesday to ward off the sudden and severe combination of tax increases and spending cuts coming at the end of the year.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/business/FED/FED-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 575, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/business/FED/FED-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1150, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Warning of Consequences, Bernanke Urges Swift Action on a Fiscal Deal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Warning of Consequences, Bernanke Urges Swift Action on a Fiscal Deal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bernanke, Ben S', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-20T17:24:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Catherine Rampell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Catherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rampell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/47a17488-be24-5983-85c9-764ffb16427c', 'word_count': 739, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47a17488-be24-5983-85c9-764ffb16427c'}, {'abstract': 'The average adult American consumes about 100 calories worth of alcohol daily — a number that for many people could contribute to excess weight gain. And with the holidays upon us, many people will be drinking more.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/20/the-not-so-hidden-calories-from-alcohol/', 'snippet': 'The average adult American consumes about 100 calories worth of alcohol daily — a number that for many people could contribute to excess weight gain. And with the holidays upon us, many people will be drinking more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hoping to stave off weight gain in the coming weeks? You may want to hold off on the mulled wine and cocktails this holiday season, according to a new report that looked at the number of calories Americans get from alcoholic beverages. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/science/20welldrink/20welldrink-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/science/20welldrink/20welldrink-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/science/20welldrink/20welldrink-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/21/science/20welldrink/20welldrink-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/science/20welldrink/20welldrink-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Not-So-Hidden Calories From Alcohol', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALCOHOLIC BEVERAGES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Calories', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Obesity', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-20T17:30:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': "By Anahad O'Connor", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anahad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "O'Connor", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6eaa37fa-a701-564e-b7dd-791ade70e385', 'word_count': 743, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6eaa37fa-a701-564e-b7dd-791ade70e385'}, {'abstract': '“Life of Pi,” directed by Ang Lee and based on the novel by Yann Martel, features a young man, a tiger and lots of talk about God.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/21/movies/life-of-pi-directed-by-ang-lee.html', 'snippet': '“Life of Pi,” directed by Ang Lee and based on the novel by Yann Martel, features a young man, a tiger and lots of talk about God.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is spoiling nothing to disclose that Pi Patel, the younger son of an Indian zoo owner, survives a terrible shipwreck during a storm in the Pacific Ocean. That much you know from the very first scenes of “Life of Pi,” Ang Lee’s 3-D film adaptation of the wildly popular, arguably readable novel by Yann Martel. A middle-aged Pi (the reliably engaging Irrfan Khan) tells the tale of his earlier life to a wide-eyed Canadian novelist (Rafe Spall), so we know that he made it through whatever ordeal we are about to witness.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/arts/21life-cap/21life-cap-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/21/arts/21life-ca