ch was undertaken with the Afghan Ministry of Counternarcotics. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Opium Cultivation Rose This Year in Afghanistan, U.N. Survey Shows', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Afghanistan: U.N. Cites Sharp Rise In Opium Poppy Cultivation', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opium', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Agriculture and Farming', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poppies', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-20T21:14:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alissa J. Rubin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alissa', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Rubin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7a2b64b2-cf47-59a0-a2db-e03b18f49c47', 'word_count': 709, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7a2b64b2-cf47-59a0-a2db-e03b18f49c47'}, {'abstract': 'If the Hispanic vote did prove decisive in the outcome, how easy would it be for a Republican candidate to gain a significantly greater share than Mitt Romney in future elections?', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/20/assessing-how-pivotal-the-hispanic-vote-was-to-obamas-victory/', 'snippet': 'If the Hispanic vote did prove decisive in the outcome, how easy would it be for a Republican candidate to gain a significantly greater share than Mitt Romney in future elections?', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the wake of the 2012 presidential election, ther