Fon, but the multibillion-dollar offering is hurtling forward nonetheless, highlighting a flawed system.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Goldman Sachs fires you as a client, you probably have a problem.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Goldman Sachs’s Retreat From I.P.O., a Signal to Investors', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Goldman Sachs’s Retreat From I.P.O., a Signal to Investors', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Usmanov, Alisher B', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MegaFon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-20T21:44:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Davidoff Solomon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': 'Davidoff', 'lastname': 'Solomon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9e31526b-aa40-5e7c-989c-d5d75027b924', 'word_count': 1034, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9e31526b-aa40-5e7c-989c-d5d75027b924'}, {'abstract': 'The police have ruled out a man who was a suspect after the second slaying and are now looking for a man who was near the latest murder site before the victim’s body was found.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/20/man-in-august-sketch-is-no-longer-suspect-in-shopkeeper-killings/', 'snippet': 'The police have ruled out a man who was a suspect after the second slaying and are now looking for a man who was near the latest murder site before the victim’s body was found.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As detectives search for the gunman who is thought to ha