adline': 'A Broken Election System', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voter Registration and Requirements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Action Committees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-21T02:11:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/b396772b-ca46-502c-bf2e-daa1b87f465a', 'word_count': 602, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b396772b-ca46-502c-bf2e-daa1b87f465a'}, {'abstract': 'The New York City Department of Education and union leaders announced they had canceled three days of the February break, leading parents and teachers to cancel vacations, rearrange home swaps and negotiate with airlines.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/21/education/with-loss-of-school-vacation-days-in-new-york-parents-and-teachers-are-forced-to-scramble.html', 'snippet': 'The New York City Department of Education and union leaders announced they had canceled three days of the February break, leading parents and teachers to cancel vacations, rearrange home swaps and negotiate with airlines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Susi Nichol, an art researcher, was looking forward to hiking and horseback riding in Arizona in February with her sons, a first grader and a fourth grader at Public School 41 in Greenwich Village. Still, she had a feeling that New York City might take back those days to make up for the school days that were lost after Hurricane Sandy. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Parents and Teachers Are Forced to Scramble With School Vacation Days Lost', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Parents and Teachers Are Forced to Scramble With School Vacation Days Lost', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teachers and School Employees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Education Department (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-21T02:19:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jenny Anderson and Kyle Spencer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jenny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Anderson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Kyle', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Spencer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ca97040c-e69d-5e72-8bd5-48314bb28fa3', 'word_count': 878, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ca97040c-e69d-5e72-8bd5-48314bb28fa3'}, {'abstract': 'Under the spread-the-floor offense of Mike D’Antoni, the Lakers’ new coach, Pau Gasol will drift more toward making long-range shots.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/21/sports/basketball/lakers-pau-gasol-will-be-relocated-beyond-the-arc.html', 'snippet': 'Under the spread-the-floor offense of Mike D’Antoni, the Lakers’ new coach, Pau Gasol will drift more toward making long-range shots.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EL SEGUNDO, Calif. — As expected, Mike D’Antoni’s arrival in Los Angeles has prompted a relocation plan for Pau Gasol. The move, happily, will not require luggage or