de-escalation/', 'snippet': 'A well-balanced Wednesday by David J. Kahn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WEDNESDAY’S PUZZLE — Deb and I have traded places – I’ll be blogging in her place for the next week while she takes a much deserved vacation. As Deb mentioned yesterday, I’ve just returned from a trip myself, having made a long-dreamed-of visit to Easter Island. It was amazing to see the moai statues up close and personal, and the 70-plus degree weather didn’t hurt, either. But now I’m back in New York, a bit chillier but happy to be here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Periods of De-Escalation', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-21T03:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Gaffney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gaffney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/16b2d3dd-5355-5e09-9fc2-94863851f24a', 'word_count': 231, 'uri': 'nyt://article/16b2d3dd-5355-5e09-9fc2-94863851f24a'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print on November 21, 2012.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/21/pageoneplus/corrections-november-21-2012.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections appearing in print on November 21, 2012.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRONT PAGE', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: November 21, 2012', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-21T03:00:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'secti