e_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6655242f-624e-5d6b-b7fa-8edcd2d61625', 'word_count': 1276, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6655242f-624e-5d6b-b7fa-8edcd2d61625'}, {'abstract': 'The Energy Department has settled on a consortium that will develop a modular prototype.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/21/help-for-small-nuclear-reactors/', 'snippet': 'The Energy Department has settled on a consortium that will develop a modular prototype.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Energy Department, seeking to promote the development of a small modular reactor that could be factory-built and cheaply installed, on Tuesday chose a consortium consisting of Babcock & Wilcox, the Tennessee Valley Authority and Bechtel International to receive a dollar-for-dollar cost match in the creation of a prototype. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Help for Small Nuclear Reactors', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Energy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ameren Corp', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bechtel Group', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tennessee Valley Authority', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-21T14:56:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matthew L. Wald', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': 'L.', 'lastname': 'Wald', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c497a92e-6b7d-5339-bcae-5f4309f64fe3', 'word_count': 454, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c497a92e-6b7d-5339-bcae-5f4309f64fe3'}, {'abstract': '“Killer Karaoke” and “Wives With Knives” bring slightly new, but considerably painful, twists to cable television reality shows.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/22/arts/television/killer-karaoke-and-wives-with-knives-on-cable.html', 'snippet': '“Killer Karaoke” and “Wives With Knives” bring slightly new, but considerably painful, twists to cable television reality shows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We critics do not toss around the phrase “greatest show in television history” lightly, partly because those of us under the age of 70 have not seen every show in television history. But no other phrase will do to describe “Killer Karaoke,” a deranged series arriving Friday on truTV that is simultaneously the highest possible use of the medium and the most profound statement ever made about the human condition. Also, it’s hilarious, in an I’m-ashamed-to-be-laughing-at-this sort of way.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/arts/22KARAOKE/22KARAOKE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 946, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/arts/22KARAOKE/22KARAOKE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1907, 'width': 1762, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/arts/22KARAOKE/22KARAOKE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/22/arts/22KARAOKE/22KARAOKE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/arts/22KARAOKE/22KARAOKE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Dangers of Singing and Marriage', 'kicker': 'Television Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Dangers of Singing and Marriage', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Investigation Discovery', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'TruTV', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-21T15:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil Genzlinger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Genzlinger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/5173df4a-348d-52db-a43c-d805d4c27f78', 'word_count': 699, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5173df4a-348d-52db-a43c-d805d4c27f78'}, {'abstract': 'The owners have immersed themselves in research to try to determine the source of the arsenic in their rice and what they can do to lower its levels. What else should they do?', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/21/how-can-lundberg-farms-cope-with-a-finding-of-arsenic-in-its-rice/', 'snippet': 'The owners have immersed themselves in research to try to determine the source of the arsenic in their rice and what they can do to lower its levels. What else should they do?', 'lead_paragraph': 'A case study we just published describes a crisis faced by Lundberg Family Farms, a fourth-generation farm in Richvale, Calif., that grows and sells rice and rice products. Founded in 1937 by Albert Lundberg, who came to California from Nebraska to escape the Dust Bowl, the company now has 225 employees and grows rice — 70 percent of which is organic — on a total of 17,000 acres. Its annual revenue exceeds $50 million.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Should Lundberg Farms Do About Its Arsenic Problem?', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Agriculture and Farming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARSENIC', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food Contamination and Poisoning', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rice', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-21T15:00:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eilene Zimmerman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eilene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zimmerman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c370860-e094-5918-829a-837fa685a729', 'word_count': 918, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c370860-e094-5918-829a-837fa685a729'}, {'abstract': 'Mike D’Antoni made his debut as Lakers coach and came away with a win that was a sign of progress. Indiana’s victory over Georgetown, though, was considerably more riveting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/22/sports/can-the-lakers-lose-the-drama-and-win.html', 'snippet': 'Mike D’Antoni made his debut as Lakers coach and came away with a win that was a sign of progress. Indiana’s victory over Georgetown, though, was considerably more riveting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Lakers’ sideshows go, the much-debated debut of Coach Mike D’Antoni Tuesday night wasn’t quite the re-opening of Showtime that anyone might have hoped for. A 95-90 victory over the Nets isn’t going to make Magic Johnson feel any better about the spurning of the guru, Phil Jackson. It isn’t going to make anyone forget the Clippers are the far more entertaining team in Los Angeles right now. And it isn’t healing D’Antoni’s surgically replaced knee any faster.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/sports/basketball/22leadingpic/22leadingpic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 852, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/sports/basketball/22leadingpic/22leadingpic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1704, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/sports/basketball/22leadingpic/22leadingpic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/22/sports/basketball/22leadingpic/22leadingpic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/sports/basketball/22leadingpic/22leadingpic-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Can the Lakers Lose the Drama and Win?', 'kicker': 'Leading Off', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Lakers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value':