r as stupid queuing goes, I would have to say that in my experience, the Pie Line is about as good as queuing gets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I freely admit that I failed to preorder my Thanksgiving pies. Four & Twenty Blackbirds (a great bakery in Brooklyn) stopped taking orders two weeks ago. We were having a hurricane around then, so that’s my excuse. Thus it was I found myself at 7:30 this morning, a cup of coffee in my hand, standing outside the bakery\xa0before it opened, to\xa0see if there was anything available to take to my in-laws in Connecticut.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/magazine/21-pie-sign/21-pie-sign-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/magazine/21-pie-sign/21-pie-sign-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/magazine/21-pie-sign/21-pie-sign-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/21/magazine/21-pie-sign/21-pie-sign-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/magazine/21-pie-sign/21-pie-sign-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Where There’s a Pie, There Am I', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bakeries and Baked Products', 