led and sustained the flow of information from the world’s war zones.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/21/an-unvarnished-view-of-war-perched-on-a-helmet/', 'snippet': 'Helmet-camera videos exemplify how technology has enabled and sustained the flow of information from the world’s war zones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hands bloodied from clawing dirt and rock, a band of United States servicemen battle rubble and time to free their friends trapped under a collapsed mud-wall building on the Afghan frontier. In the flying dust a digger waves and utters a noise that catches above the rattle of radios and helicopter engines. We converge on his spot and dig on our knees, fumbling against double fistfuls of dried mud infused with hay and sheet plastic. Someone yells, “He’s the last one, hurry up!” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Unvarnished View of War, Perched on a Helmet', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cameras', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Helmets', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003-11)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings and Downloads', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'British Broadcasting Corp', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Geographic', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Y