n Kidd, now a Knick, joined his previous teams in Dallas, Phoenix and New Jersey, the result was the same: the teams won a lot more.', 'web_url': 'https://offthedribble.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/21/considering-the-kidd-factor/', 'snippet': 'When Jason Kidd, now a Knick, joined his previous teams in Dallas, Phoenix and New Jersey, the result was the same: the teams won a lot more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the Knicks unexpectedly lured the 39-year-old Jason Kidd from Dallas to New York during the off-season, the prevailing wisdom suggested the move was largely motivated by the 19-year veteran’s mentoring ability — Jeremy Lin’s tenure as point guard was still thought to be only beginning. But even after Lin signed with Houston, Kidd’s experience has proved invaluable to the Knicks’ remaining players.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/sports/basketball/21kidd/21kidd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 795, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/sports/basketball/21kidd/21kidd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1590, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/sports/basketball/21kidd/21kidd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/21/sports/basketball/21kidd/21kidd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/sports/basketball/21kidd/21kidd-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Considering the Kidd Factor', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kidd, Jason', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lin, Jeremy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dallas Mavericks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Phoenix Suns', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-21T20:00:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': "By Jamie O'Grady", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jamie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "O'Grady", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f798c85d-3b55-514e-9c12-2a8dc28a2772', 'word_count': 745, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f798c85d-3b55-514e-9c12-2a8dc28a2772'}, {'abstract': 'Costco’s British Web site offers a simulator for the car enthusiasts who want the experience of driving an F1 racer without actually hitting the track.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/21/for-a-formula-one-experience-in-the-family-room/', 'snippet': 'Costco’s British Web site offers a simulator for the car enthusiasts who want the experience of driving an F1 racer without actually hitting the track.', 'lead_paragraph': 'So the $354,000 Neiman Marcus Edition 2013 McLaren 12C Spider is sold out (within two hours, Neiman Marcus says), and you weren’t quick enough to land one of the 12 available cars. Now what do you do to impress the family gearhead this holiday season?', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {