d-a880-51b1-9eed-e0699ca94313', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/c826a34d-a880-51b1-9eed-e0699ca94313'}, {'abstract': 'The owners have named their Williamsburg bar after Frederick Exley, the author of the novel “A Fan’s Notes.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/22/fashion/the-exley-a-williamsburg-bar-review.html', 'snippet': 'The owners have named their Williamsburg bar after Frederick Exley, the author of the novel “A Fan’s Notes.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE first thing you notice is the mural. Rather than a mirror or TV screen, a large oil painting of yellow and blue swirls welcomes visitors, signaling that this is not your average Williamsburg bar. Opened in October, the Exley aims to be a hangout for artists and writers living in the neighborhood, using a New York writer as a lure.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/fashion/22BOITE/22BOITE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/fashion/22BOITE/22BOITE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1365, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/fashion/22BOITE/22BOITE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/22/fashion/22BOITE/22BOITE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/fashion/22BOITE/22BOITE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': 