uthor, is high on our list. You can find recipes for that and other delicious desserts below. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/health/wellveggie_desserts3/wellveggie_desserts3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 416, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/21/health/wellveggie_desserts3/wellveggie_desserts3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 416}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/health/wellveggie_desserts3/wellveggie_desserts3-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 709, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/health/wellveggie_desserts3/wellveggie_desserts3-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 864, 'width': 1247, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/health/wellveggie_desserts3/wellveggie_desserts3-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/21/health/wellveggie_desserts3/wellveggie_desserts3-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/health/wellveggie_desserts3/wellveggie_desserts3-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Vegetarian Thanksgiving: And Now for Some Dessert', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Desserts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Thanksgiving Day', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veganism', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vegetarianism', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-21T21:13:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tara Parker-Pope', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker-Pope', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a0a7b8e5-1938-5d4a-a6d4-e44e8727d9d9', 'word_count': 457, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a0a7b8e5-1938-5d4a-a6d4-e44e8727d9d9'}, {'abstract': 'There are many choices for phone, tablet and laptop cases. The question is, do you want style or protection?', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/21/choosing-a-cover-for-your-device/', 'snippet': 'There are many choices for phone, tablet and laptop cases. The question is, do you want style or protection?', 'lead_paragraph': 'When it comes to cases for phones, tablets and even laptops, you basically have to decide between two classes — those that are protective and those that are stylish. Generally, the more protection you want, the less style you get.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Choosing a Cover for Your Device', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-21T21:18:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roy Furchgott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Furchgott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/71c407e0-8903-55ec-90f9-88558ff67538', 'word_count': 397, 'uri': 'nyt://article/71c407e0-8903-55ec-90f9-88558ff67538'}, {'abstract': 'He said health care reform should be “on the table” in fiscal cliff talks.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/21/boehners-rearguard-guerilla-action/', 'snippet': 'He said health care reform should be “on the table” in fiscal cliff talks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No one thought it would be easy for President Obama and Republicans in Congress to negotiate a package of tax increases and spending cuts over the next few weeks. But now Speaker John Boehner is trying to make the process even harder. In an op-ed article for the Cincinnati Enquirer today, Mr. Boehner said that “we need to repeal Obamacare” because it adds to the debt and is unaffordable. As a result, he wrote, “the law has to stay on the table as both parties discuss ways to solve our nation’s massive debt challenge.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Boehner’s Rearguard Guerrilla Action', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boehner, John A', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-21T21:19:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Firestone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Firestone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization