 third-biggest opening this year.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/21/one-direction-ends-taylor-swifts-run/', 'snippet': 'The British boy band’s second album, “Take Me Home,” sold 540,000 copies, the third-biggest opening this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After three weeks Taylor Swift has ceded her perch atop the Billboard album chart to Niall, Zayn, Liam, Harry and Louis. If those names do not ring a bell then you are likely neither a 14-year-old nor the parent or teacher of one. They are better known as the five young lads of One Direction. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'One Direction Ends Taylor Swift’s Run', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'One Direction Ends Taylor Swift’s Run', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Swift, Taylor', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'One Direction (Music Group)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-21T22:24:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Sisario', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sisario', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/28d6fa6b-ce62-5c9c-95bb-a26e2a9f4b0a', 'word_count': 207, 'uri': 'nyt://article/28d6fa6b-ce62-5c9c-95bb-a26e2a9f4b0a'}, {'abstract': 'Jim Harbaugh, the coach of the 49ers, has a good team. Which quarterback, Alex Smith or Colin Kaepernick, does he think could make it better? On Wednesday, the question remained unanswered.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/21/kaepernick-or-smith-thats-still-the-question/', 'snippet': 'Jim Harbaugh, the coach of the 49ers, has a good team.