tract': 'The playwright Chay Yew has taken over a Chicago theater company and is changing everything — including the roster of writers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/22/theater/victory-gardens-theater-in-chicago-in-new-era-with-chay-yew.html', 'snippet': 'The playwright Chay Yew has taken over a Chicago theater company and is changing everything — including the roster of writers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — When a storied theater undergoes a leadership change, the new guard must decide how to handle members of the old guard — playwrights, directors, staff members and loyal audiences — who may rely financially or artistically on the status quo. Often there are bruised feelings, but few recent turnovers have been as contentious as the one here at Victory Gardens Theater, where the finger pointing recalls family melodramas like “August: Osage County” or even “King Lear” (minus the murders).', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/arts/22VICTORY/22VICTORY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/arts/22VICTORY/22VICTORY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1387, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/arts/22VICTORY/22VICTORY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/22/arts/22VICTORY/22VICTORY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/arts/22VICTORY/22VI