_paragraph': 'When Danish schools need new furniture, they usually procure it from well-known Danish designers. Administrators at the University of Copenhagen fully intended to follow that tradition, but after looking around, they kept coming back to examples by the French brothers Ronan and Erwan Bouroullec. Hay, the designated Danish manufacturer, suggested the obvious: contacting the Bouroullecs directly to produce a collection.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/garden/22FURNITURE/22CURR4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/garden/22FURNITURE/22CURR4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1365, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/garden/22FURNITURE/22CURR4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/22/garden/22FURNITURE/22CURR4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/garden/22FURNITURE/22CURR4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Made for a School, but Fit for a Home', 'kicker': 'Currents | Furniture', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Made for a School, but Fit for a Home', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bouroullec, Ronan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tables', 'rank'