ul, sleekly futuristic devices, and new owners will want to sample a few programs that demonstrate what their capabilities truly are.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/22/technology/personaltech/apps-that-show-off-your-shiny-new-ipads-capabilities.html', 'snippet': 'The tablet revolution has produced powerful, sleekly futuristic devices, and new owners will want to sample a few programs that demonstrate what their capabilities truly are.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’ve been a gadget fanatic since before I could haltingly pronounce “gadget,” and technology is incorporated into every hour of my waking life in one way or another. But I remember that the first time I held a modern tablet PC was something extra-special. It was as if a bit of technology from 20 years in the future had fallen through a time warp and into my hands.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/business/SMART1/SMART1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1011, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/business/SMART1/SMART1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1011, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/business/SMART1/SMART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/22/business/SMART1/SMART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/business/SMART1/SMART1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 149, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name':