bombardment and violence is not enough to ensure peace in the region.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The cease-fire that ended eight days of bombing and airstrikes between Hamas and Israel should allow Israelis and Palestinians in Gaza to return to some normalcy as the two sides pull back from a violent cycle that killed 140 Palestinians and five Israelis in the past week. But even if it holds — and that is a big if — this moment of calm will not create real stability if it is not followed by a serious new peace effort aimed at a two-state solution.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '34', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Israel-Hamas Cease-Fire', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A New Israel-Hamas Cease-Fire', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gaza Strip', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hamas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fatah, Al', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ABBAS, MAHMOUD', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morsi, Mohamed', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-22T02:21:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/9c425194-aa16-5ac2-8370-29f0ca791aa9', 'word_count': 503, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9c425194-aa16-5ac2-8370-29f0ca791aa9'}, {'abstract': 'Friends say that David H. Petraeus’s priority is to set things right with his wife, but that he also has offers to teach, book proposals and an interest in serving on corporate boards.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/22/us/petraeus-lies-low-and-ponders-his-next-move.html', 'snippet': 'Friends say that David H. Petraeus’s priority is to set things right with his wife, but that he also has offers to teach, book proposals and an interest in serving on corporate boards.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ARLINGTON, Va. — Here on an expensive but otherwise unremarkable street in the suburbs of Washington, David H. Petraeus is managing a new life in the doghouse.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/us/PETREAUS-3/PETREAUS-3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/us/PETREAUS-3/PETREAUS-3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1322, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/us/PETREAUS-3/PETREAUS-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/22/us/PETREAUS-3/PETREAUS-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/22/us/PETREAUS-3/PETREAUS-3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Petraeus, Suddenly With Plenty of Free Time, Ponders His Next Move', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Petraeus, Suddenly With Plenty of Free Time, Ponders His Next Move', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADULTERY', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Petraeus, David H', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Central Intelligence Agency', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-22T02:29:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabeth Bumiller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bumiller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6fa39408-5465-5d02-847b-4ce6f1f6cc22', 'word_count': 1040, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6fa39408-5465-5d02-847b-4ce6f1f6cc22'}, {'abstract': 'Pretending to worship Farrah Fawcett-Majors while secretly adoring her husband.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/21/my-celebrity-love-triangle/', 'snippet': 'Pretending to worship Farrah Fawcett-Majors while secretly adoring her husband.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I was 11, I wanted to marry Lee Majors. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'My Celebrity Love Triangle', 'kicker': 'Townies', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'My Celebrity Love Triangle', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fawcett, Farrah', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Majors, Lee', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ne