 year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — The Chinese manufacturing sector expanded for the first time in more than a year in November, according to the early reading of a business survey released Thursday, in the latest sign the world’s second-largest economy may, for now at least, have skirted the sharp slowdown that many economists had feared earlier this year.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Manufacturing in China Showed Growth in November', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Manufacturing in China\r\nShowed Growth in November', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-22T03:41:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Global Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bettina Wassener', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bettina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wassener', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a5ff65ee-3413-58fa-93ee-286184ac796c', 'word_count': 324, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a5ff65ee-3413-58fa-93ee-286184ac796c'}, {'abstract': 'The Israeli attack on Gaza, and the retaliation by Hamas with Iranian-supplied missiles, turned the tables for the Islamic republic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/22/world/middleeast/iran-missiles-in-gaza-give-tehran-government-a-lift.html', 'snippet': 'The Israeli attack on Gaza, and the retaliation by Hamas with Iranian-supplied missiles, turned the tables for the Islamic republic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TEHRAN — Above the bustling Niayesh highway in the w