tting flood-damaged homes in Queens and helping to organize a benefit hockey clinic on Staten Island. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/sports/23richards1/23richards1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/23/sports/23richards1/23richards1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/sports/23richards1/23richards1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/sports/23richards1/23richards1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/sports/23richards1/23richards1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/23/sports/23richards1/23richards1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/sports/23richards1/23richards1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Ranger Rolls Up His Sleeves and Takes a Big Role in Hurricane Relief', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Ranger Rolls Up His Sleeves and Takes a Big Role in Hurricane Relief', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Richards, Brad', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-22T14:53:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/758849c0-1a85-56ae-94d7-ac18d8b9afc8', 'word_count': 851, 'uri': 'nyt://article/758849c0-1a85-56ae-94d7-ac18d8b9afc8'}, {'abstract': 'Jay Bulger found a challenging subject for his new film, “Beware of Mr. Baker”: Ginger Baker, the drummer of Cream with a wild history in rock and life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/25/movies/a-documentary-looks-at-the-drummer-ginger-baker.html', 'snippet': 'Jay Bulger found a challenging subject for his new film, “Beware of Mr. Baker”: Ginger Baker, the drummer of Cream with a wild history in rock and life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AT the impetuous age of 16, Jay Bulger learned the hard way that chutzpah has its limits. In short order this future filmmaker got a driver’s license, a Volkswagen Corrado and, with Tupac Shakur’s “Me Against the World“ cranking full blast, took a joy ride on the streets of Washington. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/arts/25GINGER1_SPAN/25GINGER1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/25/arts/25GINGER1_SPAN/25GINGER1_SPAN-arti