61-992fcbbd6d3b'}, {'abstract': 'Republicans were talking 2016 before Mitt Romney had conceded, and plenty of 2014 political campaigns are already well under way.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/23/us/in-texas-2014-campaigns-have-already-begun.html', 'snippet': 'Republicans were talking 2016 before Mitt Romney had conceded, and plenty of 2014 political campaigns are already well under way.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Just when your mailbox is clear of attacks and your television is free of fuzzy and unflattering black-and-white images of career politicians, the political pros have already started manufacturing grist for the elections two years from now. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/us/23TTRamsey1/23TTRamsey1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 764, 'width': 541, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/us/23TTRamsey1/23TTRamsey1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 764, 'width': 541, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/us/23TTRamsey1/23TTRamsey1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/23/us/23TTRamsey1/23TTRamsey1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/us/23TTRamsey1/23TTRamsey1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Campaigns Are Dead, Long Live the Campaigns', 'kicker': 'The Texas Tribune', 'content_kicker': 