nt': 245, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7582e8bc-34c3-5cc8-8ace-241565daa8e1'}, {'abstract': 'A judge said three Malian men who agreed to ship drugs to support Al Qaeda were motivated by money, prompting speculation about the impact on similar cases.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/23/nyregion/judges-ruling-in-qaeda-terror-case-open-ideology-debate.html', 'snippet': 'A judge said three Malian men who agreed to ship drugs to support Al Qaeda were motivated by money, prompting speculation about the impact on similar cases.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The three men from the impoverished West African country of Mali were at the mercy of the court. Each had pleaded guilty to a terrorism charge. All had been accused in a plot to move numerous shipments of cocaine across two continents to support Al Qaeda and two other terrorist organizations.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Citing Terror Defendants’ Motivation, Judge Shows Sentencing Leniency', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Citing Terror Defendants’ Motivation, Judge Shows Sentencing Leniency', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Toure, Harouna', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abdelrahman, Idriss', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mali', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Issa, Oumar', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL QAEDA', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Barbara S', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-23T03:09:47+0000',