er the Hindu leader Bal K. Thackeray’s death last week.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Conceived in Haste, India’s Internet Law Now Targeted for Change', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thackeray, Balasaheb K', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mumbai (India)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-23T05:13:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Niharika Mandhana', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Niharika', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mandhana', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5701f251-a289-5500-9850-684d07c89b2b', 'word_count': 944, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5701f251-a289-5500-9850-684d07c89b2b'}, {'abstract': 'On national television Thursday, the Jets were pummeled by the Patriots, a defeat that recalibrated how words like embarrassing and absurd are used to describe the franchise.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/23/sports/football/jets-humiliated-by-patriots-in-a-new-york-minute.html', 'snippet': 'On national television Thursday, the Jets were pummeled by the Patriots, a defeat that recalibrated how words like embarrassing and absurd are used to describe the franchise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — After the Patriots’ fourth touchdown in six minutes Thursday night, the NBC cameras panned to Rex Ryan. Nostrils flaring, eyes burning, he looked like a man who had chased a bushel of habaneros with a bucket of nails. He said but one word: unbelievable.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/sports/23jets11/23jets11-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/23/sports/23jets11/23jets11-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/sports/23jets11/23jets11-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/sports/23jets11/23jets11-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1375, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/sports/23jets11/23jets11-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/23/sports/23jets11/23jets11-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/23/sports/23jets11/23jets11-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Humiliated in a New York Minute', 'kicker': 'Patriots 49, Jets 19', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Humiliated in a New York Minute', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': 