ese politics isn’t known as a hotbed of excitement, but insofar as next month’s general election is generating any buzz at all it’s because of one man: Toru Hashimoto, the plain-talking 43-year-old mayor of Osaka. An outsider with a hard-nosed reform agenda centered on cutting spending, Hashimoto has pioneered a new kind of Japanese populism. Call it the Green Tea Party.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Rise of the Green Tea Party', 'kicker': 'Latitude', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hashimoto, Toru', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Osaka (Japan)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-23T09:18:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Francisco Toro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Francisco', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Toro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/871158e4-649f-5c5a-a218-365b3ab8e38b', 'word_count': 501, 'uri': 'nyt://article/871158e4-649f-5c5a-a218-365b3ab8e38b'}, {'abstract': 'A billionaire developer is building a luxury resort town-within-a-town at Andermatt, Switzerland, an ambitious project that allows foreigners to buy property without restrictions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/25/realestate/big-deal-selling-a-hot-spot-to-the-beau-monde.html', 'snippet': 'A billionaire developer is building a luxury resort town-within-a-town at Andermatt, Switzerland, an ambitious project that allows foreigners to buy property without restrictions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TUCKED away in central Switzerland, Andermatt was for decades a low-key Alpine town popular with skiers searching for an off-piste experience. Its brief claim to movie fame was as the setting for a car chase in the James Bond film “Goldfinger.”', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/realestate/25DEAL_SPAN/25DEAL_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/25/realestate/25DEAL_SPAN/25DEAL_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/realestate/25DEAL_SPAN/deal-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/realestate/25DEAL_SPAN/deal-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1338, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/realestate/25DEAL_SPAN/25DEAL_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/25/realestate/25DEAL_SPAN/25DEAL_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/realestate/25DEAL_SPAN/25DEAL_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Selling a ‘Hot Spot’ to the Beau Monde', 'kicker': 'Big Deal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Selling a ‘Hot Spot’ to the Beau Monde', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations',