ri': 'nyt://article/96259710-ee0c-5008-8594-48832cc5734b'}, {'abstract': 'Mission Healthcare in San Diego, Calif., decided that clients should be able to specify how much help they want in 15-minute increments.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/23/1123-help-by-the-hour/', 'snippet': 'Mission Healthcare in San Diego, Calif., decided that clients should be able to specify how much help they want in 15-minute increments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here is a bright idea that ought to spread: You call your home care agency and say you will need your mother’s aide for the normal two hours on Monday and Wednesday, but for just half an hour (to drive her to a doctor’s office) on Tuesday, then 90 minutes on Thursday. And the agency says, “Sure.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Help by the Hour, or Less', 'kicker': 'The New Old Age', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elderly', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Home Health Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-23T11:33:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paula Span', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paula', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Span', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a90d5928-6a11-54e5-94bf-1d61b7e6a9ad', 'word_count': 448, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a90d5928-6a11-54e5-94bf-1d61b7e6a9ad'}, {'abstract': 'Anti-Shiite violence in Pakistan is on the rise, thanks to the government’s half-hearted efforts to tackle sectarian militants.', 'web_url': 'https://latitude.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/23/the-plight-of-pakistans-shiites/', 'snippet': 'Anti-Shiite violence in Pakistan is on the rise, thanks to the government’s half-hearted efforts to tackle sectarian militants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Muharram, the first month of the Islamic calendar, is one of four sacred months during which fighting is prohibited. In Pakistan, it is usually one of the bloodiest. Sectarian militant groups see it as the perfect opportunity to target Shiite Muslims, who mark Muharram with daily sermons and frequent processions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Plight of Pakistan’s Shiites', 'kicker': 'Latitude', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of Religion', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shiite Muslims', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-23T11:38:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Huma Yusuf', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Huma', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yusuf', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/72d5f7f2-6dd8-56bd-a988-ba3f3e1b2b99', 'word_count': 615, 'uri': 'nyt://article/72d5f7f2-6dd8-56bd-a988-ba3f3e1b2b99'}, {'abstract': 'A vicious attack in Rome left 10 fans of England’s Tottenham Hotspurs soccer team wounded. The assault, blamed on anti-Semitic racists, came at a time when the London club is debating how to celebrate its Jewish connections.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/23/anti-semites-blamed-for-rome-soccer-attack/', 'snippet': 'A vicious attack in Rome left 10 fans of England’s Tottenham Hotspurs soccer team wounded. The assault, blamed on anti-Semitic racists, came at a time when the London club i