or.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/23/delhi-teen-slain-after-confronting-man-urinating-in-public/', 'snippet': 'A 17-year-old was shot by her irate neighbor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Aslam Khan lost his 17-year-old daughter to a petty fight Wednesday night over an issue that plagues India’s capital – men urinating in public.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Delhi Teen Slain After Confronting Man Urinating in Public', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Delhi (India)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-23T11:59:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Raksha Kumar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Raksha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kumar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b109f166-503d-5d11-8fb0-ca73743999f1', 'word_count': 404, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b109f166-503d-5d11-8fb0-ca73743999f1'}, {'abstract': 'The resort collections featured twists on the classic tweed suit, with skirts that stop short and blazers and bombers that can go it alone.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/23/wool-lite/', 'snippet': 'The resort collections featured twists on the classic tweed suit, with skirts that stop short and blazers and bombers that can go it alone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The resort collections featured twists on the classic tweed suit, with skirts that stop short and blazers and bombers that can go it alone. ', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '62', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wool Lite', 'kicker': 'T M