/article/7ac59c53-f782-59d2-bae6-6ffa49761fff', 'word_count': 1149, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ac59c53-f782-59d2-bae6-6ffa49761fff'}, {'abstract': 'The 1976 BBC mini-series “I, Claudius” became a hit despite the trepidations of critics, its cast and its director.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/25/arts/television/i-claudius-returns-in-a-35th-anniversary-dvd-set.html', 'snippet': 'The 1976 BBC mini-series “I, Claudius” became a hit despite the trepidations of critics, its cast and its director.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE making of the 1976 BBC mini-series “I, Claudius” was fraught with headaches. The specter of an ill-fated, unfinished 1937 movie version starring Charles Laughton loomed large. At one point the project died when negotiations between the BBC and London Films, which owned the rights to the Laughton effort, broke down. When taping did begin, the actors struggled with everything from their makeup to making sense of their roles as the early rulers of the Roman Empire.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/arts/25CLAUDIUS1_SPAN/25CLAUDIUS1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/25/arts/25CLAUDIUS1_SPAN/25CLAUDIUS1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/arts/25CLAUDIUS1_SPAN/25CLAUDIUS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/arts/25CLAUDIUS1_SPAN/25CLAUDIUS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1438, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt