er/reviews/inner-voices-at-30th-street-theater.html', 'snippet': 'Alexandra Silber, Hunter Foster and Arielle Jacobs star in “Inner Voices,” an evening of three one-act solo musicals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alexandra Silber spends most of her time in “Arlington” sitting at the family piano, primly dressed in a floral print, pearls and a white cardigan, and gradually releasing the anguish behind her repression. Her voice is operatic and filled with emotion; so is this sweet, sobering drama, by Polly Pen and Victor Lodato, the poignant standout in the latest production in the Premieres series Inner Voices (the others were in 2008 and 2010), an evening of three one-act solo musicals at 30th Street Theater, with minimal sets, unassuming production values and intense introspection.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/arts/INNER/INNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 361, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/26/arts/INNER/INNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 361}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/arts/INNER/INNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 927, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/arts/INNER/INNER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1854, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/arts/INNER/INNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/26/arts/INNER/INNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 't