 533, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26ea91b4-e8ec-5c3a-9306-c152d4233e10'}, {'abstract': 'Isaiah Richardson Jr. has a lucrative daily gig on the steps of the Metropolitan Museum of Art, where he plays the national songs of many countries to entertain tourists who flock there.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/25/nyregion/isaiah-richardson-jr-has-a-good-stage-on-museum-steps.html', 'snippet': 'Isaiah Richardson Jr. has a lucrative daily gig on the steps of the Metropolitan Museum of Art, where he plays the national songs of many countries to entertain tourists who flock there.', 'lead_paragraph': 'He is there every afternoon in his tailcoat and tie, playing rousing saxophone for tips on the steps in front of the Metropolitan Museum of Art, which are usually covered with tourists.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/nyregion/25CHARACTER_SPAN/25CHARACTER_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/25/nyregion/25CHARACTER_SPAN/25CHARACTER_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/nyregion/25CHARACTER_SPAN/25CHARACTER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/nyregion/25CHARACTER_SPAN/25CHARACTER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/nyregion/25CHARACTER_SPAN/25CHARACTER_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75