 old road from New York City to Boston is still called the Boston Post Road in Westchester County and Connecticut, and Boston Road in parts of the Bronx, but its origins are less obvious.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/25/nyregion/the-meanderings-of-the-boston-post-road.html', 'snippet': 'The old road from New York City to Boston is still called the Boston Post Road in Westchester County and Connecticut, and Boston Road in parts of the Bronx, but its origins are less obvious.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q. The old road from New York City to Boston is still called the Boston Post Road in Westchester County and Connecticut, and Boston Road in parts of the Bronx. I presume it began in Lower Manhattan, but where was it in that borough? Broadway?', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/nyregion/25FYI/25FYI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/nyregion/25FYI/25FYI-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/nyregion/25FYI/25FYI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/25/nyregion/25FYI/25FYI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/nyregion/25FYI/25FYI-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Old Way to Boston', 'kicker': 'F.