Zealand’s independent film community is enormously grateful for Peter Jackson, whose blockbuster “Lord of the Rings” trilogy, among other things, gave Kiwi directors a jolt of confidence.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Small Country Crowded With Filmmakers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Small Country Crowded With Filmmakers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Zealand', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jackson, Peter', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-24T02:18:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooks Barnes and Michael Cieply', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cieply', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eb6e4604-52bb-591d-8fc1-e03f89edbfa3', 'word_count': 902, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eb6e4604-52bb-591d-8fc1-e03f89edbfa3'}, {'abstract': 'At Harvest-on-Hudson restaurant, whose grand spaces offer riverfront views, the pasta dishes are steps above the ordinary.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/25/nyregion/a-review-of-harvest-on-hudson-restaurant-in-hastings-on-hudson.html', 'snippet': 'At Harvest-on-Hudson restaurant, whose grand spaces offer riverfront views, the pasta dishes are steps above the ordinary.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Harvest-on-Hudson has long enchanted diners with its grand spaces: not only its handsome dining room, but also its lovely patios, gardens and walkways that meet the river’s edge. Hurricane Sandy brought the river over Harvest’s lawns and into the dining rooms, but on recent visits we found the floors dry, if a bit warped, and the bar in full swing. The chilly autumn weather has eliminated the possibility of dining outside, but the lights across the river still shimmer through the dark, and the blazing hearth is cheerful and perfect for the season.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/nyregion/25DINEWE1/25DINEWE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/nyregion/25DINEWE1/25DINEWE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/nyregion/25DINEWE1/25DINEWE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/25/nyregion/25DINEWE1/25DINEWE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/nyregion/25DINEWE1/25DINEWE1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Enchanting Setting for Italian Adventures', 'kicker': 'Westchester Dining | Hastings-On-Hudson', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Enchanting SettingFor Italian Adventures', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hastings-on-Hudson (NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'm