ed a deal to ensure the Continent’s future in space development.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/24/europe-reaches-budget-deal-on-space/', 'snippet': 'Europe’s contentious budget talks collapsed as national leaders fought in Brussels. But, in a more modest forum in Naples, ministers reached a deal to ensure the Continent’s future in space development.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — While European government chiefs were grandstanding in Brussels this week in what turned out to be a vain attempt to hammer out a common budget, their science ministers were quietly celebrating a deal to secure Europe’s prospects in space.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/24/blogs/rdv-space/rdv-space-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 728, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/24/blogs/rdv-space/rdv-space-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1456, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Europe Reaches Budget Deal on Space', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Space', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Space Agency', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-24T13:31:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Harvey Morris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Harvey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Morris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/365fd290-d5aa-5a8c-8dda-eb2eaf673ab9', 'word_count': 527, 'uri': 'nyt://article/365fd290-d5aa-5a8c-8dda-eb2eaf673ab9'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Camacho, the flamboyant boxer known as Macho, emerged from a delinquent childhood in New York City’s Spanish Harlem to become a world champion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/25/sports/hector-camacho-50-boxer-who-lived-dangerously-dies.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Camacho, the flamboyant boxer known as Macho, emerged from a delinquent childhood in New York City’s Spanish Harlem to become a world champion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hector Camacho, a boxer known for his lightning-quick hands and flamboyant personality who emerged from a delinquent childhood in New York’s Spanish Harlem to become a world champion in three weight classes, died Saturday in San Juan, P.R., four days after after being shot while sitting in a parked car. He was 50.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/sports/camacho1/camacho1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 687, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/sports/camacho1/camacho1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1374, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/sports/camacho1/camacho1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/25/sports/camacho1/camacho1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/sports/camacho1/camacho1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hector Camacho, 50, Boxer Who Lived Dangerously, Dies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hector Camacho, 50, Boxer Known for His Quick Hands', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Camacho, Hector', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boxing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Puerto Rico', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-24T14:28:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Weber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/d737d851-1d4c-5627-8207-84c30de85f8d', 'word_count': 877, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d737d851-1d4c-5627-8207-84c30de85f8d'}, {'abstract': 'Models are good for your soul.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/24/a-meta-modeling-meditation/', 'snippet': 'Models are good for your soul.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’m still thinking about the whole “America could only give workers decent living standards when it didn’t face competition” discussion. For one thing, this is an old favorite discussion of mine; the “growth and trade” literature goes back more than 60 years, but there aren’t, I think, many prominent economists working today who know much about that tradition, so I may be the last of the Mohicans or something. For another, this subject is a perfect illustration of the important of actually having a model – I’ll explain in a minute what I mean by that. And one more point: what we learn from this story is that a model may be created to answer one question, or defend a particular position, but if it’s a good model it can be used in multiple settings, and sometimes may even end up supporting a different side in the political debate.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Meta Modeling Meditation', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-24T14:53:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/20f05327-a427-5cb1-8223-56f4ce6e07fe', 'word_count': 870, 'uri': 'nyt://article/20f05327-a427-5cb1-8223-56f4ce6e07fe'}, {'abstract': 'Larry Hagman’s portrayal of the Texas oilman J.R. Ewing on the CBS series “Dallas,” made him one of the most well-known stars of the 1970s and 80s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/06/10/arts/television/20121124_HAGMAN.html', 'snippet': 'Larry Hagman’s portrayal of the Texas oilman J.R. Ewing on the CBS series “Dallas,” made him one of the most well-known stars of the 1970s and 80s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Larry Hagman’s portrayal of the Texas oilman J.R. Ewing on the CBS series “Dallas,” made him one of the most well-known stars of the 1970s and 80s.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/arts/television/20121124_HAGMAN-slide-696O/20121124_HAGMAN-slide-696O-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'ur