want-to-have-say-during-talks-over-budget.html', 'snippet': 'With their states still recovering from the recession, governors say they fear that talks in Washington to avert the so-called fiscal cliff will actually lead to deep cuts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Their states are still recovering from the recession, and now the nation’s governors are bracing, again, for cuts in federal aid. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/us/GOVS/GOVS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/us/GOVS/GOVS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'States Want to Have Say During Talks Over Budget', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'States Want To Have Say During Talks Over Budget', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Governors (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-24T16:06:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ec00031e-a0da-5717-ba7b-aa8525a4252a', 'word_count': 1156, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ec00031e-a0