 move could jeopardize a fragile system that makes the most of the Knicks’ tight nine-player rotation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Coach Mike Woodson and the Knicks are not eager to discuss what will happen when Amar’e Stoudemire returns from a left knee injury that has kept him sidelined, but you can bet Woodson is working on a plan to reintegrate his $100 million player.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Knicks Find Winning Formula Without Stoudemire', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Winning Mix, With a Star Missing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ANTHONY, CARMELO', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chandler, Tyson', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kidd, Jason', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Prigioni, Pablo', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, J R', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "Stoudemire, Amar'e", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woodson, Mike', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-24T16:34:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Beckley Mason', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Beckley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mason', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/455ca9d0-599d-55d8-9756-1196d81a79e4', 'word_count': 934, 'uri': 'nyt://article/455ca9d0-599d-55d8-9756-1196d81a79e4'}, {'abstract': 'One result of the spread of cellphones in India is that more prostitutes have become independent of brothels, a development that has made AIDS prevention harder.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/25/world/asia/indian-prostitutes-new-autonomy-imperils-aids-fight.html', 'snippet': 'One result of the spread of cellphones in India is that more prostitutes have become independent of brothels, a development that has made AIDS prevention harder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MUMBAI, India — Millions once bought sex in the narrow alleys of Kamathipura, a vast red-light district here. But prostitutes with inexpensive mobile phones are luring customers elsewhere, and that is endangering the astonishing progress India has made against AIDS.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/world/BROTHELS/BROTHELS-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/25/world/BROTHELS/BROTHELS-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/world/BROTHELS/BROTHELS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/world/BROTHELS/BROTHELS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1383, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/world/BROTHELS/BROTHELS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/25/world/BROTHELS/BROTHELS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'imag