hampionship last Sunday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/25/sports/30-seconds-with-brad-keselowski-the-new-champion-and-the-new-face-of-nascar.html', 'snippet': 'First, Brad Keselowski became a Nascar star on Twitter, and then he became a star on the track, winning his first Sprint Cup championship last Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'First, Brad Keselowski became a Nascar star on Twitter, and then he became a star on the track, winning his first Sprint Cup championship last Sunday. He also brought Roger Penske his first Cup championship in 40 years in the series. Since his championship, Keselowski, 28, has enjoyed perks like doing the Top 10 list on “The Late Show With David Letterman” and riding in the Thanksgiving parade in Detroit, his hometown. On his final stop in New York last week, Keselowski sat — with his feet up and shoes off, and his ever-present smartphone in hand — with Times reporters and editors to talk about his boss, his hobbies and the future of Nascar. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/sports/seconds1/seconds1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 965, 'width': 771, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/sports/seconds1/seconds1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 965, 'width': 771, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/sports/seconds1/seconds1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/25/sports/seconds1/seconds1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 