ed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/25/sports/ncaabasketball/for-kevin-ollie-at-uconn-opportunity-whispers.html', 'snippet': 'In two years as an assistant under Calhoun, Kevin Ollie established a rapport with players and earned a reputation as a savvy recruiter, after his 13-year N.B.A. playing career ended.', 'lead_paragraph': 'STORRS, Conn. — As he walked toward the locker room after his first win at home as the new men’s basketball coach at Connecticut, Kevin Ollie was intercepted. There was Warde Manuel, the UConn athletic director, beaming proudly. The two men embraced.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/sports/dog-uconn/dog-uconn-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/sports/dog-uconn/dog-uconn-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1420, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/sports/dog-uconn/dog-uconn-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/25/sports/dog-uconn/dog-uconn-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/sports/dog-uconn/dog-uconn-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At UConn, Opportunity Whispers for the Coach Who Replaced Calhoun', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At UConn, Opportunity Whispers for 