ibusters has risen since the 1970s, especially when Republicans have been in the Senate minority. But the most recent spike of Republican filibusters has coincided with the Democrats’ unprecedented moves to limit amendments on the Senate floor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2012/11/24/us/politics/maneuvering-in-the-senate.html', 'snippet': 'The use of filibusters has risen since the 1970s, especially when Republicans have been in the Senate minority. But the most recent spike of Republican filibusters has coincided with the Democrats’ unprecedented moves to limit amendments on the Se...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The use of filibusters has risen since the 1970s, especially when Republicans have been in the Senate minority. But the most recent spike of Republican filibusters has coincided with the Democrats’ unprecedented moves to limit amendments on the Senate floor.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Maneuvering in the Senate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-24T22:39:45+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'U.S.', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/d6844024-8660-5f74-aa33-92177542d7ad', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/d6844024-8660-5f74-aa33-92177542d7ad'}, {'abstract': 'It is rare that the spotlight goes to the drivers who qualified in fourth and eighth position but that’s where the two championship contenders, Sebastian Vettel and Fernando Alonso, will have a big battle on Sunday. Fourteenth? Michael Schumacher, in his last race of his career.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/24/brazilian-grand-prix-its-all-about-who-is-not-on-pole-and-who-qualified-14th/', 'snippet': 'It is rare that the spotlight goes to the drivers who qualified in fourth and eighth position but that’s where the two championship contenders, Sebastian Vettel and Fernando Alonso, will have a big battle on Sunday. Fourteenth? Michael Schumacher,...', 'lead_paragraph': 'SÃO PAULO — The final race of the Formula One season, running in São Paulo tomorrow at the Brazilian Grand Prix, will decide who becomes the youngest triple world champion in history: Sebastian Vettel of Red Bull or Fernando Alonso of Ferrari. The battle is guaranteed to be exciting, after Vettel qualified to start the race only in the fourth position, and Alonso only eighth, guaranteeing that neither will be able to run off in the lead from start to finish.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/24/blogs/24formulaone-schubrazil/24formulaone-schubrazil-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 318, 'width': 512, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/24/blogs/24formulaone-schubrazil/24formulaone-schubrazil-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 318, 'width': 512, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Brazilian Grand Prix? It’s All About Who Is Not on Pole — and Who Qualified 14th', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Formula One', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mercedes GP Petronas Formula One Team', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-24T22:49:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brad Spurgeon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Spu