icle/09dbe629-5ebd-5f37-8b17-f31db796b282'}, {'abstract': 'David Wilson, the Giants’ first-round draft choice, has contributed on kick returns, and he is working on developing as a running back.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/26/sports/football/giants-david-wilson-is-still-figuring-out-how-to-attain-his-lofty-goals.html', 'snippet': 'David Wilson, the Giants’ first-round draft choice, has contributed on kick returns, and he is working on developing as a running back.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — David Wilson, the Giants’ first-round draft choice in April, does not want to be another N.F.L. running back whose contribution is so modest he is forgotten over time. He is driven to excel.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/sports/football/26wilson-pic/26wilson-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 435, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/26/sports/football/26wilson-pic/26wilson-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 435}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/sports/football/26wilson-pic/26wilson-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 801, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/sports/football/26wilson-pic/26wilson-pic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1602, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/sports/football/26wilson-pic/26wilson-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnai