 of Representatives. One of her major accomplishments: helping to write the law that bans federal recognition of same-sex marriages.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/us/SUB-GAY/SUB-GAY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/us/SUB-GAY/SUB-GAY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1338, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/us/SUB-GAY/SUB-GAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/26/us/SUB-GAY/SUB-GAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/us/SUB-GAY/SUB-GAY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Republican and Lesbian, and Fighting for Acceptance of Both Identities', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Republican and Lesbian, and Fighting for Acceptance of Both Identities', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-25T21:01:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Wheaton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wheaton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/001d6bac-ac01-5518-a296-6dcbd65f17ea', 'word_count': 1094, 'uri': 'nyt://article/001d6bac-ac01-5518-a296-6dcbd65f17ea'}, {'abstract': 'The Knicks treated the game against Detroit as a warm-up for Monday’s matchup with Brooklyn, hitting 51.5 percent from beyond the arc to score a season high in points and end a two-game skid.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/26/sports/basketball/knicks-make-quick-work-of-pistons.html', 'snippet': 'The Knicks treated the game against Detroit as a warm-up for Monday’s matchup with Brooklyn, hitting 51.5 percent from beyond the arc to score a season high in points and end a two-game skid.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There was not much reason for the Knicks to dwell on Sunday’s 121-100 victory against the Detroit Pistons. They handled their business in a manner tantamount to a Sunday stroll in the park. It was hard not to view it like a warm-up exercise ahead of Monday’s matchup against their new crosstown foes in Brooklyn.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/sports/basketball/26knicks-pic/26knicks-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 793, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/sports/basketball/26knicks-pic/26knicks-pic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1586, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/sports/basketball/26knicks-pic/26knicks-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/26/sports/basketball/26knicks-pic/26knicks-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/sports/basketball/26knicks-pic/26knicks-pic-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Knicks Get Ready to Meet the Neighbors by Routing the Pistons', 'kicker': 'Knicks 121, Pistons 100', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Knicks Get Ready To Meet the Neighbors By Routing the Pistons', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ANTHONY, CARMELO', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Detroit Pistons', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-25T21:05:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zach Schonbrun', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zach', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schonbrun', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/36edd477-9e45-57df-a149-523f086362ed', 'word_count': 808, 'uri': 'nyt://article/36edd477-9e45-57df-a149-523f086362ed'}, {'abstract': 'Data will include a housing price index and consumer confidence for November and revised third-quarter gross domestic product, and Kroger and Tiffany will report earnings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/26/business/economy/economic-reports-for-the-week-of-nov-26.html', 'snippet': 'Data will include a housing price index and consumer confidence for November and revised third-quarter gross domestic product, and Kroger and Tiffany will report earnings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ECONOMIC REPORTS Data scheduled to be released include durable goods for October, the Standard & Poor’s/Case-Shiller housing price index and consumer confidence for November (Tuesday); new home sales for October and the Federal Reserve beige book, weekly jobless claims, third-quarter gross domestic product (revised) and pending home sales for October (Thursday); and personal income and spending for October and the Chicago Purchasing Managers’ Index for November (Friday).', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Economic Reports for the Week Ahead', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Looking Ahead', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Standard & Poor's Case-Shiller Home Price Index", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-25T21:06:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/77b02bee-bf6a-5ac6-9454-5dd42a3fd60d', 'word_count': 200, 'uri': 'nyt://article/77b02bee-bf6a-5ac6-9454-5dd42a3fd60d'}, {'abstract': 'At the season premiere of Sonja Frisell’s 1988 production of “Aida” for the Metropolitan Opera the company fielded a trio of soloists of impressive vocal power and stamina.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/26/arts/music/aida-at-metropolitan-opera.html', 'snippet': 'At the season premiere of Sonja Frisell’s 1988 production of “Aida” for the Metropolitan Opera the company fielded a trio of soloists of impressive vocal power and stamina.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For any opera house, scheduling Verdi’s “Aida” is a safe enough bet. The real danger lies in the casting. At the season premiere of Sonja Frisell’s handsome 1988 production for the Metropolitan Opera on Friday evening the company fielded a trio of soloists of impressive vocal power and stamina. For Liudmyla Monastyrska, who brought her voluptuous soprano to the title role, it was a triumphant house debut. For Carl Tanner, stepping in at the last minute for the ailing tenor Marco Berti, it was a felicitous return after his appearance in Puccini’s “Fanciulla del West” two years ago.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/arts/AIDA2/AIDA2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 964, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/arts/AIDA2/AIDA2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1530, 'width': 1625, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/arts/AIDA2/AIDA2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/26/arts/AIDA2/AIDA2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/arts/AIDA2/AIDA2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Pinch-Hitting Tenor and a Soprano’s Debut on a Trip to Old Egypt', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Pinch-Hitting Tenor And a Soprano’s Debut On a Trip to Old Egypt', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Frisell, Sonja', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tanner, Carl', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Opera', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Monastyrska, Liudmyla', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-25T21:08:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Corinna da Fonseca-Wollheim', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/f5e6ea08-2489-5546-b27a-1a3958e3f03f', 'word_count': 510, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5e6ea08-2489-5546-b27a-1a3958e3f03f'}, {'abstract': 'President Mohamed Morsi defended his decree, but his justice minister urged a retreat following a plunge in the country’s stock market and the threat of more street protests.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/26/world/middleeast/morsis-judicial-decree-draws-high-level-dissent.html', 'snippet': 'President Mohamed Morsi defended his decree, but his justice minister urged a retreat following a plunge in the country’s stock market and the threat of more street protests.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — Cracks appeared on Sunday in the government of President Mohamed Morsi of Egypt, as he faces mounting pressure over his sweeping decree seeking to elevate his edicts above the reach of any court until a new constitution is approved. ', 'print_sec