 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morsi, Mohamed', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-25T21:09:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By David D. Kirkpatrick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50a00068-13b7-54fc-a9c1-117385ffdc7d', 'word_count': 1295, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50a00068-13b7-54fc-a9c1-117385ffdc7d'}, {'abstract': 'In Baby Jane Dexter’s cabaret show, each song is a slice of life, and the message is that life is messy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/26/arts/music/baby-jane-dexter-at-the-metropolitan-room.html', 'snippet': 'In Baby Jane Dexter’s cabaret show, each song is a slice of life, and the message is that life is messy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A performance by the cabaret singer Baby Jane Dexter is like a revival meeting without Jesus. Possessed of a booming contralto, Ms. Dexter doesn’t sing lyrics so much as preach them as if she were imparting carefully chosen passages of Scripture. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/arts/BABYJANE/BABYJANE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 605, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'ran