 and black hats with ear flaps, gathered on the roof of a yellow brick building.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In the Penal Colony', 'kicker': 'Latitude', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-26T11:31:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Masha Gessen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Masha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gessen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1be85e42-a4f5-5cbd-8063-232a233af173', 'word_count': 661, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1be85e42-a4f5-5cbd-8063-232a233af173'}, {'abstract': 'Every Monday morning, we publish a New York Times photo without any caption, headline or other information about its origins. Join the conversation by posting about what you see and why in our comments section.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/26/whats-going-on-in-this-picture-nov-26-2012/', 'snippet': 'Every Monday morning, we publish a New York Times photo without any caption, headline or other information about its origins. Join the conversation by posting about what you see and why in our comments section.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Update: Nov. 27, 2012', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/25/learning/VTS11-26