parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/26/joint-custody-via-e-mail-and-ical/', 'snippet': 'Communicating via technology can ease emotions when handling the ever-changing details of joint custody agreements.', 'lead_paragraph': 'How much easier has technology made your more difficult relationships? From in-laws to hair stylists, when those with whom it was once difficult to communicate shift online, the shift in the ease of your relationship can be palpable. Suddenly, there’s no lengthy back-and-forth in scheduling. As for those comments about your brother-in-law you wish you could take back the minute you hear them come out of your mouth, that’s what the delete button is for. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Joint Custody Via E-Mail and iCal', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Custody and Support', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Divorce, Separations and Annulments', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paul, Pamela', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-26T17:47:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': "By Kj Dell'Antonia", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kj', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "Dell'Antonia", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ea7d3c5-3481-5af8-8f9e-86c6e5fddc42', 'word_count': 225, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ea7d3c5-3481-5af8-8f9e-86c6e5fddc42'}, {'abstract': 'The play was to have opened on Jan. 30 in Denmark.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/26/after-fathers-objection-play-about-amy-winehouse-is-canceled/', 'snippet': 'The play was to have opened on Jan. 30 in Denmark.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Royal Theater in Denmark has canceled a play about Amy Winehouse because Mitch Winehouse, the singer’s father,\xa0 is blocking use of her music and photographs of her, The Associated Press reported. A spokesman for the Danish copyright agency Koda, which had initially given the theater the go-ahead to incorporate the material in its production, said that Mr. Winehouse had not given a reason for his objection.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Father’s Objection, Play About Amy Winehouse Is Canceled', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Copyrights and Copyright Violations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Winehouse, Amy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Denmark', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-26T17:50:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/44d70f93-b6b9-582b-878e-02b2963a5ec5', 'word_count': 139, 'uri': 'nyt://article/44d70f93-b6b9-582b-878e-02b2963a5ec5'}, {'abstract': 'Grover Norquist on Monday found a new way of dismissing the handful of Republican lawmakers — including the House majority leader — who are now publicly wavering about his pledge they signed not ever to raise taxes.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/26/norquist-says-some-republicans-having-impure-thoughts-on-taxes/', 'snippet': 'Grover Norquist on Monday found a new way of dismissing the handful of Republican lawmakers — including the House