0b-ba33-5f0f-a4a6-30d21992bd90'}, {'abstract': 'These root vegetables, tossed with fettuccine and some niçoise olives, complement the brambly, herbal notes of this crop of Languedoc wines.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/28/dining/sunchokes-cloaked-in-rosemary.html', 'snippet': 'These root vegetables, tossed with fettuccine and some niçoise olives, complement the brambly, herbal notes of this crop of Languedoc wines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Brambly, herbal notes were consistent in this crop of Languedoc wines, from the delightfully rustic to more polished examples. I kept wanting food showered with rosemary alongside. It could easily be carried by lamb or seared tuna, but could it work with just vegetables?', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/dining/28PAIR_SPAN/28PAIR_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/28/dining/28PAIR_SPAN/28PAIR_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/dining/28PAIR_SPAN/28PAIR_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/dining/28PAIR_SPAN/28PAIR_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/dining/28PAIR_SPAN/28PAIR_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/28/dining/28PAI