ed tickets for seats in a luxury suite in 2009 from a contractor trying to win business from the official’s agency.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A former high official of the city’s Human Resources Administration was fined $3,000 for accepting luxury-suite tickets to a Yankees-Red Sox game from a vendor trying to win the agency’s business, the City Conflicts of Interest Board announced on Monday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/nyregion/26posada-cityroom/26posada-cityroom-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 717, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/nyregion/26posada-cityroom/26posada-cityroom-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1434, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/nyregion/26posada-cityroom/26posada-cityroom-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/26/nyregion/26posada-cityroom/26posada-cityroom-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/nyregion/26posada-cityroom/26posada-cityroom-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Free Perk-Filled Yankee Seats Cost Ex-City Official $3,000 Fine', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Conflicts of Interest Board (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-26T22:18:38+0000',