anction-intrade-closes-to-u-s-investors/', 'snippet': 'Facing accusations that it allowed American investors to bet on the outcome of wars and other world events without the blessing of regulators, Intrade announced on Monday that it was closing its Web site to United States residents.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Facing accusations that it allowed American investors to bet on the outcome of wars and other world events without the blessing of regulators, Intrade announced on Monday that it was closing its Web site to United States residents.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Intrade Bars U.S. Bettors After Regulatory Action', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Intrade Bars U.S. Bettors After Regulatory Action', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Derivatives (Financial Instruments)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Futures and Options Trading', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Securities and Commodities Violations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Commodity Futures Trading Commission', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Intrade', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-26T22:28:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Protess', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Protess', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/790d1e3e-3b36-56c2-a258-86d9ebf7e0b1', 'word_count': 563, 'uri': 'nyt://article/790d1e3e-3b36-56c2-a258-86d9ebf7e0b1'}, {'abstract': 'After Bellevue Hospital was evacuated during Hurricane Sandy, many doctors and staff members underwent the feelings of loss and confusion that are not dissimilar to the experience of being ill.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/26/a-return-to-bellevue-after-the-storm/', 'snippet': 'After Bellevue Hospital was evacuated during Hurricane Sandy, many doctors and staff members underwent the feelings of loss and confusion that are not dissimilar to the experience of being ill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s no place like home. That’s not a phrase people typically utter about their hospitals, but those were the words on everyone’s lips when we returned to Bellevue last week, after nearly a month of dislocation since the hurricane-induced evacuation at the end of October.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/science/27bellevue/27bellevue-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/science/27bellevue/27bellevue-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/science/27bellevue/27bellevue-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/27/science/27bellevue/27bellevue-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/science/27bellevue/27bellevue-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Return to Bellevue After the Storm', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Return To Bellevue After Flood', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Archives and Records', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bellevue Hospital', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-26T22:28:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Danielle Ofri, M.D', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Danielle', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ofri', 'qualifier': 'M.D', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0da432fe-cacd-5025-8499-9b32c4b2a98a', 'word_count': 1192, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0da432fe-cacd-5025-8499-9b32c4b2a98a'}, {'abstract': 'Lincoln Center, in announcing the position, stressed Ms. McDonald’s ties to the arts complex.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/26/audra-mcdonald-to-host-live-from-lincoln-center/', 'snippet': 'Lincoln Center, in announcing the position, stressed Ms. McDonald’s ties to the arts complex.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not since Beverly Sills, who died in 2007, has “Live From Lincoln Center” — one of the few regular sources of classical music on mainstream television — had a regular host. Now another soprano is following in her footsteps. Lincoln Center said that the singer and actress Audra McDonald would become the show’s official host, presiding over at least seven broadcasts starting next month. The shows include “The Richard Tucker Opera Gala” on Dec. 13 and the New York Philharmonic’s New Year’s Eve gala celebrating Marvin Hamlisch.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012