t his no-new-taxes pledge can be like listening to a die-hard “Lord of the Rings” fan explain the back story to how the age of elves is ending and the age of men is beginning.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/26/the-lord-of-the-taxes/', 'snippet': 'Listening to Grover Norquist talk about his no-new-taxes pledge can be like listening to a die-hard “Lord of the Rings” fan explain the back story to how the age of elves is ending and the age of men is beginning.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Listening to the conservative activist Grover Norquist talk about the no-new-taxes pledge that he has made his life’s work can be like listening to a die-hard “Lord of the Rings” fan explain the back story to how the age of elves is ending and the age of men is beginning. It’s all about arcane rites and rules that are impossible to follow, and it’s treated like religion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Lord of the Taxes', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'King, Peter T', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Norquist, Grover G', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-26T23:21:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8616ddc3-1f5e-5abf-ad7c-7e7a05bc6778', 'word_count': 376, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8616ddc3-1f5e-5abf-ad7c-7e7a05bc6778'}, {'abstract': 'Zaro’s, which challenged the violations cited during an inspection, faces proposed fines of $118,000 for work conditions at its factory in the B