mes.com/2012/11/27/sports/basketball/jason-kidd-sits-out-of-game-against-nets-with-back-spasms.html', 'snippet': 'The Knicks’ Jason Kidd was sidelined Monday against the Nets because of back spasms. His is the first casualty among the veteran starters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the Knicks cobbled together their roster this summer, they emphasized experience. As they did, there were inherent risks. Now they were the oldest team in the N.B.A., and if a key veteran or two were injured, issues involving chemistry and depth would arise. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kidd Sits, Highlighting Injury Risk of Veterans', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kidd Sits, Highlighting Injury Risk Of Veterans', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kidd, Jason', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Nets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T00:57:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jake Appleman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jake', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Appleman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/149bb03b-84ee-59e2-a0ac-dd7259261174', 'word_count': 527, 'uri': 'nyt://article/149bb03b-84ee-59e2-a0ac-dd7259261174'}, {'abstract': 'A career at Goldman made Mark J. Carney, the governor of Canada’s central bank, an atypical figure in his national public service, and his departure for bigger challenges was not unexpected.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/27/business/global/mark-j-carney-seeks-greater-challenges-at-bank-of-england.html', 'snippet': 'A career at Goldman made Mark J. Carney, the governor of Canada’s central bank, an atypical figure in his national public service, and his departure for bigger challenges was not unexpected.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OTTAWA — Mark J. Carney loves a challenge.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Bank of England Chief Was an Unusual Choice for Canada as Well', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Bank of England Chief Was an Unusual Choice for Canada as Well', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bank of England', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canada', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carney, Mark J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T01:00:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Global Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ian Austen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Austen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c212def-363a-5a6e-968e-47376e226673', 'word_count': 838, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c212def-363a-5a6e-968e-47376e226673'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Squires was a member of a team of “Sesame Street” directors that won six Daytime Emmys for outstanding directing of a children’s series between 1995 and 2007.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/27/arts/television/emily-squires-sesame-street-director-and-producer-dies-at-71.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Squires was a member of a team of “Sesame Street” directors that won six Daytime Emmys for outstanding directing of a children’s series between 1995 and 2007.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Emily Squires, who brought a flair to musical numbers as an Emmy Award-winning director and producer of “Sesame Street,” died on Wednesday in Manhattan. She was 71.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/arts/SQUIRES-obit/SQUIRES-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/27/arts/SQUIRES-obit/SQUIRES-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/arts/SQUIRES-obit/SQUIRES-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/arts/SQUIRES-obit/SQUIRES-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1157, 'width': 1736, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/arts/SQUIRES-obit/SQUIRES-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/27/arts/SQUIRES-obit/SQUIRES-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/arts/SQUIRES-obit/SQUIRES-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Emily Squires, Emmy-Winning Director of ‘Sesame Street,’ Dies at 71', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Emily Squires, 71, ‘S