 the way for further challenges to aspects of the health care law and rejected an appeal concerning the insanity defense.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/27/us/supreme-court-hears-job-discrimination-case.html', 'snippet': 'The Supreme Court also cleared the way for further challenges to aspects of the health care law and rejected an appeal concerning the insanity defense.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Supreme Court heard arguments on Monday about who counts as a supervisor under a federal employment discrimination law. The court also issued orders clearing the way for further challenges to aspects of President Obama’s health care law and rejecting an appeal concerning the insanity defense.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Justices Consider Definition of Supervisor in Job Discrimination Case', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Justices Consider Qualifications Needed to Be a Supervisor in a Discrimination Suit', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Idaho', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ball State University', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Liberty University', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T02:20:00+0000', 'document_typ