ncial markets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In appointing Elisse Walter, a Democratic commissioner at the Securities and Exchange Commission, to serve as the agency’s next chairwoman, President Obama appears to be aiming for continuity when Mary Schapiro, the current chairwoman, steps down next month. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Leadership at the S.E.C.', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Leadership at the S.E.C.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Walter, Elisse B', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schapiro, Mary L', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dodd-Frank Wall Street Reform and Consumer Protection Act (2010)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T03:04:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/17a2abf1-8fd7-5027-9beb-9de60464ba3f', 'word_count': 425, 'uri': 'nyt://article/17a2abf1-8fd7-5027-9beb-9de60464ba3f'}, {'abstract': 'The Fisher Brothers real estate firm has contributed to a lobbying group set up at Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s urging, and to his political campaigns.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/27/nyregion/group-backing-cuomo-aided-by-firm-he-investigated.html', 'snippet': 'The Fisher Brothers real estate firm has contributed to a lobbying group set up at Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s urging, and to his political campaigns.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY — A Manhattan real estate and investment firm that was part of an inquiry led by Andrew M. Cuomo when he was attorney general is now one of the largest contributors to a lobbying group that seeks to promote Mr. Cuomo’s agenda as governor.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lobbying Group That Backs Cuomo Gets Big Donations From Firm He Investigated', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lobbying Group That Backs Cuomo Gets Big Donations From Firm He Investigated', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fisher Brothers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Committee to Save New York', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'White, Bill', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lobbying and Lobbyists', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T03:09:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Danny Hakim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Danny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hakim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e0ebde61-85cf-5fc5-a12a-45a52d1aaac4', 'word_count': 901, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e0ebde61-85cf-5fc5-a12a-45a52d1aaac4'}, {'abstract': 'Prosecutors accused Nechemya Weberman of molesting a girl who had been sent to him for counseling in their ultra-Orthodox Jewish community.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/27/nyregion/sexual-abuse-trial-of-nechemya-weberman-of-brooklyn-begins.html', 'snippet': 'Prosecutors accused Nechemya Weberman of molesting a girl who had been sent to him for counseling in their ultra-Orthodox Jewish community.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The abuse began when the girl was 12 years old, prosecutors in State Supreme Court in Brooklyn said on Monday. She was sent to a prominent man in her ultra-Orthodox Jewish community for counseling, and prosecutors said the man sexually molested her over the next three years.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/nyregion/SUB-WEBERMAN/SUB-WEBERMAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/nyregion/SUB-WEBERMAN/SUB-WEBERMAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/nyregion/SUB-WEBERMAN/SUB-WEBERMAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/27/nyregion/SUB-WEBERMAN/SUB-WEBERMAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/nyregion/SUB-WEBERMAN/SUB-WEBERMAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sexual Abuse Trial of Brooklyn Man Begins', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sex Abuse Trial of Brooklyn Man Begins', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glo