rmelo-anthony-returns-to-brooklyn.html', 'snippet': 'Carmelo Anthony tried his best to start a new rivalry with a Knicks win at Barclays Center, a few miles from his childhood home, but he missed the potential game-winning shot.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Brooklyn has been on Carmelo Anthony’s mind for a month. And why not? It was where he was born and where he first played the game, a tall, skinny kid dribbling around on the Red Hook blacktops, before he moved to Baltimore when he was 8 and developed into one of the best players in the N.B.A.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/sports/KNICKS1/KNICKS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 540, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/sports/KNICKS1/KNICKS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1080, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/sports/KNICKS1/KNICKS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/27/sports/KNICKS1/KNICKS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/sports/KNICKS1/KNICKS1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Excited for Return to Brooklyn, Anthony Gets the Ending Wrong', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Excited for His Return To Brooklyn, Anthony Gets Ending Wrong', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'