'word_count': 1278, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6797e771-32ea-503c-9ef0-1554c0a03db1'}, {'abstract': 'The resumption of classes at P.S./M.S. 114 in Belle Harbor leaves about 5,400 New York City public school students in temporary locations after Hurricane Sandy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/27/nyregion/queens-school-shut-since-storm-is-reopening.html', 'snippet': 'The resumption of classes at P.S./M.S. 114 in Belle Harbor leaves about 5,400 New York City public school students in temporary locations after Hurricane Sandy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New York City Education Department said on Monday that Public School/Middle School 114 in Belle Harbor, Queens, would reopen on Tuesday, three days earlier than planned, after it was flooded during Hurricane Sandy. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Queens School Shut Since Hurricane Is Reopening', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Queens School Shut Since Hurricane Is Reopening', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Education Department (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'BELLE HARBOR (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T03:54:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b55cc404-997f-5157-94e5-411fb97cc5b7', 'word_count': 210, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b55cc404-997f-5157-94e5-411fb97cc5b7'}, {'abstract': 'War veterans who have lost their upper limbs have found that replicating their complex actions with robotic arms can be excruciatingly difficult.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/27/us/prosthetic-arms-a-complex-test-for-amputees.html', 'snippet': 'War veterans who have lost their upper limbs have found that replicating their complex actions with robotic arms can be excruciatingly difficult.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN ANTONIO — After the explosion, Cpl. Sebastian Gallegos awoke to see the October sun glinting through the water, an image so lovely he thought he was dreaming. Then something caught his eye, yanking him back to grim awareness: an arm, bobbing near the surface, a black hair tie wrapped around its wrist.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Learning to Accept, and Master, a $110,000 Mechanical Arm', 'kicker': ' The Hard Road Back', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Learning to Accept, and Master, a $110,000 Mechanical Arm', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Series', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prostheses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Arms (Body Part)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooke Army Medical Center', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AMPUTATION', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T04:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Dao', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dao', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6ed6c918-84f6-5456-882c-1211d51206c8', 'word_count': 2036, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6ed6c918-84f6-5456-882c-1211d51206c8'}, {'abstract': 'In order to regain custody of two of his children, Miguel Adams had to serve a prison term and kick an intravenous drug habit, which had left him H.I.V. positive.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/27/nyregion/battling-addiction-and-hiv-to-get-his-children-back.html', 'snippet': 'In order to regain custody of two of his children, Miguel Adams had to serve a prison term and kick an intravenous drug habit, which had left him H.I.V. positive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Miguel Adams christened his newborn son, he saw an opportunity to choose a name that reflected how far he had come in his life and the faith that helped him get there. The name he chose was Miguel Emanuel Adams.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/nyregion/27NEEDIEST/27NEEDIEST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/27/nyregion/27NEEDIEST/27NEEDIEST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/nyregion/27NEEDIEST/27NEEDIEST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/nyregion/27NEEDIEST/27NEEDIEST-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/nyregion/27NEEDIEST/27NEEDIEST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/27/nyregion/27NEEDIEST/27NEEDIEST-thumbStandard