d Ron Paul. He is the author of “The Benefit and the Burden: Tax Reform – Why We Need It and What It Will Take.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tax Cuts, Tax Rates and Tax Shares', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Tax', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Internal Revenue Service', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T11:00:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Bartlett', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bartlett', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/08d2174d-9052-5aac-9384-25b0398a6e82', 'word_count': 820, 'uri': 'nyt://article/08d2174d-9052-5aac-9384-25b0398a6e82'}, {'abstract': 'His fund has been one of the most aggressive investors in India’s growing affordable health care industry.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/27/what-is-ebays-omidyar-doing-on-delhis-medtech-row/', 'snippet': 'His fund has been one of the most aggressive investors in India’s growing affordable health care industry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pierre Omidyar is best known as the founder of the online auction company e-Bay, which he grew from an “odd little Web site” to one of Web commerce’s biggest and longest-lasting success stories.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Is eBay’s Omidyar Doing on Delhi’s MedTech Row?', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': Non