umbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/nyregion/26chisholm-slideshow-city-slide-P42G/26chisholm-slideshow-city-slide-P42G-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/nyregion/26chisholm-slideshow-city-slide-P42G/26chisholm-slideshow-city-slide-P42G-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1346, 'width': 1346, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/nyregion/26chisholm-slideshow-city-slide-P42G/26chisholm-slideshow-city-slide-P42G-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/26/nyregion/26chisholm-slideshow-city-slide-P42G/26chisholm-slideshow-city-slide-P42G-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/26/nyregion/26chisholm-slideshow-city-slide-P42G/26chisholm-slideshow-city-slide-P42G-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How Are You Celebrating Shirley Chisholm Day?', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chisholm, Shirley', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T15:04:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andy Newman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Newman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5d4e2b52-2b24-5e30-9193-472c7b5fe46c', 'word_count': 40, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5d4e2b52-2b24-5e30-9193-472c7b5fe46c'}, {'abstract': 'The Nets and Knicks are tied for the lead in the Atlantic Division, and that infused Monday’s game with new meaning.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/28/sports/a-rivalry-grows-in-brooklyn-leading-off.html', 'snippet': 'The Nets and Knicks are tied for the lead in the Atlantic Division, and that infused Monday’s game with new meaning.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you were intent on sports as your viewing entertainment on Monday night, you might have been in a bit of a bind. Sure, dyed-in-the-wool New York types — at least those who consider the N.B.A. entertaining — were all set. They had the first Knicks-Nets game in Brooklyn to kick off the new interborough rivalry everyone but the Knicks’ ownership is all jazzed about. But if you cannot stand New York and all of its center-of-the-universeness, you were stuck with a Monday night football game not even Andy Reid’s mother could love. Philadelphia versus Carolina probably seemed like a good idea for a prime time game at some juncture, but that juncture was in 2003.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/28leading-pic/28leading-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/28leading-pic/28leading-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 375}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/28leading-pic/28leading-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 721, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/28lea