n on a large protest in western China.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — At least five Tibetans have set fire to themselves in recent days to protest Chinese rule in Tibetan regions, while at least five Tibetan students were in critical condition and 15 others were being treated for injuries after security forces cracked down on a large protest in western China on Monday, according to reports by Radio Free Asia and Free Tibet, an advocacy group.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tibetan Protesters Injured in Crackdown; Self-Immolations Continue', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Protesters Hurt In Crackdown On Tibetans', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Qinghai Province (China)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immolation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tibet', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Language and Languages', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T17:08:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Wong', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wong', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8fae3b76-a6f8-508c-8aa8-e8c8f39ccfab', 'word_count': 537, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8fae3b76-a6f8-508c-8aa8-e8c8f39ccfab'}, {'abstract': 'When Brooklyn fans can be heard at a Knicks-Nets game at Madison Square Garden, then we will know their team has arrived citywide.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/28/sports/basketball/the-nets-in-brooklyn-more-than-a-murmur-but-not-yet-a-roar.html', 'snippet': 'When Brooklyn fans can be heard at a Knicks-Nets game at Madison Square Garden, then we will know their team has arrived citywide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It wasn’t until the Knicks’ portion of the crowd was silenced into final submission that it truly felt like a home-court advantage for the Nets. Deron Williams was at the line to shoot free throws with 30.1 seconds to play in overtime Monday night, hearing the “M.V.P.” chant that had earlier been reserved for Carmelo Anthony. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/ARATON/ARATON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/ARATON/ARATON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/ARATON/ARATON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 384, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/ARATON/ARATON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/ARATON/ARATON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/ARATON/ARATON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/ARATON/ARATON-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'More Than a Murmur, Not Yet a Roar', 'kicker': 'On Pro Basketball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'More Than a Murmur, Not Yet a Roar', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Madison Square Garden', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Nets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Barclays Center (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T17:20:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Harvey Araton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Harvey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Araton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ca03c09-f179-58aa-a4ae-cecd6d4e3e47', 'word_count': 971, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ca03c09-f179-58aa-a4ae-cecd6d4e3e47'}, {'abstract': 'Try Brendan James, who hooks  you in a similar way with catchy melodies and keeps you hanging on for the storytelling lyrics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/27/booming/if-you-like-billy-joel-try-brendan-james.html', 'snippet': 'Try Brendan James, who hooks  you in a similar way with catchy melodies and keeps you hanging on for the storytelling lyrics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Each week, Val Haller, the founder of the music Web site Valslist.com, matches music from her baby boom generation to music of her 20-something sons’ generation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/1