: {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/8f2e8146-00f0-5f35-8922-d7020248684d', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/8f2e8146-00f0-5f35-8922-d7020248684d'}, {'abstract': 'The action by Ericsson, which makes networking equipment, against Samsung, which makes mobile phones, is intended to encourage Samsung to come to terms on a patent agreement.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/28/technology/28iht-ericsson28.html', 'snippet': 'The action by Ericsson, which makes networking equipment, against Samsung, which makes mobile phones, is intended to encourage Samsung to come to terms on a patent agreement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Ericsson, the market leader in mobile phone networking equipment, filed a lawsuit Tuesday against Samsung, the biggest smartphone maker, claiming that it had infringed on 24 of Ericsson’s software and hardware patents.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'As Licensing Talks Stall, Ericsson Files Patent Suit vs. Samsung', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As Licensing Talks Stall, Ericsson Files Patent Suit vs. Samsung', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Telefonaktiebolaget L M Ericsson', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Copyrights and Copyright Violations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Inventions and Patents', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Samsung Group', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T18:29:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': "By Kevin J. O'Brien", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kevin', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': "O'Brien", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2afcaaf7-ebdb-5822-96ad-e094b6749d79', 'word_count': 717, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2afcaaf7-ebdb-5822-96ad-e094b6749d79'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Cenac’s last show will be on Dec. 13.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/27/wyatt-cenac-leaving-the-daily-show/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Cenac’s last show will be on Dec. 13.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The Daily Show with Jon Stewart” is losing one of its correspondents, Wyatt Cenac. Comedy Central said that Mr. Cenac had decided to leave at the end of the year, which for the show comes on Dec. 13, when it tapes a final edition before a holiday break. “Jon and the staff wish him the best in his future endeavors,” a spokesman for the channel said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wyatt Cenac Leaving ‘The Daily Show’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stewart, Jon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Comedy Central', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T18:31:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6d2f61c6-596f-5d67-be1f-ad4838956fca', 'word_count': 159, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6d2f61c6-596f-5d67-be1f-ad4838956fca'}, {'abstract': 'The complexities of her work have captivated the author since Ms. Neshat first attained international recognition.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/27/shirin-neshat-an-artist-iranian-muslim-and-female-engages/', 'snippet': 'The complexities of her work have captivated the author since Ms. Neshat first attained international recognition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I first interviewed Shirin Neshat two years ago, in the dimly lighted backroom of an upscale New York restaurant, on the release of the Iranian artist’s directorial debut, “Women Without Men.” The movie about the 1953 coup d’état in Iran earned her the Silver Lion as best director at the 66th Venice Film Festival.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Shirin Neshat: An Artist — Iranian, Muslim and Female — Engages', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Neshat, Shirin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T18:32:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Aysegul Sert', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Aysegul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sert', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb009fa3-2a69-507c-88e6-ef416a161f67', 'word_count': 273, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb009fa3-2a69-507c-88e6-ef416a161f67'}, {'abstract': 'The champions of the moment are beets, turnips and radishes. Their versatility, as well as their ability to withstand cold, has given these vegetables an underrated reputation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/28/dining/vegetables-that-cold-proof-any-salad.html', 'snippet': 'The champions of the moment are beets, turnips and radishes. Their versatility, as well as their ability to withstand cold, has given these vegetables an underrated reputation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WITH all due respect to tomatoes, potatoes, eggplants and all the other vegetables we’ve enjoyed for the last few months, the champions of the moment are beets, turnips and radishes. For gardeners and farmers in all but the coldest climates, they’re still going strong, which means that for careful shoppers, the highest-quality stuff is still easy to find.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/dining/28BITTMAN_SPAN/28BITTMAN_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 294, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/28/dining/28BITTMAN_SPAN/28BITTMAN_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 294}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/dining/28BITTMAN_SPAN/28BITTMAN_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 501, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/dining/28BITTMAN_SPAN/28BITTMAN_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1002, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/dining/28BITTMAN_SPAN/28BITTMAN_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/28/dining/28BITTMAN_SPAN/28BITTMAN_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/dining/28BITTMAN_SPAN/28BITTMAN_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cold-Proof Your Salad', 'kicker': 'How to Cook Everything', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_head