setters and homebodies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'They are the fashion equivalent of mashed peas and carrots, a retreat into toddlerhood for the style-sated. Adult-size onesies, some with floppy feet and outsize industrial zippers, have lately winged their way here from Europe, where they are the comfort gear of club kids, mall rats, jet-setters and homebodies nursing the aftereffects of a surfeit of holiday cheer. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Onesies for Grown-Ups', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Even Club Kids Need Comfort', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T19:26:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ruth La Ferla', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ruth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'La Ferla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2fd66d8f-326d-5b53-8ee8-999175022049', 'word_count': 286, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2fd66d8f-326d-5b53-8ee8-999175022049'}, {'abstract': 'The New York production of the show will close in December.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/27/silence-the-musical-to-close/', 'snippet': 'The New York production of the show will close in December.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Off Broadway show “Silence! The Musical,” an unauthorized parody of the Oscar-winning movie “The Silence of the Lambs,” will close on Dec. 30. Over an 18-month run, the show gained a cult following yet could not manage to earn back its $750,000 capitalization budget. The producers announced on Tuesday that the show – which turns on the relationship and battle of wits between the F.B.I. agent Clarice Starling and the malevolently brilliant cannibal Hannibal Lecter (Jodie Foster and Anthony Hopkins in the movie) – would wrap up at the Elektra Theater in Times Square after playing 447 regular performances and eight preview performances.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/arts/27artsbeat-silence/27artsbeat-silence-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/arts/27artsbeat-silence/27artsbeat-silence-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/arts/27artsbeat-silence/27artsbeat-silence-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/27/arts/27artsbeat-silence/27artsbeat-silence-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/arts/27artsbeat-silence/27artsbeat-silence-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Silence! The Musical’ to Close', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Silence! The Musical’ To Close on Dec. 30', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T19:32:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '