'snippet': 'Joel Ewanick takes the position of interim chief of global sales and marketing at Fisker Automotive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fisker Automotive has hired Joel Ewanick, the former head of marketing at General Motors, as its interim chief of global sales and marketing, the company said on Monday. Fisker informed its retailers on Monday that Richard Beattie, who had been the company’s chief commercial officer, was retiring.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fisker Hires G.M.’s Former Head of Marketing', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric and Hybrid Vehicles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hiring and Promotion', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ewanick, Joel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fisker, Henrik', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Posawatz, Tony', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fisker Automotive', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'General Motors', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-27T23:36:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bradley Berman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bradley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c59db4f9-19a7-5d77-93a9-f3b3cec18bad', 'word_count': 566, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c59db4f9-19a7-5d77-93a9-f3b3cec18bad'}, {'abstract': 'The fashion designer Chris Benz reaches out to more fans with a lower-priced line.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/29/fashion/the-designer-chris-benz-reaches-out-to-more-fans-up-close.html', 'snippet': 'The fashion designer Chris Benz reaches out to more fans with a lower-priced line.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHRIS BENZ, the peppy fashion designer, strode into his West 37th Street studio the other Friday, nursing a large iced black Starbucks coffee. The workplace was cluttered with inspiration boards, magazine clippings and kitschy finds, including a canary yellow rotary phone.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/fashion/29UPCLOSE_SPAN/29ZUPCLOSE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/29/fashion/29UPCLOSE_SPAN/29ZUPCLOSE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/fashion/29UPCLOSE_SPAN/29ZUPCLOSE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/fashion/29UPCLOSE_SPAN/29ZUPCLOSE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/fashion/29UPCLOSE_SPAN/29ZUPCLOSE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/29/fashion/29UPCLOSE_SPAN/29ZUPCLOSE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/fashion/29UPCLOSE_SPAN/2