 None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aa0150d1-8d55-5350-b796-d0e272a21e42', 'word_count': 1358, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa0150d1-8d55-5350-b796-d0e272a21e42'}, {'abstract': 'The 2012 Hall of Fame ballot includes a collection of some of the most prominent performers in recent baseball history. A decade ago, all would have been locks for Cooperstown. Not now.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/28/sports/baseball/steroid-era-players-pose-difficulty-for-hall-of-fame-voters.html', 'snippet': 'The 2012 Hall of Fame ballot includes a collection of some of the most prominent performers in recent baseball history. A decade ago, all would have been locks for Cooperstown. Not now.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Houston Astros held a news conference Monday to celebrate the inclusion of Craig Biggio on the new Hall of Fame ballot. There were no such gatherings in San Francisco for Barry Bonds, or in Boston for Roger Clemens, or in New York for Mike Piazza, or in Chicago for Sammy Sosa.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/YKEPNER1/YKEPNER1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 345, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/YKEPNER1/YKEPNER1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 345}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/YKEPNER1/YKEPNER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 965, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/YKEPNER1/YKEPNER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1756, 'width': 1863, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hall of Fame Voters Conf