s as part of India’s campaign for independence) and swaraj (self-rule), and he was convinced that khadi was the only way to develop India’s rural sector.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Conversation With: Devendrakumar R. Desai, Gandhian, Champion of Khadi', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping Centers and Malls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sustainable Living', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Textiles', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gandhi, Mohandas K', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-28T07:49:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Haresh Pandya', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Haresh', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pandya', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4411376f-cb6d-5937-8424-d3854bd9a5c8', 'word_count': 1165, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4411376f-cb6d-5937-8424-d3854bd9a5c8'}, {'abstract': 'Can you calculate how much more student loan debt is collectively owed by borrowers above age 60 now, compared with seven years ago?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/28/test-yourself-math-nov-28-2012/', 'snippet': 'Can you calculate how much more student loan debt is collectively owed by borrowers above age 60 now, compared with seven years ago?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Test your math skills with this question created by Scott Matthews at Math for America from the article “Child’s Education, but Parents’ Crushing Loans.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Test You