er 2.0: no longer rational, and afraid.', 'web_url': 'https://thechoice.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/28/envelope-please-will-walker-4/', 'snippet': 'Once Will Walker, a student at University School in Hunting Valley, Ohio, hit the “submit” button on his three early applications, a new person has emerged. Meet Will Walker 2.0: no longer rational, and afraid.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two weeks ago, when I sat down to write the first draft of this post, I genuinely felt as if my world was unraveling.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-will/envpls13-will-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 670, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-will/envpls13-will-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 670, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-will/envpls13-will-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-will/envpls13-will-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-will/envpls13-will-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For the Stressed-Out College Applicants, a Silver Lining', 'kicker': 'The Choice', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-28T10:58:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_d