ething I never intended, and she confided that she was clinging to my words. I volunteered to meet her and give her a copy of the thousands of additional messages of support I had received.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Resilience of Sergeant Bales’ Wife', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bales, Karilyn', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bales, Robert', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Joint Base Lewis-McChord (Wash)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-28T15:42:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lori Volkman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lori', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Volkman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7bb2c0cf-19b7-5ad6-9967-23c9c75ca5dc', 'word_count': 1311, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7bb2c0cf-19b7-5ad6-9967-23c9c75ca5dc'}, {'abstract': 'Golf’s governing bodies on Wednesday proposed a rule that would make it illegal for golfers to anchor the club while making a stroke, beginning in 2016.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/29/sports/golf/golf-moves-to-ban-anchored-putting.html', 'snippet': 'Golf’s governing bodies on Wednesday proposed a 