pet': 'While Rihanna took the top spot on the Billboard album chart, Adele’s “21” passed the 10-million mark in sales.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rihanna’s “Unapologetic” (Def Jam) was the best-selling album in the United States last week, moving more than 238,000 copies and giving Rihanna her first No. 1 album on the Billboard album chart. That was a significant milestone for the Barbadian singer, who has had a dozen No. 1 singles but whose previous six CDs never made it to the top of the chart, Billboard reported.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rihanna Tops Chart as Adele Passes  Another Milestone', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rihanna’s Album Is No. 1', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adele (Singer)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Aldean, Jason', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cole, Keyshia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kid Rock', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rihanna', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stewart, Rod', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Swift, Taylor', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nielsen SoundScan', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-28T18:22:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2691852e-34dd-5d50-b884-38e531e5b094', 'word_count': 325, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2691852e-34dd-5d50-b884-38e531e5b094'}, {'abstract': 'The steroids era may hurt some former stars, increasing the chances of Jack Morris and Lee Smith to be elected to the Baseball Hall of Fame.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/28/jack-morriss-moment-to-enter-hall-of-fame-is-here/', 'snippet': 'The steroids era may hurt some former stars, increasing the chances of Jack Morris and Lee Smith to be elected to the Baseball Hall of Fame.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jack Morris is about to benefit, inadvertently, from the shameful stain of baseball’s steroids era. Maybe, just maybe, Lee Smith will too.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/baseball/28morris/28morris-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 997, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/baseball/28morris/28morris-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1993, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/baseball/28morris/28morris-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/baseball/28morris/28morris-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/sports/baseball/28morris/28morris-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jack Morris’s Moment to Enter Hall of Fame Is Here', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Steroids', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clemens, Roger', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morris, Jack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Lee', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baseball Hall of Fame', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Detroit Tigers', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Minnesota Twins', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-28T18:22:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stuart Miller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stuart', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Miller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f6d93f52-a8d1-5616-8f94-1b03bc4ed8e3', 'word_count': 1174, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f6d93f52-a8d1-5616-8f94-1b03bc4ed8e3'}, {'abstract': 'What is the so-called ‘fiscal cliff’?', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/28/explaining-the-fiscal-cliff/', 'snippet': 'What is the so-called ‘fiscal cliff’?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The term refers to more than $500 billion in tax increases and across-the-board spending cuts scheduled to take effect after Jan. 1 — for fiscal year 2013 alone — unless Mr. Obama and Republicans reach an alternative deficit-reduction deal. Ben Bernanke, the chairman of the Federal Reserve, who is not known for catchy phrases, coined the metaphor “fiscal cliff” last winter to warn of the dangerous yet avoidable drop-off ahead in the nation’s fiscal path. It stuck.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Explaining the ‘Fiscal Cliff’', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-28T18:23:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jackie Calmes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jackie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Calmes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/119a6ddf-cbbc-52c3-8dbf-41ce1937e32d', 'word_count': 87, 'uri': 'nyt://article/119a6ddf-cbbc-52c3-8dbf-41ce1937e32d'}, {'abstract': 'Readers recently submitted questions to Dr. Susan Kellogg about sexual health, desire and dryness, among other topics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/28/booming/answers-about-female-sexuality-part-1.html', 'snippet': 'Readers recently submitted questions to Dr. Susan Kellogg about sexual health, desire and dryness, among other topics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Readers recently submitted questions about female sexuality to Dr. Susan Kellogg, a professor of obstetrics and gynecology at the Drexel University College of Medicine in Philadelphia; a professor of human sexuality at Widener University in Chester, Pa.; and a clinical associate faculty member at the University of Pennsylvania and Thomas Jefferson University. Dr. Kellogg is also the co-founder of the Pelvic and Sexual Health Institute of Philadelphia, where she is the director of vulvar and sexual medicine, and a member of the editorial board of The Journal of Sexual Medicine.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/21/booming/21expertplea-booming-sex/21expertplea-booming-sex-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 731, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 