.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/28/sfmoma-gets-major-gifts-of-photography/', 'snippet': 'On Wednesday the San Francisco Museum of Modern Art announced promised gifts of 473 photographs from three separate collectors, including a pledge of 26 photographs by Diane Arbus and nearly 350 works by Japanese photographers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Wednesday the San Francisco Museum of Modern Art announced promised gifts of 473 photographs from three separate collectors, including 26 photographs by Diane Arbus from the San Francisco dealer Jeffrey Fraenkel, which will double the museum’s holdings of her images. The museum got a lot of attention in 2003 when it organized an especially personal traveling exhibition about Arbus’s life and work.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'San Francisco Museum Gets Major Gifts of Photography', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adams, Robert', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ARBUS, DIANE', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Frank, Robert', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Friedlander, Lee', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Goldin, Nan', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gursky, Andreas', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Penn, Irving', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Francisco Museum of Modern Art', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Japan', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Francisco (Calif)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-28T20:00:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', '