core?', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/28/parenthood-and-the-new-york-times-notable-books-list/', 'snippet': 'I read a lot less since I became a parent, but does that excuse my sorry New York Times Notable Books score?', 'lead_paragraph': 'I possess three of the books on the list, in hard copy, with intent to read.1 Another I read excerpted in so many places that I didn’t feel as if I needed to read the actual book.2 One is on my Kindle app, but honesty requires that I admit that I am never, ever going to finish it.3 I’m partway through two more and uncertain if and when I will go on (which probably means I won’t).4 There are seven more on my to-read list.5 Another I bought, tried, then set aside after a few chapters.6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/style/motherlode-notable-books/motherlode-notable-books-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/style/motherlode-notable-books/motherlode-notable-books-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/style/motherlode-notable-books/motherlode-notable-books-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/28/style/motherlode-notable-books/motherlode-notable-books-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/28/style/motherlode-notable-books/motherlode-notable-books-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 