ub Le Baron has started a gay night called Les Garçons, with one simple rule: everyone has to dress up for the night.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/29/fashion/les-garcons-at-le-baron-a-chinatown-club.html', 'snippet': 'The exclusive Chinatown club Le Baron has started a gay night called Les Garçons, with one simple rule: everyone has to dress up for the night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ON a quiet Chinatown street, behind a nondescript door, lies the exclusive Le Baron, the local branch of André Saraiva’s French night-life empire. In an experiment, the club has started hosting a gay night on Wednesdays called Les Garçons, when the formerly impenetrable door follows one simple rule: “I want everyone to dress up,” said Michael Fragoso, 22, the bow-tied promoter and host. “It’s like your entrance fee.”', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/fashion/29BOITE/29BOITE-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/fashion/29BOITE/29BOITE-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1365, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/fashion/29BOITE/29BOITE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/29/fashion/29BOITE/29BOITE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/fashion/29BOITE/29BOITE-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Les Garçons at Le Baron', 'kicker': 'Boîte', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Les Garçons At Le Baron: Chinatown', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chinatown (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Le Baron (Manhattan, NY, Nightclub)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars and Nightclubs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-28T22:56:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Sloan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sloan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/1b624d51-782e-5135-bd1e-e7f247b85716', 'word_count': 374, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1b624d51-782e-5135-bd1e-e7f247b85716'}, {'abstract': 'The American Classical Orchestra, a period instrument ensemble, was joined by the organist Gregory D’Agostino at Alice Tully Hall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/29/arts/music/american-classical-orchestra-plays-bach-at-alice-tully-hall.html', 'snippet': 'The American Classical Orchestra, a period instrument ensemble, was joined by the organist Gregory D’Agostino at Alice Tully Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bach hardly needs a stacked deck to establish his supremacy. But that is pretty much what he got in an odd program presented by the period-instrument American Classical Orchestra at Alice Tully Hall on Tuesday evening.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'i