on, was not shy about letting his successors know he did not believe in testing the players for performance-enhancing drugs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/29/sports/baseball/marvin-millers-legacy-includes-opposition-to-drug-tests.html', 'snippet': 'Marvin Miller, the patriarch of the players union, was not shy about letting his successors know he did not believe in testing the players for performance-enhancing drugs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There was poignancy in the timing of Marvin Miller’s death, with the Major League Baseball Players Association holding its annual executive board meeting this week in Manhattan. Miller was the patriarch of the union, its first executive director and an extraordinary force who clearly deserves a place in the Hall of Fame. Few besides Babe Ruth and Jackie Robinson have had a greater impact on baseball.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/sports/Y-KEPNER/Y-KEPNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/sports/Y-KEPNER/Y-KEPNER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1438, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On Drug Testing, Miller Wound Up at Odds With the Union', 'kicker': 'On Baseball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'On Drug Testing, Miller Wound Up at Odds With the Union', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collective Bargaining', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doping (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weiner, Michael S', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Major League Baseball Players Assn'