l-roundup.html', 'snippet': 'The Yankees completed a $12 million deal with Andy Pettitte, who said he had not decided whether this coming season, his 18th in the majors, would be his final one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Yankees had no idea at this time last year that they would need the veteran left-hander Andy Pettitte to fill out their rotation, but at the end of the 2012 season, they knew they wanted him to be a part of their rotation in 2013. On Wednesday, the Yankees completed a one-year, $12 million deal with Pettitte, who was one of the team’s most effective starters last season.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/sports/BASE/BASE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 808, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/sports/BASE/BASE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1617, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pettitte Agrees to One-Year Contract With the Yankees', 'kicker': 'Roundup', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pettitte Agrees to One-Year Deal With Yankees', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pettitte, Andy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Free Agents (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Upton, B J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlanta Braves', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-29T01:55:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byli