ngs you can give and still keep are your word, a smile and a grateful heart. There are no traffic jams on the extra mile.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/business/Ziglar2/Ziglar2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 746, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/business/Ziglar2/Ziglar2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1492, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/business/Ziglar2/Ziglar2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/30/business/Ziglar2/Ziglar2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/business/Ziglar2/Ziglar2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Zig Ziglar, Motivational Speaker, Dies at 86', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Zig Ziglar, 86; Sold Energy and Optimism', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ziglar, Zig', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-29T04:08:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Yardley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yardley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/bc5ce24a-ac2e-58b9-aeb5-dec379da668d', 'word_count': 612, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bc5ce24a-ac2e-58b9-aeb5-dec379da668d'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the day for Thursday, Nov. 29, 2012.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/29/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-thursday-nov-29-2012.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the day for Thursday, Nov. 29, 2012.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The administration has figured out that if they don’t start doing something, the war will be over and they won’t have any influence over the combat forces on the ground. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Thursday, Nov. 29, 2012', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-29T04:11:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/ff807e76-009d-5375-a3ca-6522f676aa54', 'word_count': 46, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ff807e76-009d-5375-a3ca-6522f676aa54'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Barsalona, a New York talent agent who was a virtual quartermaster for the British Invasion, booked the first American concert tours of the Beatles and the Rolling Stones.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/29/arts/music/frank-barsalona-rock-n-roll-concert-promoter-dies.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Barsalona, a New York talent agent who was a virtual quartermaster for the British Invasion, booked the first American concert tours of the Beatles and the Rolling Stones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Frank Barsalona, a New York talent agent who was a virtual quartermaster for the British Invasion, booking the first American concert tours of the Beatles and the Rolling Stones, and who later created a concert circuit that served as a farm system for a generation of rockers including the Ramones, the Clash, the Pretenders and U2, died last Thursday at his home in Manhattan. He was 74.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/arts/BARSALONA-obit/BARSALONA-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/29/arts/BARSALONA-obit/BARSALONA-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/arts/BARSALONA-obit/BARSALONA-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/arts/BARSALONA-obit/BARSALONA-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/arts/BARSALONA-obit/BARSALONA-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/29/arts/BARSALONA-obit/BARSALONA-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/arts/BARSALONA-obit/BARSALONA-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Frank Barsalona, Pioneering Rock Agent, Dies at 74', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '