 minister called the situation “so embarrassing.”', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/29/indonesia-and-others-see-embarrassing-rise-in-h-i-v-infections/', 'snippet': 'Countries in southern Africa are seeing dramatic reductions in H.I.V. infection rates, a new U.N. report says, but six countries in Asia are worse off now than they were a decade ago. The flummoxed Indonesian health minister called the situation “...', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — A new United Nations report on H.I.V.-AIDS has some encouraging findings, notably dramatic reductions in new infections in southern Africa, although several countries in Asia now have infection rates 25 percent higher than they were a decade ago.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/blogs/indoAIDS-rdv/indoAIDS-rdv-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 738, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/blogs/indoAIDS-rdv/indoAIDS-rdv-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1476, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/blogs/indoAIDS-rdv/indoAIDS-rdv-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/29/blogs/indoAIDS-rdv/indoAIDS-rdv-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/blogs/indoAIDS-rdv/indoAIDS-rdv-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Indonesia and Others See ‘Embarrassing’ Rise in H.I.V. Infectio