ease,” are answering select reader questions about going to college.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As high school seniors await early admission decisions and finish their remaining college applications, The Choice has invited two of our former student bloggers of “The Envelope, Please” series to stop by our virtual Guidance Office and answer reader questions about the admissions process and what college life is like after you’ve made your choice. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/education/choice-student-qna/choice-student-qna-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 300, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/education/choice-student-qna/choice-student-qna-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 300, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/education/choice-student-qna/choice-student-qna-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/27/education/choice-student-qna/choice-student-qna-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/27/education/choice-student-qna/choice-student-qna-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ask College Students About Admissions and Campus Life', 'kicker': 'The Choice', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-11-29T10:59:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 