n she was in first grade.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Suzanne Collins, the author of the wildly successful “Hunger Games” trilogy, as well as the five-volume teen fantasy series “The Underland Chronicles,” has completed a a new book, “Year of the Jungle,” a 40-page children’s book, which will be published next September by Scholastic.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Children’s Book Coming From ‘Hunger Games’ Author', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Childrenu2019s Book From u2018Hunger Gamesu2019 Author', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Collins, Suzanne (1962- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-29T17:46:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c926d258-5a04-515d-9f92-081e377620e2', 'word_count': 297, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c926d258-5a04-515d-9f92-081e377620e2'}, {'abstract': 'Marion Cotillard discusses her decision not to do too much research for “Rust and Bone.”', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/29/video-marion-cotillard-on-not-preparing-for-a-role/', 'snippet': 'Marion Cotillard discusses her decision not to do too much research for “Rust and Bone.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Several potential contenders for awards have been making the rounds this week. On behalf of “Beasts of the Southern Wild,” a young Quvenzhané Wallis danced her way through lunches and parties, while Marion Cotillard, one of the stars of “Rust and Bone,” spoke with Melena Ryzik, a k a the Carpetbagger, at 