ion': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/63ee0837-5ab6-5e9f-8e31-ea7b56642c6e', 'word_count': 235, 'uri': 'nyt://article/63ee0837-5ab6-5e9f-8e31-ea7b56642c6e'}, {'abstract': 'David Pogue says it’s been a long, patient slog for Google to get here, but with year after year of careful tweaks and improvements — and a jaw-dropping $250 price — the Chromebook is finally ready for prime time.', 'web_url': 'https://pogue.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/29/laptop-buyers-should-pay-some-attention-to-the-chromebook/', 'snippet': 'David Pogue says it’s been a long, patient slog for Google to get here, but with year after year of careful tweaks and improvements — and a jaw-dropping $250 price — the Chromebook is finally ready for prime time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There seem to be a trillion variations on tablet/laptops these days. There are laptops with keyboards that slide, with screens that flip, with hinges that bend backward. I have a strong feeling most of them will wind up in the junk drawers of history.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/technology/29pogue-chromebook/29pogue-chromebook-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 619, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/technology/29pogue-chromebook/29pogue-chromebook-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 619, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/29/technology/29pogue-chromebook/29pogue-chromebook-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/29/technology/29pogue-chromebook/29pogue-chromebook-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 7