 the United Nations ambassador, be nominated for Secretary of State, one issue likely to arise during confirmation hearings, aside from the lethal attack on the American Mission in Benghazi, Libya, is her large stock holdings in TransCanada, the company seeking an American permit to build the proposed the Keystone XL pipeline.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Stake in Keystone Pipeline Is Potential Conflict for Susan Rice', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Keystone Pipeline System', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rice, Susan E', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'TransCanada Corporation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-29T23:55:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dan Frosch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Frosch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b01e001c-bbb7-53c8-a4a4-01f1a8f28c85', 'word_count': 592, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b01e001c-bbb7-53c8-a4a4-01f1a8f28c85'}, {'abstract': 'On Nov. 17, 140 guests witnessed Nicole Duignan and Joshua Pittman’s wedding at St. Frances Xavier Cabrini Shrine, Ms. Duignan’s childhood church, in Washington Heights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/12/02/fashion/weddings/nicole-duignan-and-joshua-pittman.html', 'snippet': 'On Nov. 17, 140 guests witnessed Nicole Duignan and Joshua Pittman’s wedding at St. Frances Xavier Cabrini Shrine, Ms. Duignan’s childhood church, in Washington Heights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A BROKEN heart is as common to being a teenager as acne and anxiety. All three usually heal with time, but when Nicole Duignan and Joshua Pittman’s romance fell apart, Ms. Duignan knew she had lost more than just a high school sweetheart. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/12/02/fashion/VOWS-1/VOWS-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 372, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/12/02/fashion/VOWS-1/VOWS-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 372}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/12/02/fashion/VOWS-1/VOWS-1-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/12/02/fashion/VOWS-1/VOWS-1-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/12/02/fashion/VOWS-1/VOWS-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/12/02/fashion/VOWS-1/VOWS-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/12/02/fashion/VOWS-1/VOWS-1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Nicole Duignan and Joshua Pittman', 'kicker': 'Vows', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nicole Duignan and Joshua Pittman', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engage