', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL QAEDA', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drones (Pilotless Planes)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-30T02:17:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/14076e34-904f-5507-82d3-5f57314aa3df', 'word_count': 611, 'uri': 'nyt://article/14076e34-904f-5507-82d3-5f57314aa3df'}, {'abstract': 'Picture-taking during the sexual abuse trial of an ultra-Orthodox Jewish counselor prompts concerns about witness intimidation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/30/nyregion/in-ultra-orthodox-sexual-abuse-trial-4-arrests-for-photos-of-witness.html', 'snippet': 'Picture-taking during the sexual abuse trial of an ultra-Orthodox Jewish counselor prompts concerns about witness intimidation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The trial of an ultra-Orthodox Jewish counselor accused of repeatedly molesting a girl was disrupted on Thursday afternoon when four spectators in a Brooklyn courtroom were accused of taking pictures with their cellphones of the accuser on the witness stand.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/nyregion/WEBERMAN/WEBERMAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 451, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/nyregion/WEBERMAN/WEBERMAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 451, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, '