'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/a2fc7764-a3ef-5ef1-9bcf-8b6050a436b5'}, {'abstract': '“Shady Lady” tells the story of an Australian bombing raid contending with storms, crashes and bad omens.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/30/movies/shady-lady-a-docudrama-by-tristan-loraine.html', 'snippet': '“Shady Lady” tells the story of an Australian bombing raid contending with storms, crashes and bad omens.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Shady Lady” is a docudrama born out of love for aviation history and a scrupulous, reverent devotion to period details. Though the film falters, the World War II story that inspired it — a B-24 bombing mission seemingly cursed from the outset (beginning on a Friday the 13th), flying from Australia to destroy enemy refineries in Borneo — is certainly compelling. Its crew members survived tropical thunderstorms, antiaircraft fire, attacks from Japanese Zeros, low fuel and a perilous landing on Australia’s remote north coast, where they were aided by aborigines. The flight is widely believed to have been the longest airplane bombing mission up to that time.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/arts/30RDP_SHADY_SPAN/30RDP_SHADY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/30/arts/30RDP_SHADY_SPAN/30RDP_SHADY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/arts/30RDP_SHADY_SPAN/30RDP_SHADY_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 574, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/arts/30RDP_SHADY_SPAN/30RDP_SHADY_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'h