 least 167 people dead and 100,000 people homeless, most of them Muslims.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SITTWE, Myanmar — The Buddhist monastery on the edge of this seaside town is a picture of tranquillity, with novice monks in saffron robes finding shade under a towering tree and their teacher, U Nyarna, greeting a visitor in a sunlit prayer room.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ethnic Hatred Tears Apart a Region of Myanmar', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ethnic Hatred Tears Apart a Region of Myanmar', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Myanmar', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of Religion', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Aung San Suu Kyi', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rohingya (Ethnic Group)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Buddhism', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Religion and Belief', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rakhine State (Myanmar)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-30T02:54:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Fuller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fuller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7fcafcb0-1dd7-52f0-8b20-ce5f45e86c2d', 'word_count': 1327, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7fcafcb0-1dd7-52f0-8b20-ce5f45e86c2d'}, {'abstract': 'Interior Secretary Ken Salazar ended a longstanding dispute that pitted wilderness advocates against supporters of a Northern California oyster farm on National Seashore land.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/30/science/earth/point-reyes-oyster-farm-ordered-closed.html', 'snippet': 'Interior Secretary Ken Salazar ended a longstanding dispute that pitted wilderness advocates against supporters of a Northern California oyster farm on National Seashore land.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Interior Secretary Ken Salazar on Thursday ended a longstanding and bitter dispute that pitted wilderness advocates against supporters of a Northern California oyster farm, announcing that the farm’s lease from Point Reyes National Seashore would end on Friday as originally planned. An estuary known as Drakes Estero, where the oyster operation has existed for the last 40 years, will become a federally designated wilderness area.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/us/OYSTER-1/OYSTER-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/30/us/OYSTER-1/OYSTER-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/us/OYSTER-1/OYSTER-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 605, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/us/OYSTER-1/OYSTER-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1210, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/us/OYSTER-1/OYSTER-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/30/us/OYSTER-1/OYSTER-1-thumbStanda