ess he started in the late 1970s and the barbecue restaurant he opened with his sons three years ago. He earned more than $250,000 last year and said taxes took more than 40 percent. What’s worse, in his view, is that others — the wealthy, hiding in loopholes; the poor, living on government benefits — are not paying their fair share.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tax Burden for Most Americans Is Lower Than in the 1980s', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Complaints Aside, Most Face Lower Tax Burden Than in the Reagan ’80s', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Tax', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Inequality', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wages and Salaries', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-30T03:20:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Binyamin Appelbaum and Robert Gebeloff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Binyamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Appelbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gebeloff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d0ec59d8-dc8e-55ce-a804-559aaab4f301', 'word_count': 3455, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d0ec59d8-dc8e-55ce-a804-559aaab4f301'}, {'abstract': 'An environmental organization said that China has ignored the trade of illegally harvested lumber across its borders.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/30/world/asia/china-fuels-illegal-trade-in-timber-report-finds.html', 'snippet': 'An environmental organization said that China has ignored the trade of illegally harvested lumber across its borders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — China’s growing appetite for rosewood dining sets, hardwood floors, plywood and printer paper is helping propel a booming trade in illegally harvested timber and spurring the destruction of fragile ecosystems across the globe, a British environmental organization said in a report released on Thursday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'China Said to Fuel Illegal Trade in Timber', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'China: Naval Patrols to Expel Ships in Disputed Sea', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wood and Wood Products', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Logging Industry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Forests and Forestry', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-30T03:22:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Jacobs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jacobs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4d27d4d2-874b-5990-ba44-ffe3877367bc', 'word_count': 737, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4d27d4d2-874b-5990-ba44-ffe3877367bc'}, {'abstract': 'In “Young and Wild,” adolescents explore sexual liberation in a country not long ago liberated from the Pinochet government.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/11/30/movies/young-and-wild-by-marialy-rivas.html', 'snippet': 'In “Young and Wild,” adolescents explore sexual liberation in a country not long ago liberated from the Pinochet government.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A teenager follows the lead of her healthy libido in “Young and Wild,” from the Chilean director Marialy Rivas. Named after the character’s popular, no-holds-barred blog, this playful, drifting film opens with morning-after masturbation and takes its desultory structural cues from the Web. It’s more about adolescent attitudes than the thrust of a story, yet the film’s sexual intelligence is undone by a paralyzing voice-over and an encroaching case of the blahs.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/arts/30RDP_YOUNG_SPAN/30RDP_YOUNG_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/11/30/arts/30RDP_YOUNG_SPAN/30RDP_YOUNG_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/arts/30RDP_YOUNG_SPAN/30RDP_YOUNG_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/30/arts/30RDP_YOUNG_SPAN/30RDP_YOUNG_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 928, 'width': 1388, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': 