2012/11/30/beckham-always-did-have-the-touch/', 'snippet': 'George Vecsey salutes David Beckham, whose last M.L.S. game is Saturday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Beckham “was probably worth the $32.5 million guaranteed for five years and the $4 million he endured in his sixth and final season,” George Vescey writes on georgevecsey.com. “He earned it, by coming along at the right time in the careful maturation of M.L.S., when he could have talented teammates — maybe not the level of his old mates at Man U or with the Galácticos of Real Madrid, but players who could do something with the ball when he directed it into their path.” Read more here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Beckham Always Did Have the Touch', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beckham, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Major League Soccer', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-30T19:17:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bfbc10a3-68d7-523b-89e8-6663fa13b9f8', 'word_count': 89, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bfbc10a3-68d7-523b-89e8-6663fa13b9f8'}, {'abstract': 'Tolls will be collected again on the two bridges in the Rockaways.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/30/tolls-on-rockaway-bridges-to-resume-on-saturday/', 'snippet': 'Tolls will be collected again on the two bridges in the Rockaways.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Toll collection will resume this weekend on the two bridges in the Rockaways, the Metropolitan Transportation Authority said on Friday. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headlin