ws', '_id': 'nyt://article/f523cab9-a9ac-5a82-9e4f-af2f4736e142', 'word_count': 1534, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f523cab9-a9ac-5a82-9e4f-af2f4736e142'}, {'abstract': 'The city says the waters around New York City are again safe for recreational use after Hurricane Sandy damaged many wastewater treatment plants.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/11/30/city-lifts-advisory-on-recreational-water-activities/', 'snippet': 'The city says the waters around New York City are again safe for recreational use after Hurricane Sandy damaged many wastewater treatment plants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York City environmental officials announced on Friday that they were lifting an advisory urging people to avoid coming into contact with local waterways. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'City Lifts Advisory on Recreational Water Activities', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Department of Environmental Protection (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-11-30T19:33:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/658e406c-96b1-55a8-93a4-6ce076739678', 'word_count': 89, 'uri': 'nyt://article/658e406c-96b1-55a8-93a4-6ce076739678'}, {'abstract': 'Carson Reeves, through his Web site ScriptShadow, is leaving his footprint in the film industry with his critiques of unproduced screenplays.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/12/02/movies/carson-reeves-script-doctor-and-critic.html', 'snippet': 'Carson Reeves, through his Web site ScriptShadow, is leaving his footprint in the film industry with his critiques of unproduced screenplays.'